export const norwayEmployerCostTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"የኖርዌይ ቀጣሪ ወጪ ማስያ","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"የኖርዌይ ቀጣሪ ወጪ ማስያ 2026 — የደመወዝ ክፍያ፣ የበዓል ክፍያ እና የአሰሪ አስተዋፅዖ","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"የ 2026 የአሰሪ መዋጮ ዞን ዋጋዎችን በመጠቀም አመታዊ የኖርዌይ ደሞዝ ወጪን ይገምቱ። ግልጽ ግምቶች ጋር የበዓል ክፍያ, የጡረታ, የታክስ ክፍያ እና ሌሎች ወጪዎችን ያክሉ.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"በኖርዌይ ውስጥ ከደመወዝ ክፍያ፣ ከበዓል ክፍያ፣ ከጡረታ መዋጮ እና ከአሰሪው ብሔራዊ ኢንሹራንስ መዋጮ (arbeidsgiveravgift) ዓመታዊ የአሰሪ ወጪ ይገምቱ።","What goes into the estimate?":"በግምቱ ውስጥ ምን ይገባል?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"ጠቅላላ ዓመታዊ የደመወዝ ክፍያ አስገባ፣ የአሰሪው የተመዘገበውን የአስተዋጽኦ ዞን እና የእንቅስቃሴ አይነትን ምረጥ፣ ከዚያም የበዓል ክፍያ፣ የጡረታ እና ሌሎች ማካካሻዎችን ጨምር። ለምሳሌ፡-1,000,000በዞን I የሚሰጠው የ NOK የመዋጮ መሠረት141,000NOK የአሰሪ መዋጮ በ14.1%","How the estimate works":"ግምቱ እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"ካልኩሌተሩ የታተመውን የ 2026 ዞን ተመን ተራ እንቅስቃሴ ወይም ግብርና/አሳ ማጥመድን ይጠቀማል። የገባውን የበዓል ክፍያ፣ የታክስ ማካካሻ እና ማንኛውንም የጡረታ መዋጮ በመዋጮ ላይ ይጨምራል። በዞን ኢያ ውስጥ ለሚደረገው ተራ እንቅስቃሴ የ850,000 NOK በየድርጅት ልዩነት አበል በዚህ አመት ጥቅም ላይ የዋለውን መጠን በገባው መጠን ላይ ይተገበራል። ውጤቶቹ ዓመታዊ የእቅድ ግምቶች ናቸው; የአሠሪው የተመዘገበ ቦታ እና እንቅስቃሴ የሚመለከታቸውን ደንቦች ይወስናሉ.","Frequently asked questions":"በተደጋጋሚ የሚጠየቁ ጥያቄዎች","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"ይህ የአንድ ሰራተኛ የቤት ክፍያ ክፍያ ያሰላል?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"ቁ. የአሰሪ ወጪዎችን እና የአሰሪውን መዋጮ ብቻ ይገምታል. የተቀናሽ ታክስን ወይም ከሠራተኛው ክፍያ ላይ ተቀናሾችን አያሰላም።","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"የትኛውን የመዋጮ ዞን መምረጥ አለብኝ?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"በቀጣሪው የተመዘገበ የንግድ ቦታ ላይ የሚመለከተውን ዞን ይምረጡ እንጂ የሰራተኛውን ቋንቋ ወይም የትውልድ ሀገር አይደለም። በውጤቱ ላይ ከመተማመንዎ በፊት ማዘጋጃ ቤቱን በ Skatteateten ያረጋግጡ።","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"2% የጡረታ መዋጮ ለእያንዳንዱ ቀጣሪ ግዴታ ነው?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"ቁ. የሙያ ጡረታ ክፍያዎች በአሰሪው እና በሠራተኛ ኃይል ህጋዊ ሁኔታዎችን በማሟላት ላይ ይመረኮዛሉ. በእርስዎ ሁኔታ ላይ ሲተገበር ብቻ የጡረታ መጠን ያስገቡ; ትክክለኛው ዕቅድ ፕሪሚየም ሊለያይ ይችላል።","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"የበዓል ክፍያ እና እያንዳንዱ የቅጥር ወጪ በራስ ሰር ተካትቷል?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"ቁ. የበዓል ክፍያ መጠን እና መሠረት፣ ተቆራጭ የሚከፈል ክፍያ እና ሌሎች ወጪዎች ሊስተካከል የሚችል ግምቶች ናቸው። ኢንሹራንስ፣ የደመወዝ አስተዳደር፣ ልዩ ጥቅማጥቅሞች፣ ነፃነቶች እና የግለሰብ ሠራተኞች ገደቦች ሙሉ በሙሉ አልተዘጋጁም።","Scope and data date":"ወሰን እና የውሂብ ቀን","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"የኖርዌይ የአሰሪ አስተዋፅዖ ተመኖች በአመት የተቀመጡ እና በዞንና በእንቅስቃሴ ይለያያሉ። ይህ ካልኩሌተር ለግብር ዓመት 2026 የታተሙትን ተመኖች ይዟል, ቀን 16 ጥቅምት 2026; ኦፊሴላዊ ማመልከቻ ወይም ሕጋዊ ውሳኔ አይደለም. የወቅቱን ዋጋዎች፣ የዞን ምደባ፣ ብቁነትን እና የድርጅት አበልን በ Skattetaten ያረጋግጡ። የኋለኛው ግንባታ የቀኑን የማይንቀሳቀሱ ተመኖችን ማደስ አለበት; ይህ ገጽ ከበስተጀርባ ራሱን አያዘምንም።","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይሰራል። የደመወዝ አሃዞችዎ አልተሰቀሉም።","Estimate employer cost":"የአሰሪ ወጪ ይገምቱ","Related tools":"ተዛማጅ መሳሪያዎች","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ነጻ · በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ይሰራል","Language":"ቋንቋ","UsefulVerse":"ጠቃሚ ቁጥር","All tools":"ሁሉም መሳሪያዎች","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"ጠቅላላ ዓመታዊ ጠቅላላ የደመወዝ ክፍያ፣ NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"የበዓል-ክፍያ መሠረት፣ NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"የበዓል-ክፍያ ተመን፣%","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"ሌላ ታክስ የሚከፈል ክፍያ እና ጥቅማጥቅሞች፣ NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"የጡረታ ክፍያ፣ NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"የአሰሪ ጡረታ መዋጮ መጠን፣%","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"ሌላ አሰሪ የሚከፈልባቸው ወጭዎች፣ NOK","Employer contribution zone":"የአሰሪ መዋጮ ዞን","Activity type":"የተግባር አይነት","Ordinary activity":"ተራ እንቅስቃሴ","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"ግብርና እና አሳ ማጥመድ (ልዩ የታተሙ ዋጋዎች)","Zone I — 14.1%":"ዞን I - 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"ዞን Ia - 14.1% ተራ / 10.6% ግብርና እና አሳ ማጥመድ","Zone II — 10.6%":"ዞን II - 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"ዞን III - 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"ዞን IV - 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"ዞን IVa - 7.9% ተራ / 5.1% ግብርና እና አሳ ማጥመድ","Zone V — 0%":"ዞን V - 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"የዞን Ia ልዩነት አበል አስቀድሞ በዚህ ዓመት ጥቅም ላይ ውሏል፣ NOK","Calculate estimate":"ግምትን አስላ","Reset inputs":"ግብዓቶችን ዳግም አስጀምር","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"የአመታዊውን መጠን ያስገቡ እና የአሰሪው ዞን እና እንቅስቃሴ ይምረጡ።","Annual estimate":"Annual estimate","Gross payroll":"ጠቅላላ ደመወዝ","Holiday pay estimate":"Holiday pay estimate","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Other taxable pay and benefits","Employer pension contribution":"Employer pension contribution","Employer contribution basis":"Employer contribution basis","Employer national insurance contribution":"Employer national insurance contribution","Other employer-paid costs":"Other employer-paid costs","Estimated annual employer cost":"የተገመተው አመታዊ የአሰሪ ወጪ","Average monthly cost":"አማካይ ወርሃዊ ወጪ","Effective contribution rate":"ውጤታማ የአስተዋጽዖ መጠን","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"በዚህ ሁኔታ ጥቅም ላይ የሚውል ልዩ አበል","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"ለዚህ ግምት የሚቀረው አበል","Tax year":"የግብር ዓመት","Rate source checked":"የተመን ምንጭ ተረጋግጧል","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"እያንዳንዱ መጠን ልክ የሆነ አሉታዊ ያልሆነ ቁጥር መሆኑን እና እያንዳንዱ መቶኛ በክልል ውስጥ መሆኑን ያረጋግጡ።","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"የ850,000 NOK ገደብ በድርጅት እንጂ በሰራተኛ አይደለም። በዚህ የቀን መቁጠሪያ ዓመት በድርጅቱ ቀድሞውኑ ጥቅም ላይ የዋለውን መጠን ያስገቡ።","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"የኖርዌይ ዞኖች የአሰሪው የተመዘገበበትን ቦታ ይከተላሉ። የስካቴቴቴን ማዘጋጃ ቤት ፍለጋን ተጠቀም; ገጹ ከቋንቋዎ ዞን አይገልጽም.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"የበዓል ክፍያ እና የጡረታ ተመኖች ማረም የሚችሉ የእቅድ ግብዓቶች ናቸው። በእርስዎ ውል እና እቅድ ላይ የሚመለከተውን መጠን እና ተቆራጭ መሰረት ይጠቀሙ።","No account or server upload is used.":"ምንም መለያ ወይም የአገልጋይ ጭነት ጥቅም ላይ አይውልም።","Compare a second offer":"ሁለተኛ ቅናሽ ያወዳድሩ","Offer B":"ቅናሽ ለ","Offer comparison":"የአቅርቦት ንጽጽር","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"ሁለቱም ቅናሾች ከላይ የተመረጠውን የአሰሪ ዞን እና እንቅስቃሴን ይጠቀማሉ። እያንዳንዱ አማራጭ የቀረውን ዞን Ia አበል በተናጠል ይሠራል; ሁለቱ ሁኔታዎች አማራጮች ናቸው እና አንድ ላይ መደመር የለባቸውም።","Offer A":"ቅናሽ ሀ","Difference (B − A)":"ልዩነት (B - ሀ)"},"ar":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"حاسبة تكلفة صاحب العمل في النرويج","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"حاسبة تكلفة صاحب العمل في النرويج 2026 — كشوف المرتبات وأجور العطلات ومساهمة صاحب العمل","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"تقدير تكلفة الرواتب النرويجية السنوية باستخدام معدلات منطقة مساهمة صاحب العمل 2026. أضف أجر الإجازة والمعاش التقاعدي والأجور الخاضعة للضريبة والتكاليف الأخرى مع افتراضات واضحة.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"تقدير التكلفة السنوية لصاحب العمل في النرويج من كشوف المرتبات وأجور العطلات ومساهمات المعاشات التقاعدية ومساهمة التأمين الوطني لصاحب العمل (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"ما الذي يدخل في التقدير؟","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"أدخل إجمالي الرواتب السنوية، واختر منطقة المساهمة المسجلة لصاحب العمل ونوع النشاط، ثم أضف أجر الإجازة والمعاش التقاعدي والتعويضات الأخرى. على سبيل المثال، 1,000,000 NOK من أساس المساهمة في المنطقة I يعطي 141,000 NOK من مساهمة صاحب العمل بنسبة 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"كيفية عمل التقدير","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"تستخدم الآلة الحاسبة معدل المنطقة 2026 المنشور للنشاط العادي أو الزراعة/صيد الأسماك. ويضيف دخل الإجازة المدفوعة، والتعويض الخاضع للضريبة وأي مساهمة في المعاش التقاعدي إلى أساس المساهمة. بالنسبة للنشاط العادي في المنطقة Ia، يتم تطبيق البدل التفاضلي 850,000 NOK لكل مؤسسة على المبلغ الذي تم إدخاله كما تم استخدامه بالفعل هذا العام. النتائج هي تقديرات التخطيط السنوي. يحدد الموقع والنشاط المسجل لصاحب العمل القواعد المعمول بها.","Frequently asked questions":"الأسئلة المتداولة","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"هل يؤدي هذا إلى حساب الراتب الذي يأخذه الموظف إلى المنزل؟","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"لا. ويقدر تكاليف صاحب العمل ومساهمة صاحب العمل فقط. ولا يحسب الضريبة المقتطعة أو الخصومات من أجر الموظف.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"ما هي منطقة المساهمة التي يجب أن أختارها؟","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"اختر المنطقة التي تنطبق على موقع العمل المسجل لصاحب العمل، وليس لغة الموظف أو بلده الأصلي. تأكد من البلدية مع Skatteetaten قبل الاعتماد على النتيجة.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"هل مساهمة المعاش التقاعدي 2% إلزامية لكل صاحب عمل؟","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"رقم. تعتمد واجبات التقاعد المهني على ما إذا كان صاحب العمل والقوى العاملة يستوفيان الشروط القانونية. أدخل معدل المعاش التقاعدي فقط عندما ينطبق على حالتك؛ يمكن أن يختلف قسط المخطط الفعلي.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"هل يتم تضمين أجر الإجازة وكل تكاليف التوظيف تلقائيًا؟","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"رقم. إن معدل وأساس أجر الإجازة، والرواتب الداخلة في حساب المعاش التقاعدي والتكاليف الأخرى هي افتراضات قابلة للتحرير. لم يتم تصميم التأمين وإدارة الرواتب والمزايا الخاصة والإعفاءات وحدود الموظفين الفرديين بشكل كامل.","Scope and data date":"النطاق وتاريخ البيانات","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"يتم تحديد معدلات مساهمة أصحاب العمل النرويجيين حسب السنة وتختلف حسب المنطقة والنشاط. تحتوي هذه الآلة الحاسبة على المعدلات المنشورة للسنة الضريبية 2026، بتاريخ 16 أكتوبر 2026؛ إنه ليس إيداعًا رسميًا أو قرارًا قانونيًا. تحقق من الأسعار الحالية ووضع المنطقة والأهلية والبدل لكل مؤسسة مع Skatteetaten. يجب أن يقوم الإصدار الأحدث بتحديث المعدلات الثابتة المؤرخة؛ هذه الصفحة لا تقوم بتحديث نفسها في الخلفية.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"يتم تشغيله في هذا المتصفح. لم يتم تحميل أرقام الرواتب الخاصة بك.","Estimate employer cost":"تقدير تكلفة صاحب العمل","Related tools":"أدوات ذات صلة","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مجاني · يعمل في متصفحك","Language":"اللغة","UsefulVerse":"آية مفيدة","All tools":"جميع الأدوات","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"إجمالي كشوف المرتبات السنوية، كرونة نرويجية","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"أساس الأجر أثناء العطلات، كرونة نرويجية","Holiday-pay rate, %":"معدل أجر الإجازة، %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"الأجور والمزايا الأخرى الخاضعة للضريبة، NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"كشوف المرتبات الخاضعة للمعاش التقاعدي، NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"معدل مساهمة معاش صاحب العمل، %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"التكاليف الأخرى التي يدفعها صاحب العمل، كرونة نرويجية","Employer contribution zone":"منطقة مساهمة صاحب العمل","Activity type":"نوع النشاط","Ordinary activity":"نشاط عادي","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"الزراعة وصيد الأسماك (أسعار منشورة خاصة)","Zone I — 14.1%":"المنطقة الأولى — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"المنطقة Ia — 14.1% عادي / 10.6% الزراعة وصيد الأسماك","Zone II — 10.6%":"المنطقة II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"المنطقة III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"المنطقة IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"المنطقة IVa — 7.9% عادي / 5.1% الزراعة وصيد الأسماك","Zone V — 0%":"المنطقة V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"البدل التفاضلي للمنطقة Ia المستخدم بالفعل هذا العام، كرونة نرويجية","Calculate estimate":"حساب التقدير","Reset inputs":"إعادة ضبط المدخلات","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"أدخل المبالغ السنوية واختر منطقة ونشاط صاحب العمل.","Annual estimate":"التقدير السنوي","Gross payroll":"إجمالي الرواتب","Holiday pay estimate":"تقدير أجر الإجازة","Other taxable pay and benefits":"الرواتب والمزايا الأخرى الخاضعة للضريبة","Employer pension contribution":"مساهمة معاش صاحب العمل","Employer contribution basis":"أساس مساهمة صاحب العمل","Employer national insurance contribution":"مساهمة التأمين الوطني لصاحب العمل","Other employer-paid costs":"التكاليف الأخرى التي يدفعها صاحب العمل","Estimated annual employer cost":"التكلفة السنوية المقدرة لصاحب العمل","Average monthly cost":"متوسط التكلفة الشهرية","Effective contribution rate":"معدل المساهمة الفعال","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"البدل التفاضلي المستخدم في هذا السيناريو","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"البدل المتبقي لهذا التقدير","Tax year":"السنة الضريبية","Rate source checked":"تم التحقق من مصدر السعر","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"تأكد من أن كل مبلغ هو رقم صالح وغير سالب وأن كل نسبة مئوية تقع ضمن النطاق.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"حد 850,000 NOK لكل مؤسسة، وليس لكل موظف. أدخل المبلغ الذي استخدمته المؤسسة بالفعل في هذا العام التقويمي.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"تتبع المناطق النرويجية الموقع المسجل لصاحب العمل. استخدم بحث بلدية سكاتيتاتن؛ الصفحة لا تستنتج منطقة من لغتك.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"أجور العطلات ومعدلات المعاشات التقاعدية هي مدخلات تخطيط قابلة للتحرير. استخدم المعدل وقاعدة المعاش التقاعدي التي تنطبق على العقد والمخطط الخاص بك.","No account or server upload is used.":"لا يتم استخدام أي حساب أو تحميل خادم.","Compare a second offer":"قارن العرض الثاني","Offer B":"العرض ب","Offer comparison":"مقارنة العروض","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"يستخدم كلا العرضين منطقة صاحب العمل والنشاط المحدد أعلاه. يطبق كل بديل بدل المنطقة Ia المتبقي بشكل منفصل؛ السيناريوهين بديلان ولا يجب إضافتهما معًا.","Offer A":"العرض أ","Difference (B − A)":"الفرق (B - A)"},"bg":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Калкулатор на разходите за работодател в Норвегия","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Калкулатор на разходите на работодателя в Норвегия 2026 — Заплата, заплащане за почивка и вноска от работодателя","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Оценете годишните разходи за заплати в Норвегия, като използвате 2026 зоновите ставки за вноски на работодателя. Добавете заплащане за почивка, пенсия, облагаемо заплащане и други разходи с ясни допускания.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Оценете годишните разходи на работодателя в Норвегия от заплати, ваканционни плащания, пенсионни вноски и национални осигурителни вноски на работодателя (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Какво влиза в прогнозата?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Въведете общата годишна заплата, изберете регистрираната зона на вноски на работодателя и вид дейност, след което добавете празнични плащания, пенсия и други компенсации. Например 1,000,000 NOK от базата на вноските в зона I дава 141,000 NOK от вноските на работодателя при 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Как работи оценката","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Калкулаторът използва публикуваната зона 2026 за обикновена дейност или селско стопанство/риболов. Той добавя въведеното заплащане за отпуск, облагаемото обезщетение и всички пенсионни вноски към основата на вноските. За обикновена дейност в зона Ia, 850,000 NOK за предприятие диференциална надбавка се прилага към сумата, въведена като вече използвана тази година. Резултатите са годишни прогнози за планиране; регистрираното местоположение и дейност на работодателя определят приложимите правила.","Frequently asked questions":"Често задавани въпроси","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Това изчислява ли заплащането на служителя за вкъщи?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Бр. Той оценява разходите на работодателя и само вноската на работодателя. Той не изчислява данък при източника или удръжки от заплатата на служителя.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Коя зона на принос трябва да избера?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Изберете зоната, която се прилага за регистрираното бизнес местоположение на работодателя, а не за езика или родната страна на служителя. Проверете общината със Skatteetaten, преди да разчитате на резултата.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Задължителна ли е пенсионната вноска от 2% за всеки работодател?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Бр. Задълженията за професионална пенсия зависят от това дали работодателят и работната сила отговарят на законовите условия. Въведете размер на пенсията само когато се отнася за вашата ситуация; действителната премия по схемата може да се различава.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Включени ли са автоматично заплащането за отпуск и всички разходи за наемане?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Бр. Ставката и базата на заплащане за отпуск, пенсионната ведомост и други разходи са допускания, които могат да се редактират. Застраховките, администрирането на заплатите, специалните придобивки, освобождаванията и индивидуалните ограничения на служителите не са напълно моделирани.","Scope and data date":"Обхват и дата на данните","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Норвежките вноски на работодателя се определят по години и варират според зоната и дейността. Този калкулатор съдържа ставките, публикувани за данъчна година 2026 с дата 16 октомври 2026; това не е официално подаване или правно решение. Проверете текущите ставки, разположението на зоната, допустимостта и надбавката за предприятие със Skatteetaten. По-късна компилация трябва да обнови датираните статични скорости; тази страница не се актуализира на заден план.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Изпълнява се в този браузър. Вашите данни за заплати не са качени.","Estimate employer cost":"Приблизителна оценка на разходите на работодателя","Related tools":"Свързани инструменти","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗПЛАТНО · ПУСКА ВЪВ ВАШИЯ БРАУЗЪР","Language":"Език","UsefulVerse":"Полезен стих","All tools":"Всички инструменти","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Обща годишна брутна заплата, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Основно заплащане за отпуск, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Ставка за отпуск, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Други облагаеми заплати и обезщетения, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Заплатена ведомост за пенсия, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Размер на пенсионната вноска на работодателя, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Други разходи, платени от работодателя, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Зона за принос на работодателя","Activity type":"Тип дейност","Ordinary activity":"Обикновена дейност","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Селско стопанство и риболов (специално публикувани цени)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Зона I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Зона Ia — 14.1% обикновени / 10.6% селско стопанство и риболов","Zone II — 10.6%":"Зона II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Зона III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Зона IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Зона IVa — 7.9% обикновен / 5.1% селско стопанство и риболов","Zone V — 0%":"Зона V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Диференциалната надбавка за зона Ia вече се използва тази година, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Изчисляване на оценка","Reset inputs":"Нулиране на входове","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Въведете годишните суми и изберете зоната и дейността на работодателя.","Annual estimate":"Годишна оценка","Gross payroll":"Брутна заплата","Holiday pay estimate":"Прогноза за заплащане на празниците","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Други облагаеми заплати и обезщетения","Employer pension contribution":"Пенсионна вноска на работодател","Employer contribution basis":"Основа на вноската на работодателя","Employer national insurance contribution":"Национална осигурителна вноска на работодателя","Other employer-paid costs":"Други разходи, платени от работодателя","Estimated annual employer cost":"Прогнозни годишни разходи на работодателя","Average monthly cost":"Средна месечна цена","Effective contribution rate":"Ефективен процент на вноска","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Диференциална надбавка, използвана от този сценарий","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Оставаща надбавка за тази оценка","Tax year":"Данъчна година","Rate source checked":"Източникът на тарифата е проверен","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Проверете дали всяка сума е валидно неотрицателно число и всеки процент е в диапазона.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Прагът 850,000 NOK е за предприятие, а не за служител. Въведете сумата, която вече е използвана от предприятието през тази календарна година.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Норвежките зони следват регистрираното местоположение на работодателя. Използвайте търсенето на община Skatteetaten; страницата не извежда зона от вашия език.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Ставките за отпуска и пенсиите са въведени данни за планиране, които могат да се редактират. Използвайте ставката и пенсионната основа, които се прилагат към вашия договор и схема.","No account or server upload is used.":"Не се използва акаунт или качване на сървър.","Compare a second offer":"Сравнете втора оферта","Offer B":"Оферта B","Offer comparison":"Сравнение на оферти","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"И двете оферти използват зоната на работодателя и дейността, избрани по-горе. Всяка алтернатива прилага отделно оставащото квоти за зона Ia; двата сценария са алтернативни и не трябва да се събират заедно.","Offer A":"Оферта A","Difference (B − A)":"Разлика (B − A)"},"bn":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"নরওয়ে নিয়োগকর্তা খরচ ক্যালকুলেটর","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"নরওয়ে নিয়োগকর্তা খরচ ক্যালকুলেটর 2026 — বেতন, ছুটির বেতন এবং নিয়োগকর্তার অবদান","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 নিয়োগকর্তা অবদান জোনের হার ব্যবহার করে বার্ষিক নরওয়েজিয়ান বেতনের খরচ অনুমান করুন। ছুটির বেতন, পেনশন, করযোগ্য বেতন এবং স্পষ্ট অনুমান সহ অন্যান্য খরচ যোগ করুন।","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"বেতন, ছুটির বেতন, পেনশন অবদান এবং নিয়োগকর্তার জাতীয় বীমা অবদান (arbeidsgiveravgift) থেকে নরওয়েতে নিয়োগকর্তার বার্ষিক খরচ অনুমান করুন।","What goes into the estimate?":"কি অনুমানে যায়?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"মোট বার্ষিক বেতন লিখুন, নিয়োগকর্তার নিবন্ধিত অবদান অঞ্চল এবং কার্যকলাপের ধরন চয়ন করুন, তারপর ছুটির বেতন, পেনশন এবং অন্যান্য ক্ষতিপূরণ যোগ করুন। উদাহরণস্বরূপ, জোন I-এ অবদানের ভিত্তিতে 1,000,000 NOK 14.1%-এ নিয়োগকর্তার অবদানের 141,000 NOK দেয়।","How the estimate works":"কিভাবে অনুমান কাজ করে","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"সাধারণ কার্যকলাপ বা কৃষি/মাছ ধরার জন্য ক্যালকুলেটর প্রকাশিত 2026 জোন রেট ব্যবহার করে। এটি অবদানের ভিত্তিতে প্রবেশ করা ছুটির বেতন, করযোগ্য ক্ষতিপূরণ এবং যেকোনো পেনশন অবদান যোগ করে। জোন Ia-এ সাধারণ ক্রিয়াকলাপের জন্য, 850,000 NOK প্রতি-এন্টারপ্রাইজ ডিফারেনশিয়াল অ্যালাউন্স এই বছরে ইতিমধ্যে ব্যবহৃত হিসাবে প্রবেশ করা পরিমাণে প্রয়োগ করা হয়। ফলাফল বার্ষিক পরিকল্পনা অনুমান; নিয়োগকর্তার নিবন্ধিত অবস্থান এবং কার্যকলাপ প্রযোজ্য নিয়ম নির্ধারণ করে।","Frequently asked questions":"প্রায়শই জিজ্ঞাসিত প্রশ্ন","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"এটি কি একজন কর্মচারীর বাড়িতে নেওয়া বেতনের হিসাব করে?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"না। এটি শুধুমাত্র নিয়োগকর্তার খরচ এবং নিয়োগকর্তার অবদান অনুমান করে। এটি একটি কর্মচারীর বেতন থেকে কর্তন বা কর্তনের হিসাব করে না।","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"আমি কোন অবদান জোন বেছে নেব?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"নিয়োগকর্তার নিবন্ধিত ব্যবসায়িক অবস্থানের ক্ষেত্রে প্রযোজ্য অঞ্চলটি বেছে নিন, কর্মচারীর ভাষা বা নিজ দেশ নয়৷ ফলাফলের উপর নির্ভর করার আগে Skatteetaten দিয়ে পৌরসভা যাচাই করুন।","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"প্রত্যেক নিয়োগকর্তার জন্য একটি 2% পেনশন অবদান কি বাধ্যতামূলক?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"না। পেশাগত পেনশন শুল্ক নিয়োগকর্তা এবং কর্মশক্তি আইনি শর্ত পূরণ করে কিনা তার উপর নির্ভর করে। একটি পেনশন হার লিখুন শুধুমাত্র যখন এটি আপনার পরিস্থিতিতে প্রযোজ্য হয়; প্রকৃত স্কিম প্রিমিয়াম ভিন্ন হতে পারে।","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"ছুটির বেতন এবং প্রতিটি নিয়োগের খরচ কি স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে অন্তর্ভুক্ত?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"না। ছুটির বেতনের হার এবং ভিত্তি, পেনশনযোগ্য বেতন এবং অন্যান্য খরচগুলি সম্পাদনাযোগ্য অনুমান। বীমা, বেতনের প্রশাসন, বিশেষ সুবিধা, ছাড় এবং পৃথক কর্মচারী সীমা সম্পূর্ণরূপে মডেল করা হয় না।","Scope and data date":"স্কোপ এবং ডেটা তারিখ","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"নরওয়েজিয়ান নিয়োগকর্তার অবদানের হারগুলি বছর অনুসারে সেট করা হয় এবং অঞ্চল এবং কার্যকলাপ অনুসারে পরিবর্তিত হয়। এই ক্যালকুলেটরে ট্যাক্স বছরের 2026, 16 অক্টোবর 2026 তারিখের জন্য প্রকাশিত হার রয়েছে; এটি একটি অফিসিয়াল ফাইলিং বা আইনি সিদ্ধান্ত নয়। বর্তমান হার, জোন বসানো, যোগ্যতা এবং প্রতি-এন্টারপ্রাইজ ভাতা Skatteetaten-এর সাথে যাচাই করুন। একটি পরবর্তী বিল্ড তারিখের স্ট্যাটিক হার রিফ্রেশ করা আবশ্যক; এই পৃষ্ঠাটি পটভূমিতে নিজেকে আপডেট করে না।","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"এই ব্রাউজারে চলে। আপনার বেতনের পরিসংখ্যান আপলোড করা হয় না.","Estimate employer cost":"নিয়োগকর্তার খরচ অনুমান করুন","Related tools":"সম্পর্কিত টুলস","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ফ্রি · আপনার ব্রাউজারে চলে","Language":"ভাষা","UsefulVerse":"উপযোগী পদ্য","All tools":"সমস্ত টুলস","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"মোট বার্ষিক গ্রস বেতন, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"ছুটির বেতনের ভিত্তিতে, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"ছুটির বেতনের হার, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"অন্যান্য করযোগ্য বেতন এবং সুবিধা, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"পেনশনযোগ্য বেতন, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"নিয়োগকর্তা পেনশন অবদানের হার, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"অন্যান্য নিয়োগকর্তা-প্রদত্ত খরচ, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"নিয়োগদাতা অবদান অঞ্চল","Activity type":"ক্রিয়াকলাপ প্রকার","Ordinary activity":"সাধারণ কার্যকলাপ","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"কৃষি এবং মাছ ধরা (বিশেষ প্রকাশিত হার)","Zone I — 14.1%":"জোন I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"জোন Ia — 14.1% সাধারণ / 10.6% কৃষি এবং মাছ ধরা","Zone II — 10.6%":"জোন II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"জোন III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"জোন IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"জোন IVa — 7.9% সাধারণ / 5.1% কৃষি এবং মাছ ধরা","Zone V — 0%":"জোন V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"জোন Ia ডিফারেনশিয়াল ভাতা এই বছর ইতিমধ্যেই ব্যবহৃত হয়েছে, NOK","Calculate estimate":"আনুমানিক হিসাব করুন","Reset inputs":"ইনপুট রিসেট করুন","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"বার্ষিক পরিমাণ লিখুন এবং নিয়োগকর্তার অঞ্চল এবং কার্যকলাপ চয়ন করুন।","Annual estimate":"বার্ষিক অনুমান","Gross payroll":"গ্রস বেতন","Holiday pay estimate":"ছুটির বেতন অনুমান","Other taxable pay and benefits":"অন্যান্য করযোগ্য বেতন এবং সুবিধা","Employer pension contribution":"নিয়োগকর্তা পেনশন অবদান","Employer contribution basis":"নিয়োগকর্তার অবদানের ভিত্তিতে","Employer national insurance contribution":"নিয়োগকর্তার জাতীয় বীমা অবদান","Other employer-paid costs":"অন্যান্য নিয়োগকর্তা-প্রদত্ত খরচ","Estimated annual employer cost":"আনুমানিক বার্ষিক নিয়োগকর্তা খরচ","Average monthly cost":"গড় মাসিক খরচ","Effective contribution rate":"কার্যকর অবদানের হার","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"এই দৃশ্যের দ্বারা ব্যবহৃত ডিফারেনশিয়াল ভাতা","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"এই অনুমানের জন্য বাকি ভাতা","Tax year":"কর বছর","Rate source checked":"রেট উত্স চেক করা হয়েছে৷","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"প্রতিটি পরিমাণ একটি বৈধ নন-নেতিবাচক সংখ্যা এবং প্রতিটি শতাংশ সীমার মধ্যে রয়েছে কিনা তা পরীক্ষা করুন।","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK থ্রেশহোল্ড এন্টারপ্রাইজ প্রতি, কর্মচারী পিছু নয়। এই ক্যালেন্ডার বছরে এন্টারপ্রাইজের দ্বারা ইতিমধ্যে ব্যবহৃত পরিমাণ লিখুন৷","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"নরওয়েজিয়ান অঞ্চলগুলি নিয়োগকর্তার নিবন্ধিত অবস্থান অনুসরণ করে। Skatteetaten এর পৌরসভা লুকআপ ব্যবহার করুন; পৃষ্ঠাটি আপনার ভাষা থেকে একটি জোন অনুমান করে না।","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"ছুটির বেতন এবং পেনশনের হার হল সম্পাদনাযোগ্য পরিকল্পনা ইনপুট। আপনার চুক্তি এবং স্কিমে প্রযোজ্য হার এবং পেনশনযোগ্য ভিত্তি ব্যবহার করুন।","No account or server upload is used.":"কোন অ্যাকাউন্ট বা সার্ভার আপলোড ব্যবহার করা হয় না।","Compare a second offer":"একটি দ্বিতীয় অফার তুলনা করুন","Offer B":"অফার বি","Offer comparison":"অফার তুলনা","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"উভয় অফারই উপরে নির্বাচিত নিয়োগকর্তা অঞ্চল এবং কার্যকলাপ ব্যবহার করে। প্রতিটি বিকল্প আলাদাভাবে অবশিষ্ট জোন Ia ভাতা প্রয়োগ করে; দুটি পরিস্থিতি বিকল্প এবং একসাথে যোগ করা উচিত নয়।","Offer A":"অফার A","Difference (B − A)":"পার্থক্য (B − A)"},"ca":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Calculadora de costos de l'empresari de Noruega","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Calculadora de costos de l'empresari de Noruega 2026: nòmina, pagament de vacances i contribució de l'empresari","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Estimeu el cost anual de la nòmina noruega utilitzant les taxes de la zona de cotització de l'empresari 2026. Afegiu el pagament de vacances, la pensió, el pagament imposable i altres costos amb hipòtesis clares.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Estimació del cost anual de l'empresari a Noruega a partir de la nòmina, el pagament de vacances, les contribucions a les pensions i la contribució de l'assegurança nacional de l'empresari (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Què inclou l'estimació?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Introduïu la nòmina anual total, trieu la zona de cotització registrada de l'empresari i el tipus d'activitat i, a continuació, afegiu el pagament de vacances, la pensió i altres compensacions. Per exemple, 1,000,000 NOK de la base de cotització a la zona I dóna 141,000 NOK de la contribució de l'empresari a 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Com funciona el pressupost","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"La calculadora utilitza la taxa de zona 2026 publicada per a l'activitat ordinària o l'agricultura/pesca. Afegeix a la base de cotització la paga de vacances introduïda, la compensació imposable i qualsevol contribució a la pensió. Per a l'activitat ordinària a la zona Ia, s'aplica el subsidi diferencial 850,000 NOK per empresa a l'import introduït com ja s'ha utilitzat aquest any. Els resultats són estimacions de planificació anual; la ubicació i l'activitat registrada de l'empresari determinen les normes aplicables.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntes més freqüents","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Això calcula el salari net d'un empleat?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Núm. Només estima els costos de l'empresari i la contribució de l'empresari. No calcula retencions a la font ni deduccions del sou d'un empleat.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Quina zona de contribució he de triar?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Trieu la zona que s'aplica a la ubicació comercial registrada de l'empresari, no a l'idioma o el país d'origen de l'empleat. Verifiqueu el municipi amb Skatteetaten abans de confiar en el resultat.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"És obligatòria una contribució a la pensió de 2% per a tots els ocupadors?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Núm. Els deures de pensions laborals depenen de si l'empresari i la plantilla compleixen les condicions legals. Introduïu una taxa de pensió només quan correspongui a la vostra situació; la prima real del règim pot variar.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"S'inclouen automàticament el pagament de vacances i tots els costos de contractació?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Núm. La taxa i la base de pagament de vacances, la nòmina pensionable i altres costos són supòsits editables. Les assegurances, l'administració de nòmines, els beneficis especials, les exempcions i els límits individuals dels empleats no estan totalment modelats.","Scope and data date":"Àmbit i data de les dades","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Les taxes de cotització de l'empresari noruec s'estableixen per any i varien segons la zona i l'activitat. Aquesta calculadora conté les taxes publicades per a l'any fiscal 2026, amb data 16 d'octubre 2026; no és una presentació oficial ni una decisió legal. Verifiqueu les tarifes actuals, la ubicació de la zona, l'elegibilitat i el subsidi per empresa amb Skatteetaten. Una versió posterior ha d'actualitzar les taxes estàtiques datades; aquesta pàgina no s'actualitza en segon pla.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"S'executa en aquest navegador. Les vostres xifres de nòmines no es pengen.","Estimate employer cost":"Cost estimat de l'empresari","Related tools":"Eines relacionades","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUÏT · EXECUCIÓ AL TEU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Vers útil","All tools":"Totes les eines","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Nòmina bruta anual total, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Base de pagament de vacances, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Taxa de pagament de vacances, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Altres pagaments i beneficis imposables, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Nòmina pensionable, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Taxa de cotització de pensions de l'empresari, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Altres costos pagats per l'empresari, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Zona de cotització de l'empresari","Activity type":"Tipus d'activitat","Ordinary activity":"Activitat ordinària","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Agricultura i pesca (tarifes especials publicades)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zona I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zona Ia — 14.1% ordinari / 10.6% agricultura i pesca","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zona II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zona III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zona IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zona IVa — 7.9% ordinari / 5.1% agricultura i pesca","Zone V — 0%":"Zona V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"La dotació diferencial de la zona Ia ja s'ha utilitzat aquest any, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Calcular estimació","Reset inputs":"Restablir entrades","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Introduïu els imports anuals i trieu la zona i l'activitat de l'empresari.","Annual estimate":"Estimació anual","Gross payroll":"Nòmina bruta","Holiday pay estimate":"Presentació de la paga de vacances","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Altres pagues i beneficis imposables","Employer pension contribution":"Aportació de pensions de l'empresari","Employer contribution basis":"Base de cotització de l'empresari","Employer national insurance contribution":"Cotització patronal a l'assegurança nacional","Other employer-paid costs":"Altres costos pagats per l'empresari","Estimated annual employer cost":"Cost anual estimat de l'empresari","Average monthly cost":"Cost mitjà mensual","Effective contribution rate":"Taxa de cotització efectiva","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Subsistència diferencial utilitzada per aquest escenari","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Subrogació restant per a aquesta estimació","Tax year":"Any fiscal","Rate source checked":"La font de la tarifa s'ha comprovat","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Comproveu que cada quantitat sigui un nombre vàlid no negatiu i que cada percentatge estigui dins de l'interval.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"El llindar 850,000 NOK és per empresa, no per empleat. Introduïu l'import que ja ha utilitzat l'empresa aquest any natural.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Les zones noruegues segueixen la ubicació registrada de l'empresari. Utilitzeu la cerca municipal de Skatteetaten; la pàgina no dedueix una zona del vostre idioma.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Les taxes de pagament i pensions de vacances són entrades de planificació editables. Utilitzeu la taxa i la base pensionable que s'apliquen al vostre contracte i règim.","No account or server upload is used.":"No s'utilitza cap càrrega de compte o servidor.","Compare a second offer":"Compara una segona oferta","Offer B":"Oferta B","Offer comparison":"Comparació d'ofertes","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Les dues ofertes utilitzen la zona de l'empresari i l'activitat seleccionades anteriorment. Cada alternativa aplica la bonificació de la zona Ia restant per separat; els dos escenaris són alternatius i no s'han de sumar.","Offer A":"Oferta A","Difference (B − A)":"Diferència (B - A)"},"de":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Arbeitgeberkostenrechner für Norwegen","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Norwegischer Arbeitgeberkostenrechner 2026 – Gehaltsabrechnung, Urlaubsgeld und Arbeitgeberbeiträge","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Schätzen Sie die jährlichen norwegischen Lohn- und Gehaltskosten anhand der 2026 Arbeitgeberbeitragszonensätze. Fügen Sie Urlaubsgeld, Rente, steuerpflichtiges Gehalt und andere Kosten mit klaren Annahmen hinzu.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Schätzen Sie die jährlichen Arbeitgeberkosten in Norwegen anhand der Lohn- und Gehaltsabrechnung, des Urlaubsgeldes, der Rentenbeiträge und des Arbeitgeberbeitrags zur Sozialversicherung (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Was fließt in den Kostenvoranschlag ein?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Geben Sie die jährliche Gesamtlohnsumme ein, wählen Sie den registrierten Beitragsbereich und die Aktivitätsart des Arbeitgebers aus und fügen Sie dann Urlaubsgeld, Rente und andere Vergütungen hinzu. Beispielsweise ergibt 1,000,000 NOK der Beitragsbasis in Zone I 141,000 NOK des Arbeitgeberbeitrags bei 14.1 %.","How the estimate works":"So funktioniert die Schätzung","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Der Rechner verwendet den veröffentlichten Zonentarif 2026 für normale Aktivitäten oder Landwirtschaft/Fischerei. Zur Beitragsbasis werden das eingetragene Urlaubsgeld, die steuerpflichtige Vergütung und etwaige Rentenbeiträge hinzugerechnet. Für gewöhnliche Aktivitäten in Zone Ia wird der 850,000 NOK-Differenzzuschuss pro Unternehmen auf den in diesem Jahr bereits verwendeten Betrag angewendet. Ergebnisse sind jährliche Planungsschätzungen; Der eingetragene Standort und die Tätigkeit des Arbeitgebers bestimmen die geltenden Regeln.","Frequently asked questions":"Häufig gestellte Fragen","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Wird hiermit das Take-Home-Gehalt eines Mitarbeiters berechnet?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Nr. Es werden nur die Arbeitgeberkosten und der Arbeitgeberbeitrag geschätzt. Es werden keine Quellensteuern oder Abzüge vom Gehalt eines Mitarbeiters berechnet.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Welche Beitragszone soll ich wählen?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Wählen Sie die Zone aus, die für den registrierten Geschäftsstandort des Arbeitgebers gilt, nicht für die Sprache oder das Heimatland des Arbeitnehmers. Überprüfen Sie die Gemeinde bei Skatteetaten, bevor Sie sich auf das Ergebnis verlassen.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Ist ein Pensionsbeitrag von 2 % für jeden Arbeitgeber obligatorisch?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Nr. Die Leistungen der betrieblichen Altersvorsorge hängen davon ab, ob Arbeitgeber und Arbeitnehmer die gesetzlichen Voraussetzungen erfüllen. Geben Sie nur dann einen Rentensatz ein, wenn er auf Ihre Situation zutrifft; die tatsächliche Systemprämie kann abweichen.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Sind Urlaubsgeld und alle Einstellungskosten automatisch enthalten?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Nr. Der Satz und die Grundlage für das Urlaubsgeld, die ruhegehaltsfähige Lohn- und Gehaltsabrechnung und andere Kosten sind bearbeitbare Annahmen. Versicherungen, Lohn- und Gehaltsabrechnungen, Sonderleistungen, Befreiungen und individuelle Mitarbeitergrenzen werden nicht vollständig abgebildet.","Scope and data date":"Umfang und Datendatum","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Die norwegischen Arbeitgeberbeitragssätze werden jährlich festgelegt und variieren je nach Zone und Tätigkeit. Dieser Rechner enthält die veröffentlichten Steuersätze für das Steuerjahr 2026 vom 16 Oktober 2026; es handelt sich nicht um eine amtliche Einreichung oder gerichtliche Entscheidung. Überprüfen Sie bei Skatteetaten die aktuellen Tarife, die Zoneneinteilung, die Berechtigung und den Zuschuss pro Unternehmen. Bei einem späteren Build müssen die veralteten statischen Raten aktualisiert werden. Diese Seite aktualisiert sich nicht im Hintergrund.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Läuft in diesem Browser. Ihre Lohn- und Gehaltsabrechnungen werden nicht hochgeladen.","Estimate employer cost":"Arbeitgeberkosten schätzen","Related tools":"Verwandte Tools","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KOSTENLOS · LÄUFT IN IHREM BROWSER","Language":"Sprache","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"Alle Werkzeuge","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Gesamte jährliche Bruttolohnsumme, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Urlaubsgeldbasis, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Urlaubssatz, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Sonstige steuerpflichtige Löhne und Leistungen, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Pensionsgehaltsabrechnung, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Beitragssatz zur Arbeitgeberrente, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Sonstige vom Arbeitgeber bezahlte Kosten, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Arbeitgeberbeitragsbereich","Activity type":"Aktivitätstyp","Ordinary activity":"Gewöhnliche Aktivität","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Landwirtschaft und Fischerei (veröffentlichte Sondertarife)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zone I – 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zone Ia – 14.1 % normal / 10.6 % Landwirtschaft und Fischerei","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zone II – 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zone III – 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zone IV – 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zone IVa – 7.9 % normal / 5.1 % Landwirtschaft und Fischerei","Zone V — 0%":"Zone V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Zone Ia-Differenzzuschlag dieses Jahr bereits in Anspruch genommen, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Schätzung berechnen","Reset inputs":"Eingänge zurücksetzen","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Geben Sie die Jahresbeträge ein und wählen Sie die Zone und Tätigkeit des Arbeitgebers aus.","Annual estimate":"Jährliche Schätzung","Gross payroll":"Bruttolohnabrechnung","Holiday pay estimate":"Schätzung des Urlaubsgeldes","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Sonstige steuerpflichtige Löhne und Leistungen","Employer pension contribution":"Arbeitgeberrentenbeitrag","Employer contribution basis":"Arbeitgeberbeitragsbasis","Employer national insurance contribution":"Arbeitgeber-Sozialversicherungsbeitrag","Other employer-paid costs":"Andere vom Arbeitgeber bezahlte Kosten","Estimated annual employer cost":"Geschätzte jährliche Arbeitgeberkosten","Average monthly cost":"Durchschnittliche monatliche Kosten","Effective contribution rate":"Effektiver Beitragssatz","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Von diesem Szenario verwendete Differenzzulage","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Verbleibender Restbetrag für diese Schätzung","Tax year":"Steuerjahr","Rate source checked":"Ratenquelle überprüft","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Überprüfen Sie, ob jeder Betrag eine gültige nicht-negative Zahl ist und jeder Prozentsatz innerhalb des Bereichs liegt.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Der NOK-Schwellenwert 850,000 gilt pro Unternehmen, nicht pro Mitarbeiter. Geben Sie den Betrag ein, den das Unternehmen in diesem Kalenderjahr bereits verbraucht hat.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Norwegische Zonen folgen dem registrierten Standort des Arbeitgebers. Nutzen Sie die Gemeindesuche von Skatteetaten. Die Seite leitet keine Zone aus Ihrer Sprache ab.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Urlaubsgeld und Rentensätze sind bearbeitbare Planungseingaben. Verwenden Sie den Tarif und die Rentenbasis, die für Ihren Vertrag und Ihr System gelten.","No account or server upload is used.":"Es wird kein Konto- oder Server-Upload verwendet.","Compare a second offer":"Ein zweites Angebot vergleichen","Offer B":"Angebot B","Offer comparison":"Angebotsvergleich","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Beide Angebote nutzen die oben ausgewählte Arbeitgeberzone und Aktivität. Bei jeder Alternative wird der verbleibende Freibetrag für Zone Ia separat angewendet. Die beiden Szenarien sind Alternativen und dürfen nicht addiert werden.","Offer A":"Angebot A","Difference (B − A)":"Differenz (B − A)"},"el":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Υπολογιστής κόστους εργοδότη της Νορβηγίας","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Υπολογιστής κόστους εργοδότη της Νορβηγίας 2026 — Μισθοδοσία, αμοιβή διακοπών και συνεισφορά εργοδότη","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Υπολογίστε το ετήσιο κόστος μισθοδοσίας της Νορβηγίας χρησιμοποιώντας τα ποσοστά ζώνης εισφορών εργοδοτών 2026. Προσθέστε αποδοχές αδείας, σύνταξη, φορολογητέα αμοιβή και άλλα κόστη με σαφείς υποθέσεις.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Υπολογίστε το ετήσιο κόστος εργοδότη στη Νορβηγία από τη μισθοδοσία, τις αποδοχές αδείας, τις συνταξιοδοτικές εισφορές και την εθνική ασφαλιστική εισφορά του εργοδότη (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Τι περιλαμβάνει η εκτίμηση;","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Εισαγάγετε τη συνολική ετήσια μισθοδοσία, επιλέξτε τη ζώνη εγγεγραμμένων εισφορών και τον τύπο δραστηριότητας του εργοδότη και, στη συνέχεια, προσθέστε αποδοχές αδείας, σύνταξη και άλλες αποζημιώσεις. Για παράδειγμα, 1,000,000 NOK βάσης εισφορών στη ζώνη I δίνει 141,000 NOK εργοδοτικής εισφοράς σε 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Πώς λειτουργεί η εκτίμηση","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Η αριθμομηχανή χρησιμοποιεί το δημοσιευμένο ποσοστό ζώνης 2026 για συνήθη δραστηριότητα ή γεωργία/ψάρεμα. Προσθέτει τις καταχωρημένες αποδοχές αδείας, τη φορολογητέα αποζημίωση και κάθε συνταξιοδοτική εισφορά στη βάση εισφορών. Για τη συνήθη δραστηριότητα στη ζώνη Ia, το διαφορικό επίδομα 850,000 NOK ανά επιχείρηση εφαρμόζεται στο ποσό που έχει καταχωριστεί ως έχει ήδη χρησιμοποιηθεί φέτος. Τα αποτελέσματα είναι εκτιμήσεις ετήσιου προγραμματισμού. η εγγεγραμμένη τοποθεσία και δραστηριότητα του εργοδότη καθορίζουν τους ισχύοντες κανόνες.","Frequently asked questions":"Συχνές ερωτήσεις","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Υπολογίζει αυτό την αμοιβή ενός υπαλλήλου που παίρνει το σπίτι;","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Αρ. Εκτιμά μόνο το κόστος του εργοδότη και τη συνεισφορά του εργοδότη. Δεν υπολογίζει παρακράτηση φόρου ή κρατήσεις από την αμοιβή ενός υπαλλήλου.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Ποια ζώνη συνεισφοράς να επιλέξω;","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Επιλέξτε τη ζώνη που ισχύει για την εγγεγραμμένη επιχείρηση του εργοδότη και όχι τη γλώσσα ή τη χώρα καταγωγής του εργαζομένου. Επαληθεύστε τον δήμο με το Skatteetaten πριν βασιστείτε στο αποτέλεσμα.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Είναι υποχρεωτική η συνταξιοδοτική εισφορά 2% για κάθε εργοδότη;","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Αρ. Τα επαγγελματικά συνταξιοδοτικά καθήκοντα εξαρτώνται από το εάν ο εργοδότης και το εργατικό δυναμικό πληρούν τις νόμιμες προϋποθέσεις. Εισαγάγετε ένα ποσοστό σύνταξης μόνο όταν ισχύει για την κατάστασή σας. το πραγματικό ασφάλιστρο του συστήματος μπορεί να διαφέρει.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Συμπεριλαμβάνονται αυτόματα οι αποδοχές διακοπών και κάθε κόστος πρόσληψης;","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Αρ. Το ποσοστό και η βάση των αποδοχών αδείας, η μισθοδοσία των συντάξιμων και λοιπά κόστη είναι επεξεργάσιμες υποθέσεις. Η ασφάλιση, η διαχείριση μισθοδοσίας, οι ειδικές παροχές, οι απαλλαγές και τα μεμονωμένα όρια εργαζομένων δεν διαμορφώνονται πλήρως.","Scope and data date":"Πεδίο εφαρμογής και ημερομηνία δεδομένων","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Τα ποσοστά εισφορών εργοδοτών της Νορβηγίας καθορίζονται ανά έτος και ποικίλλουν ανά ζώνη και δραστηριότητα. Αυτή η αριθμομηχανή περιέχει τους συντελεστές που δημοσιεύθηκαν για το φορολογικό έτος 2026, με ημερομηνία 16 Οκτωβρίου 2026. δεν είναι επίσημη κατάθεση ή νομική απόφαση. Επαληθεύστε τις τρέχουσες τιμές, την τοποθέτηση ζώνης, την καταλληλότητα και το επίδομα ανά επιχείρηση με το Skatteetaten. Μια μεταγενέστερη έκδοση πρέπει να ανανεώσει τους χρονομετρητές στατικούς ρυθμούς. αυτή η σελίδα δεν ενημερώνεται μόνη της στο παρασκήνιο.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Εκτελείται σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. Τα στοιχεία μισθοδοσίας σας δεν ανεβαίνουν.","Estimate employer cost":"Εκτιμήστε το κόστος του εργοδότη","Related tools":"Σχετικά εργαλεία","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ΔΩΡΕΑΝ · ΕΚΤΕΛΕΙΤΑΙ ΣΤΟ BROWSER ΣΑΣ","Language":"Γλώσσα","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"Όλα τα εργαλεία","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Συνολική ετήσια ακαθάριστη μισθοδοσία, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Βάση πληρωμής διακοπών, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Ποσοστό πληρωμής διακοπών, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Λοιπές φορολογητέα αμοιβές και παροχές, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Συντάξιμη μισθοδοσία, ΝΟΚ","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Ποσοστό εισφοράς εργοδοτικής σύνταξης, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Άλλα έξοδα που καταβάλλονται από τον εργοδότη, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Ζώνη εργοδοτικής εισφοράς","Activity type":"Τύπος δραστηριότητας","Ordinary activity":"Συνήθης δραστηριότητα","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Γεωργία και αλιεία (ειδικές δημοσιευμένες τιμές)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Ζώνη I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Ζώνη Ia — 14.1% συνήθης / 10.6% γεωργία και αλιεία","Zone II — 10.6%":"Ζώνη II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Ζώνη III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Ζώνη IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Ζώνη IVa — 7.9% συνήθης / 5.1% γεωργία και αλιεία","Zone V — 0%":"Ζώνη V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Διαφορικό επίδομα Ζώνης Ia που χρησιμοποιείται ήδη φέτος, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Υπολογισμός εκτίμησης","Reset inputs":"Επαναφορά εισόδων","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Εισαγάγετε τα ετήσια ποσά και επιλέξτε τη ζώνη και τη δραστηριότητα του εργοδότη.","Annual estimate":"Ετήσια εκτίμηση","Gross payroll":"Μικτό μισθολόγιο","Holiday pay estimate":"Εκτίμηση αποδοχών διακοπών","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Λοιπές φορολογητέα αμοιβές και παροχές","Employer pension contribution":"Εργοδοτική συνταξιοδοτική εισφορά","Employer contribution basis":"Βάση εργοδοτικής εισφοράς","Employer national insurance contribution":"Εθνική ασφαλιστική εισφορά εργοδότη","Other employer-paid costs":"Άλλα έξοδα που καταβάλλονται από τον εργοδότη","Estimated annual employer cost":"Εκτιμώμενο ετήσιο κόστος εργοδότη","Average monthly cost":"Μέσο μηνιαίο κόστος","Effective contribution rate":"Πραγματικό ποσοστό εισφοράς","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Διαφορικό επίδομα που χρησιμοποιείται σε αυτό το σενάριο","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Υπόλοιπο επίδομα για αυτήν την εκτίμηση","Tax year":"Φορολογικό έτος","Rate source checked":"Ελέγχθηκε η πηγή βαθμολόγησης","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Βεβαιωθείτε ότι κάθε ποσό είναι ένας έγκυρος μη αρνητικός αριθμός και ότι κάθε ποσοστό είναι εντός εύρους.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Το όριο 850,000 NOK είναι ανά επιχείρηση και όχι ανά εργαζόμενο. Εισαγάγετε το ποσό που έχει ήδη χρησιμοποιηθεί από την επιχείρηση αυτό το ημερολογιακό έτος.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Οι νορβηγικές ζώνες ακολουθούν την εγγεγραμμένη τοποθεσία του εργοδότη. Χρησιμοποιήστε την αναζήτηση δήμου του Skatteetaten. η σελίδα δεν συνάγει ζώνη από τη γλώσσα σας.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Τα ποσοστά αποδοχών αδείας και συντάξεων είναι επεξεργάσιμα στοιχεία προγραμματισμού. Χρησιμοποιήστε το ποσοστό και τη συντάξιμη βάση που ισχύουν για τη σύμβαση και το σύστημά σας.","No account or server upload is used.":"Δεν χρησιμοποιείται μεταφόρτωση λογαριασμού ή διακομιστή.","Compare a second offer":"Συγκρίνετε μια δεύτερη προσφορά","Offer B":"Προσφορά Β","Offer comparison":"Σύγκριση προσφορών","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Και οι δύο προσφορές χρησιμοποιούν τη ζώνη εργοδότη και τη δραστηριότητα που έχουν επιλεγεί παραπάνω. Κάθε εναλλακτική εφαρμογή εφαρμόζει το εναπομένον επίδομα ζώνης Ia χωριστά. Τα δύο σενάρια είναι εναλλακτικές και δεν πρέπει να αθροίζονται.","Offer A":"Προσφορά Α","Difference (B − A)":"Διαφορά (B − A)"},"es":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Calculadora de costos para empleadores en Noruega","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Calculadora de costos para el empleador en Noruega 2026 — Nómina, pago de días festivos y contribución del empleador","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Estimación del costo anual de la nómina noruega utilizando las tasas de zona de contribución del empleador 2026. Agregue el pago de vacaciones, pensión, pago imponible y otros costos con supuestos claros.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Estimación del costo anual para el empleador en Noruega a partir de la nómina, el pago de vacaciones, las contribuciones a las pensiones y la contribución al seguro nacional del empleador (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"¿Qué incluye el presupuesto?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Ingrese la nómina anual total, elija la zona de contribución registrada del empleador y el tipo de actividad, luego agregue el pago de vacaciones, pensión y otras compensaciones. Por ejemplo, 1,000,000 NOK de base de cotización en la zona I da 141,000 NOK de contribución del empleador al 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Cómo funciona el presupuesto","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"La calculadora utiliza la tarifa de zona 2026 publicada para actividad ordinaria o agricultura/pesca. Añade a la base de cotización el pago de vacaciones ingresado, la compensación imponible y cualquier contribución a la pensión. Para la actividad ordinaria en la zona Ia, la asignación diferencial por empresa 850,000 NOK se aplica al importe ingresado como ya utilizado este año. Los resultados son estimaciones de planificación anual; la ubicación registrada y la actividad del empleador determinan las normas aplicables.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntas frecuentes","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"¿Esto calcula el salario neto de un empleado?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"No. Estima únicamente los costos y la contribución del empleador. No calcula retenciones fiscales ni deducciones del salario de un empleado.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"¿Qué zona de contribución debo elegir?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Elija la zona que se aplica a la ubicación comercial registrada del empleador, no al idioma ni al país de origen del empleado. Verifique el municipio con Skatteetaten antes de confiar en el resultado.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"¿Es obligatoria una contribución de pensión 2% para todos los empleadores?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"No. Las obligaciones en materia de pensiones profesionales dependen de si el empleador y los trabajadores cumplen las condiciones legales. Introduzca una tasa de pensión sólo cuando se aplique a su situación; la prima real del plan puede diferir.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"¿El pago de vacaciones y todos los gastos de contratación se incluyen automáticamente?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"No. La tasa y base del pago de vacaciones, la nómina pensionable y otros costos son suposiciones editables. Los seguros, la administración de nóminas, los beneficios especiales, las exenciones y los límites individuales de los empleados no están completamente modelados.","Scope and data date":"Alcance y fecha de datos","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Las tasas de contribución de los empleadores noruegos se establecen por año y varían según la zona y la actividad. Esta calculadora contiene las tarifas publicadas para el año fiscal 2026, de fecha 16 de octubre de 2026; no es una presentación oficial ni una decisión legal. Verifique las tarifas actuales, la ubicación de la zona, la elegibilidad y la asignación por empresa con Skatteetaten. Una compilación posterior debe actualizar las tarifas estáticas fechadas; esta página no se actualiza sola en segundo plano.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Se ejecuta en este navegador. Las cifras de tu nómina no se cargan.","Estimate employer cost":"Costo estimado del empleador","Related tools":"Herramientas relacionadas","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · SE EJECUTA EN TU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Verso útil","All tools":"Todas las herramientas","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Nómina bruta anual total, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Pago de vacaciones, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Tasa de pago de vacaciones, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Otros pagos y beneficios sujetos a impuestos, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Nómina pensionable, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Tasa de contribución a la pensión del empleador, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Otros costos pagados por el empleador, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Zona de contribución patronal","Activity type":"Tipo de actividad","Ordinary activity":"Actividad ordinaria","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Agricultura y pesca (tarifas especiales publicadas)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zona I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zona Ia — 14.1% ordinaria / 10.6% agricultura y pesca","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zona II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zona III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zona IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zona IVa — 7.9% ordinaria / 5.1% agricultura y pesca","Zone V — 0%":"Zona V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Asignación diferencial de zona Ia ya utilizada este año, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Calcular estimación","Reset inputs":"Restablecer entradas","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Ingrese los montos anuales y elija la zona y actividad del empleador.","Annual estimate":"Estimación anual","Gross payroll":"Nómina bruta","Holiday pay estimate":"Estimación de pago de vacaciones","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Otros pagos y beneficios sujetos a impuestos","Employer pension contribution":"Contribución a la pensión del empleador","Employer contribution basis":"Base de contribución del empleador","Employer national insurance contribution":"Contribución del empleador al seguro nacional","Other employer-paid costs":"Otros costos pagados por el empleador","Estimated annual employer cost":"Costo anual estimado para el empleador","Average monthly cost":"Costo mensual medio","Effective contribution rate":"Tasa de cotización efectiva","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Asignación diferencial utilizada por este escenario","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Asignación restante para esta estimación","Tax year":"Año fiscal","Rate source checked":"Fuente de tarifas verificada","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Compruebe que cada monto sea un número válido no negativo y que cada porcentaje esté dentro del rango.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"El umbral 850,000 NOK es por empresa, no por empleado. Ingrese la cantidad ya utilizada por la empresa este año calendario.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Las zonas noruegas siguen la ubicación registrada del empleador. Utilice la búsqueda de municipios de Skatteetaten; la página no infiere una zona de su idioma.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"El pago de vacaciones y las tasas de pensión son entradas de planificación editables. Utilice la tarifa y base pensionable que se apliquen a su contrato y régimen.","No account or server upload is used.":"No se utiliza ninguna carga de cuenta o servidor.","Compare a second offer":"Comparar una segunda oferta","Offer B":"Oferta B","Offer comparison":"Comparación de ofertas","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Ambas ofertas utilizan la zona de empleador y la actividad seleccionada anteriormente. Cada alternativa aplica la bonificación restante de la zona Ia por separado; Los dos escenarios son alternativos y no deben sumarse.","Offer A":"Oferta A","Difference (B − A)":"Diferencia (B − A)"},"fa":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"ماشین حساب هزینه کارفرما نروژ","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"ماشین حساب هزینه کارفرما نروژ 2026 — حقوق و دستمزد، حقوق تعطیلات و مشارکت کارفرما","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"هزینه سالانه حقوق و دستمزد نروژی را با استفاده از نرخ‌های منطقه مشارکت کارفرمایان 2026 برآورد کنید. حقوق تعطیلات، مستمری، حقوق مشمول مالیات و سایر هزینه ها را با فرضیات روشن اضافه کنید.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"هزینه سالانه کارفرما در نروژ را از حقوق و دستمزد، حقوق تعطیلات، سهم بازنشستگی و سهم بیمه ملی کارفرما (arbeidsgiveravgift) برآورد کنید.","What goes into the estimate?":"برآورد چه چیزی است؟","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"کل حقوق و دستمزد سالانه را وارد کنید، منطقه مشارکت ثبت شده کارفرما و نوع فعالیت را انتخاب کنید، سپس حقوق تعطیلات، مستمری و سایر غرامت را اضافه کنید. به عنوان مثال، 1,000,000 NOK مبنای مشارکت در منطقه I به 141,000 NOK سهم کارفرما در 14.1٪ می دهد.","How the estimate works":"تخمین چگونه کار می کند","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"این ماشین حساب از نرخ منطقه 2026 منتشر شده برای فعالیت معمولی یا کشاورزی/ماهیگیری استفاده می کند. این حقوق ورودی، غرامت مشمول مالیات و هر گونه سهم بازنشستگی را به مبنای سهم اضافه می کند. برای فعالیت معمولی در منطقه Ia، کمک هزینه دیفرانسیل 850,000 NOK به ازای هر شرکت به مقدار وارد شده به عنوان قبلاً استفاده شده در سال جاری اعمال می شود. نتایج برآوردهای برنامه ریزی سالانه است. محل و فعالیت ثبت شده کارفرما قوانین قابل اجرا را تعیین می کند.","Frequently asked questions":"سوالات متداول","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"آیا این دستمزد کارمند را محاسبه می‌کند؟","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"شماره فقط هزینه های کارفرما و سهم کارفرما را تخمین می زند. این مالیات کسر یا کسر از حقوق کارمند را محاسبه نمی کند.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"کدام منطقه مشارکت را انتخاب کنم؟","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"منطقه ای را انتخاب کنید که برای محل کسب و کار ثبت شده کارفرما اعمال می شود، نه زبان کارمند یا کشور اصلی. قبل از تکیه بر نتیجه، شهرداری را با Skatteetaten تأیید کنید.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"آیا سهم بازنشستگی 2٪ برای هر کارفرما اجباری است؟","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"شماره. وظایف بازنشستگی شغلی به این بستگی دارد که آیا کارفرما و نیروی کار دارای شرایط قانونی هستند یا خیر. نرخ بازنشستگی را فقط زمانی وارد کنید که در مورد وضعیت شما صدق کند. حق بیمه طرح واقعی می تواند متفاوت باشد.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"آیا حقوق تعطیلات و هر هزینه استخدام به طور خودکار شامل می شود؟","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"شماره. نرخ و مبنای پرداخت تعطیلات، حقوق بازنشستگی و سایر هزینه ها مفروضات قابل ویرایش هستند. بیمه، مدیریت حقوق و دستمزد، مزایای ویژه، معافیت ها و محدودیت های فردی کارکنان به طور کامل مدل سازی نشده اند.","Scope and data date":"محدوده و تاریخ داده","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"نرخ مشارکت کارفرمایان نروژی بر اساس سال تعیین می‌شود و براساس منطقه و فعالیت متفاوت است. این ماشین حساب شامل نرخ های منتشر شده برای سال مالیاتی 2026 به تاریخ 16 اکتبر 2026 است. این یک پرونده رسمی یا تصمیم قانونی نیست. نرخ های فعلی، محل قرارگیری منطقه، واجد شرایط بودن و کمک هزینه هر شرکت را با Skatteetaten تأیید کنید. ساخت بعدی باید نرخ‌های استاتیک تاریخ‌گذاری شده را به‌روزرسانی کند. این صفحه خود را در پس زمینه به روز نمی کند.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"در این مرورگر اجرا می شود. ارقام حقوق و دستمزد شما آپلود نمی شود.","Estimate employer cost":"هزینه کارفرما را برآورد کنید","Related tools":"ابزارهای مرتبط","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"رایگان · در مرورگر شما اجرا می شود","Language":"زبان","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"کلیه ابزار","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"مجموع حقوق و دستمزد ناخالص سالانه، NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"مبنای پرداخت تعطیلات، NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"نرخ پرداخت تعطیلات، %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"سایر حقوق و مزایای مشمول مالیات، NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"دستمزد مستمری، NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"نرخ سهم بازنشستگی کارفرما، %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"سایر هزینه های پرداخت شده توسط کارفرما، NOK","Employer contribution zone":"منطقه مشارکت کارفرما","Activity type":"نوع فعالیت","Ordinary activity":"فعالیت معمولی","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"کشاورزی و ماهیگیری (نرخ های ویژه منتشر شده)","Zone I — 14.1%":"منطقه I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"منطقه Ia — 14.1% معمولی / 10.6% کشاورزی و ماهیگیری","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zone II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"منطقه III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"منطقه IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"منطقه IVa — 7.9% معمولی / 5.1% کشاورزی و ماهیگیری","Zone V — 0%":"Zone V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"کمک هزینه دیفرانسیل منطقه Ia که قبلاً در سال جاری استفاده شده است، NOK","Calculate estimate":"برآورد را محاسبه کنید","Reset inputs":"بازنشانی ورودی ها","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"مقدارهای سالانه را وارد کنید و منطقه و فعالیت کارفرما را انتخاب کنید.","Annual estimate":"برآورد سالانه","Gross payroll":"دستمزد ناخالص","Holiday pay estimate":"برآورد حقوق تعطیلات","Other taxable pay and benefits":"سایر حقوق و مزایای مشمول مالیات","Employer pension contribution":"سهم بازنشستگی کارفرما","Employer contribution basis":"مبنای سهم کارفرما","Employer national insurance contribution":"سهم بیمه ملی کارفرما","Other employer-paid costs":"سایر هزینه های پرداخت شده توسط کارفرما","Estimated annual employer cost":"هزینه تخمینی سالانه کارفرما","Average monthly cost":"میانگین هزینه ماهانه","Effective contribution rate":"نرخ مشارکت موثر","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"میزان دیفرانسیل استفاده شده توسط این سناریو","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"هزینه باقیمانده برای این برآورد","Tax year":"سال مالیاتی","Rate source checked":"منبع امتیاز بررسی شد","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"بررسی کنید که هر مقدار یک عدد غیرمنفی معتبر باشد و هر درصد در محدوده باشد.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"آستانه 850,000 NOK برای هر شرکت است، نه برای هر کارمند. مقداری را که قبلاً توسط شرکت در این سال تقویمی استفاده شده است وارد کنید.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"مناطق نروژی از مکان ثبت شده کارفرما پیروی می کنند. از جستجوی شهرداری Skatteetaten استفاده کنید. صفحه از زبان شما منطقه ای استنتاج نمی کند.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"مزد تعطیلات و نرخ بازنشستگی ورودی های برنامه ریزی قابل ویرایش هستند. از نرخ و پایه مستمری که برای قرارداد و طرح شما اعمال می شود استفاده کنید.","No account or server upload is used.":"هیچ حساب کاربری یا آپلود سرور استفاده نمی شود.","Compare a second offer":"پیشنهاد دوم را مقایسه کنید","Offer B":"پیشنهاد B","Offer comparison":"مقایسه پیشنهاد","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"هر دو پیشنهاد از منطقه کارفرما و فعالیت انتخاب شده در بالا استفاده می کنند. هر جایگزین کمک هزینه باقیمانده منطقه Ia را به طور جداگانه اعمال می کند. این دو سناریو جایگزین هستند و نباید با هم جمع شوند.","Offer A":"پیشنهاد الف","Difference (B − A)":"تفاوت (B − A)"},"fr":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Calculateur de coûts pour l'employeur en Norvège","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Calculateur de coûts pour l'employeur en Norvège 2026 — Paie, indemnités de vacances et cotisations de l'employeur","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Estimez le coût salarial annuel norvégien à l'aide des taux de la zone de cotisation patronale 2026. Ajoutez les indemnités de vacances, la pension, le salaire imposable et d'autres coûts avec des hypothèses claires.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Estimation du coût annuel pour l'employeur en Norvège à partir de la masse salariale, des congés payés, des cotisations de retraite et de la cotisation d'assurance nationale de l'employeur (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Qu'est-ce qui entre dans l'estimation ?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Saisissez la masse salariale annuelle totale, choisissez la zone de cotisation enregistrée et le type d'activité de l'employeur, puis ajoutez les congés payés, la pension et les autres rémunérations. Par exemple, 1,000,000 NOK de base de cotisation en zone I donne 141,000 NOK de cotisation patronale à 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Fonctionnement du devis","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Le calculateur utilise le taux de zone 2026 publié pour les activités ordinaires ou l'agriculture/pêche. Il ajoute à l'assiette de cotisation les congés payés, les indemnités imposables et les éventuelles cotisations de retraite. Pour l'activité ordinaire en zone Ia, l'abattement différentiel 850,000 NOK par entreprise est appliqué au montant saisi comme déjà utilisé cette année. Les résultats sont des estimations de planification annuelles ; le lieu d’immatriculation et l’activité de l’employeur déterminent les règles applicables.","Frequently asked questions":"Questions fréquemment posées","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Est-ce que cela calcule le salaire net d'un employé ?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Non. Il estime uniquement les coûts et les cotisations de l'employeur. Il ne calcule pas les retenues à la source ni les retenues sur le salaire d’un employé.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Quelle zone de contribution dois-je choisir ?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Choisissez la zone qui s'applique au lieu d'activité enregistré de l'employeur, et non à la langue ou au pays d'origine de l'employé. Vérifiez la commune auprès de Skatteetaten avant de vous fier au résultat.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Une cotisation de retraite 2% est-elle obligatoire pour chaque employeur ?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Non. Les obligations en matière de prévoyance professionnelle dépendent du fait que l'employeur et le personnel remplissent les conditions légales. Inscrivez un taux de rente seulement lorsqu'il s'applique à votre situation ; la prime réelle du régime peut différer.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Les pécules de vacances et tous les frais d'embauche sont-ils automatiquement inclus ?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Non. Le taux et la base des indemnités de vacances, la masse salariale ouvrant droit à pension et les autres coûts sont des hypothèses modifiables. L'assurance, l'administration de la paie, les avantages sociaux spéciaux, les exemptions et les plafonds individuels des employés ne sont pas entièrement modélisés.","Scope and data date":"Périmètre et date des données","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Les taux de cotisation des employeurs norvégiens sont fixés chaque année et varient selon la zone et l'activité. Ce calculateur contient les taux publiés pour l'année d'imposition 2026, en date du 16 octobre 2026 ; il ne s’agit pas d’un dépôt officiel ou d’une décision judiciaire. Vérifiez les tarifs actuels, le placement de zone, l'éligibilité et l'allocation par entreprise auprès de Skatteetaten. Une version ultérieure doit actualiser les taux statiques datés ; cette page ne se met pas à jour en arrière-plan.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"S'exécute dans ce navigateur. Vos chiffres de paie ne sont pas téléchargés.","Estimate employer cost":"Estimation du coût employeur","Related tools":"Outils associés","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUIT · FONCTIONNE DANS VOTRE NAVIGATEUR","Language":"Langue","UsefulVerse":"Verse utile","All tools":"Tous les outils","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Masse salariale brute annuelle totale, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Base de congés payés, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Taux d'indemnités de vacances, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Autres salaires et avantages imposables, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Paie ouvrant droit à pension, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Taux de cotisation à la retraite de l'employeur, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Autres coûts payés par l'employeur, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Zone de cotisation employeur","Activity type":"Type d'activité","Ordinary activity":"Activité ordinaire","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Agriculture et pêche (tarifs spéciaux publiés)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zone I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinaire / 10.6% agriculture et pêche","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zone II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zone III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zone IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinaire / 5.1% agriculture et pêche","Zone V — 0%":"Zone V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Allocation différentielle de zone Ia déjà utilisée cette année, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Calculer l'estimation","Reset inputs":"Réinitialiser les entrées","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Saisissez les montants annuels et choisissez la zone et l'activité de l'employeur.","Annual estimate":"Estimation annuelle","Gross payroll":"Masse salariale brute","Holiday pay estimate":"Estimation des indemnités de vacances","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Autres salaires et avantages imposables","Employer pension contribution":"Cotisation de retraite de l'employeur","Employer contribution basis":"Base de cotisation de l'employeur","Employer national insurance contribution":"Cotisation patronale à l'assurance nationale","Other employer-paid costs":"Autres coûts payés par l'employeur","Estimated annual employer cost":"Coût annuel estimé pour l'employeur","Average monthly cost":"Coût mensuel moyen","Effective contribution rate":"Taux de cotisation effectif","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Allocation différentielle utilisée par ce scénario","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Provision restante pour cette estimation","Tax year":"Année d'imposition","Rate source checked":"Source de taux vérifiée","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Vérifiez que chaque montant est un nombre valide non négatif et que chaque pourcentage est compris dans la plage.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Le seuil 850,000 NOK est par entreprise et non par employé. Saisissez le montant déjà utilisé par l'entreprise cette année civile.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Les zones norvégiennes suivent le lieu d'enregistrement de l'employeur. Utilisez la recherche de municipalité de Skatteetaten ; la page ne déduit pas de zone de votre langue.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Les taux de congés payés et de pension sont des entrées de planification modifiables. Utilisez le taux et l'assiette d'assurance applicables à votre contrat et à votre régime.","No account or server upload is used.":"Aucun téléchargement de compte ou de serveur n'est utilisé.","Compare a second offer":"Comparez une deuxième offre","Offer B":"Offre B","Offer comparison":"Comparaison des offres","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Les deux offres utilisent la zone employeur et l'activité sélectionnées ci-dessus. Chaque alternative applique séparément la franchise restante de la zone Ia ; les deux scénarios sont alternatifs et ne doivent pas être additionnés.","Offer A":"Offre A","Difference (B − A)":"Différence (B − A)"},"gu":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"નોર્વે એમ્પ્લોયર કોસ્ટ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"નોર્વે એમ્પ્લોયર કોસ્ટ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર 2026 — પેરોલ, હોલીડે પે અને એમ્પ્લોયરનું યોગદાન","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 એમ્પ્લોયર યોગદાન ઝોન દરોનો ઉપયોગ કરીને વાર્ષિક નોર્વેજીયન પેરોલ ખર્ચનો અંદાજ કાઢો. સ્પષ્ટ ધારણાઓ સાથે રજાનો પગાર, પેન્શન, કરપાત્ર પગાર અને અન્ય ખર્ચ ઉમેરો.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"નોર્વેમાં પગારપત્રક, રજાના પગાર, પેન્શન યોગદાન અને એમ્પ્લોયરના રાષ્ટ્રીય વીમા યોગદાન (arbeidsgiveravgift) પરથી વાર્ષિક એમ્પ્લોયર ખર્ચનો અંદાજ કાઢો.","What goes into the estimate?":"અંદાજમાં શું જાય છે?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"કુલ વાર્ષિક પગારપત્રક દાખલ કરો, એમ્પ્લોયરનું નોંધાયેલ યોગદાન ઝોન અને પ્રવૃત્તિ પ્રકાર પસંદ કરો, પછી રજાનો પગાર, પેન્શન અને અન્ય વળતર ઉમેરો. ઉદાહરણ તરીકે, ઝોન I માં યોગદાનના આધારે 1,000,000 NOK 14.1% પર એમ્પ્લોયર યોગદાનનો 141,000 NOK આપે છે.","How the estimate works":"અંદાજ કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"કેલ્ક્યુલેટર સામાન્ય પ્રવૃત્તિ અથવા કૃષિ/માછીમારી માટે પ્રકાશિત 2026 ઝોન રેટનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. તે યોગદાનના આધારે દાખલ કરેલ રજા પગાર, કરપાત્ર વળતર અને કોઈપણ પેન્શન યોગદાન ઉમેરે છે. ઝોન Ia માં સામાન્ય પ્રવૃત્તિ માટે, 850,000 NOK પ્રતિ એન્ટરપ્રાઇઝ વિભેદક ભથ્થું દાખલ કરેલ રકમ પર લાગુ કરવામાં આવે છે જે આ વર્ષે પહેલેથી ઉપયોગમાં લેવાય છે. પરિણામો વાર્ષિક આયોજન અંદાજ છે; એમ્પ્લોયરનું નોંધાયેલ સ્થાન અને પ્રવૃત્તિ લાગુ નિયમો નક્કી કરે છે.","Frequently asked questions":"વારંવાર પૂછાતા પ્રશ્નો","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"શું આ કર્મચારીના ઘરે લઈ જવાના પગારની ગણતરી કરે છે?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"નં. તે માત્ર એમ્પ્લોયરના ખર્ચ અને એમ્પ્લોયરના યોગદાનનો અંદાજ લગાવે છે. તે કર્મચારીના પગારમાંથી વિથહોલ્ડિંગ ટેક્સ અથવા કપાતની ગણતરી કરતું નથી.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"મારે કયો યોગદાન ઝોન પસંદ કરવો જોઈએ?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"એમ્પ્લોયરના રજિસ્ટર્ડ વ્યવસાય સ્થાનને લાગુ પડતો ઝોન પસંદ કરો, કર્મચારીની ભાષા અથવા ઘરના દેશને નહીં. પરિણામ પર આધાર રાખતા પહેલા સ્કેટેટેટેન સાથે મ્યુનિસિપાલિટી ચકાસો.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"શું દરેક એમ્પ્લોયર માટે 2% પેન્શન ફાળો ફરજિયાત છે?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"નં. વ્યવસાયિક પેન્શન ફરજો એમ્પ્લોયર અને કર્મચારીઓ કાનૂની શરતોને પૂર્ણ કરે છે કે કેમ તેના પર આધાર રાખે છે. જ્યારે તે તમારી પરિસ્થિતિને લાગુ પડે ત્યારે જ પેન્શન દર દાખલ કરો; વાસ્તવિક યોજના પ્રીમિયમ અલગ હોઈ શકે છે.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"શું રજાનો પગાર અને દરેક હાયરિંગ ખર્ચ આપમેળે સમાવિષ્ટ છે?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"નં. રજાના પગાર દર અને આધાર, પેન્શનપાત્ર પગારપત્રક અને અન્ય ખર્ચ સંપાદનયોગ્ય ધારણાઓ છે. વીમો, પેરોલ એડમિનિસ્ટ્રેશન, વિશેષ લાભો, મુક્તિઓ અને વ્યક્તિગત કર્મચારી મર્યાદાઓ સંપૂર્ણપણે મોડેલ નથી.","Scope and data date":"સ્કોપ અને ડેટા તારીખ","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"નોર્વેજીયન એમ્પ્લોયર યોગદાન દર વર્ષ દ્વારા સેટ કરવામાં આવે છે અને ઝોન અને પ્રવૃત્તિ દ્વારા બદલાય છે. આ કેલ્ક્યુલેટરમાં કરવેરા વર્ષ 2026, તારીખ 16 ઓક્ટોબર 2026 માટે પ્રકાશિત દરો શામેલ છે; તે સત્તાવાર ફાઇલિંગ અથવા કાનૂની નિર્ણય નથી. Skatteetaten સાથે વર્તમાન દરો, ઝોન પ્લેસમેન્ટ, પાત્રતા અને એન્ટરપ્રાઇઝ દીઠ ભથ્થું ચકાસો. પછીના બિલ્ડે તારીખના સ્થિર દરોને તાજું કરવું આવશ્યક છે; આ પૃષ્ઠ પૃષ્ઠભૂમિમાં પોતાને અપડેટ કરતું નથી.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે. તમારા પગારપત્રકના આંકડા અપલોડ કરવામાં આવ્યા નથી.","Estimate employer cost":"એમ્પ્લોયર ખર્ચનો અંદાજ લગાવો","Related tools":"સંબંધિત સાધનો","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"મફત · તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે","Language":"ભાષા","UsefulVerse":"ઉપયોગી પદ્ય","All tools":"તમામ સાધનો","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"કુલ વાર્ષિક ગ્રોસ પેરોલ, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"હોલીડે-પે બેસિસ, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"હોલિડે-પે દર, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"અન્ય કરપાત્ર પગાર અને લાભો, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"પેન્શનપાત્ર પેરોલ, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"એમ્પ્લોયર પેન્શન યોગદાન દર, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"અન્ય એમ્પ્લોયર-પેઇડ ખર્ચ, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"એમ્પ્લોયર ફાળો ઝોન","Activity type":"પ્રવૃત્તિનો પ્રકાર","Ordinary activity":"સામાન્ય પ્રવૃત્તિ","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"કૃષિ અને માછીમારી (ખાસ પ્રકાશિત દરો)","Zone I — 14.1%":"ઝોન I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"ઝોન Ia — 14.1% સામાન્ય / 10.6% કૃષિ અને માછીમારી","Zone II — 10.6%":"ઝોન II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"ઝોન III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"ઝોન IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"ઝોન IVa — 7.9% સામાન્ય / 5.1% કૃષિ અને માછીમારી","Zone V — 0%":"ઝોન V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"ઝોન Ia વિભેદક ભથ્થું આ વર્ષે પહેલેથી જ વપરાયેલ છે, NOK","Calculate estimate":"અંદાજની ગણતરી કરો","Reset inputs":"રીસેટ ઇનપુટ્સ","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"વાર્ષિક રકમો દાખલ કરો અને એમ્પ્લોયરનો ઝોન અને પ્રવૃત્તિ પસંદ કરો.","Annual estimate":"વાર્ષિક અંદાજ","Gross payroll":"ગ્રોસ પેરોલ","Holiday pay estimate":"હોલિડે પગાર અંદાજ","Other taxable pay and benefits":"અન્ય કરપાત્ર પગાર અને લાભો","Employer pension contribution":"એમ્પ્લોયર પેન્શન યોગદાન","Employer contribution basis":"એમ્પ્લોયર ફાળો આધાર","Employer national insurance contribution":"એમ્પ્લોયર રાષ્ટ્રીય વીમા યોગદાન","Other employer-paid costs":"અન્ય એમ્પ્લોયર-પેઇડ ખર્ચ","Estimated annual employer cost":"અંદાજિત વાર્ષિક એમ્પ્લોયર ખર્ચ","Average monthly cost":"સરેરાશ માસિક ખર્ચ","Effective contribution rate":"અસરકારક યોગદાન દર","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"આ દૃશ્ય દ્વારા ઉપયોગમાં લેવાતું વિભેદક ભથ્થું","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"આ અંદાજ માટે બાકી ભથ્થું","Tax year":"કર વર્ષ","Rate source checked":"રેટ સ્ત્રોત તપાસ્યો","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"તપાસો કે દરેક રકમ માન્ય બિન-નકારાત્મક સંખ્યા છે અને દરેક ટકાવારી શ્રેણીની અંદર છે.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK થ્રેશોલ્ડ એન્ટરપ્રાઇઝ દીઠ છે, કર્મચારી દીઠ નહીં. આ કેલેન્ડર વર્ષમાં એન્ટરપ્રાઇઝ દ્વારા પહેલેથી ઉપયોગમાં લેવાયેલી રકમ દાખલ કરો.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"નોર્વેજિયન ઝોન એમ્પ્લોયરના નોંધાયેલા સ્થાનને અનુસરે છે. Skatteetaten's Municipality Lookup નો ઉપયોગ કરો; પૃષ્ઠ તમારી ભાષામાંથી ઝોનનું અનુમાન કરતું નથી.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"રજાનો પગાર અને પેન્શન દરો સંપાદનયોગ્ય આયોજન ઇનપુટ્સ છે. તમારા કરાર અને સ્કીમને લાગુ પડતા દર અને પેન્શનપાત્ર આધારનો ઉપયોગ કરો.","No account or server upload is used.":"કોઈ એકાઉન્ટ અથવા સર્વર અપલોડનો ઉપયોગ થતો નથી.","Compare a second offer":"બીજી ઓફરની સરખામણી કરો","Offer B":"ઓફર બી","Offer comparison":"ઓફર સરખામણી","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"બંને ઑફર્સ એમ્પ્લોયર ઝોન અને ઉપર પસંદ કરેલ પ્રવૃત્તિનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. દરેક વિકલ્પ બાકીના ઝોન Ia ભથ્થાને અલગથી લાગુ કરે છે; બે દૃશ્યો વૈકલ્પિક છે અને એકસાથે ઉમેરવી જોઈએ નહીં.","Offer A":"ઓફર A","Difference (B − A)":"તફાવત (B − A)"},"ha":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Ƙididdigar Ƙirar Ma'aikata ta Norway","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Ƙididdigar Ƙirar Ma'aikata ta Norway 2026 - Biyan Biyan Kuɗi, Biyan Hutu da Gudunmawar Ma'aikata","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Yi ƙididdige yawan kuɗin biyan albashi na Norway na shekara-shekara ta amfani da ƙimar gudummawar yanki mai aiki na 2026. Ƙara biyan biki, fansho, biyan haraji da sauran farashi tare da bayyanannun zato.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Ƙididdiga farashin ma'aikata na shekara-shekara a Norway daga lissafin albashi, biyan biki, gudummawar fensho da gudummawar inshora ta ƙasa mai aiki (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Menene ke shiga cikin kimantawa?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Shigar da jimlar albashin shekara-shekara, zaɓi yankin gudummawar mai rijista da nau'in ayyuka, sannan ƙara biyan biki, fansho da sauran diyya. Misali, 1,000,000 NOK na tushen gudummawa a yankin I yana ba 141,000 NOK na gudummawar ma'aikata a 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Yadda kimantawa ke aiki","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Kalkuleta yana amfani da ƙimar yankin 2026 da aka buga don ayyukan yau da kullun ko aikin noma/kamun kifi. Yana ƙara shigar da biyan biki, diyya mai haraji da kowace gudunmawar fansho ga tushen gudummawar. Don ayyukan yau da kullun a yankin Ia, 850,000 NOK na bambamcin banbancen kamfani yana amfani da adadin da aka shigar kamar yadda aka riga aka yi amfani da shi a wannan shekara. Sakamako shine kiyasin tsare-tsare na shekara; wurin rajista da ayyukan ma'aikaci sun ƙayyade ƙa'idodin da suka dace.","Frequently asked questions":"Tambayoyin da ake yawan yi","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Shin wannan yana ƙididdige biyan kuɗin da ma'aikaci ke yi a gida?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"A'a. Yana ƙididdige farashin mai aiki da gudummawar ma'aikata kawai. Ba ya ƙididdige harajin riƙewa ko cirewa daga albashin ma'aikaci.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Wane yankin gudummawa zan zaɓa?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Zaɓi yankin da ya shafi wurin kasuwancin ma'aikaci mai rijista, ba yaren ma'aikaci ko ƙasar gida ba. Tabbatar da gunduma tare da Skatteetaten kafin dogara da sakamakon.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Shin gudunmawar fansho na 2% wajibi ne ga kowane ma'aikaci?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"A'a. Ayyukan fansho na sana'a sun dogara ne akan ko ma'aikata da ma'aikata sun cika sharuddan doka. Shigar da kuɗin fensho kawai lokacin da ya shafi halin ku; ainihin tsarin premium na iya bambanta.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Ana biyan kuɗin hutu da kowane farashin hayar aiki ta atomatik?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"No. Adadin biyan biki da tushe, lissafin fensho da sauran kuɗaɗen zato ne masu iya gyarawa. Inshora, gudanar da biyan albashi, fa'idodi na musamman, keɓancewa da iyakokin ma'aikata ɗaya ba su cika ƙira ba.","Scope and data date":"Kwafi da kwanan wata bayanai","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"An saita ƙimar gudummawar ma'aikata ta Norway ta shekara kuma ta bambanta ta yanki da aiki. Wannan ƙididdiga ya ƙunshi ƙimar da aka buga don shekara ta haraji 2026, kwanan wata 16 Oktoba 2026; ba gabatar da hukuma ba ne ko yanke hukunci na doka. Tabbatar da ƙimar halin yanzu, sanya yanki, cancanta da izinin kowane kamfani tare da Skatteetaten. Gina daga baya dole ne ya sabunta ƙima na kwanan wata; wannan shafin baya sabunta kansa a bango.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Yana gudana a cikin wannan burauzar. Ba a ɗora alkaluman biyan kuɗin ku ba.","Estimate employer cost":"Ƙimar farashin mai aiki","Related tools":"Kayan aiki masu alaƙa","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KYAUTA · Yana Gudu A CIKIN browsing","Language":"Harshe","UsefulVerse":"Verse Mai Amfani","All tools":"Duk kayan aikin","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Jimlar jimlar albashin shekara-shekara, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Biyan kuɗi na hutu, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Kuɗin biyan kuɗi, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Sauran biyan haraji da fa'idodi, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Masu biyan albashi, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Ƙimar gudummawar gudummawar fansho mai aiki, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Sauran farashin da aka biya mai aiki, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Yankin gudummawar mai aiki","Activity type":"Nau'in ayyuka","Ordinary activity":"Aiki na yau da kullun","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Noma da kamun kifi (farashin da aka buga na musamman)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Yanki na I - 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zone Ia - 14.1% talakawa / 10.6% noma da kamun kifi","Zone II — 10.6%":"Yanki II - 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Yanki III - 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Yanki IV - 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zone IVa - 7.9% talakawa / 5.1% noma da kamun kifi","Zone V — 0%":"Yanki V - 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Yankin Ia izinin banbancen da aka riga aka yi amfani da shi a wannan shekara, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Kididdige ƙiyasin","Reset inputs":"Sake saitin abubuwan shigar","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Shigar da adadin shekara kuma zaɓi yanki da ayyukan mai aiki.","Annual estimate":"Kimanin shekara","Gross payroll":"Babban albashi","Holiday pay estimate":"Kididdigar biyan biki","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Sauran biyan haraji da fa'idodi","Employer pension contribution":"Gudunmawar fensho ta Ma'aikata","Employer contribution basis":"Tushen gudummawar mai aiki","Employer national insurance contribution":"Gudunmawar inshora ta ƙasa mai aiki","Other employer-paid costs":"Sauran farashin da aka biya mai aiki","Estimated annual employer cost":"Kididdigar farashin aiki na shekara-shekara","Average monthly cost":"Matsakaicin farashin kowane wata","Effective contribution rate":"Ƙimar gudummawa mai inganci","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Bambancin izini da wannan yanayin ke amfani da shi","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Ba da izinin wannan ƙima","Tax year":"Shekarar haraji","Rate source checked":"An bincika tushen ƙimar","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Duba cewa kowane adadin ingantacciyar lamba ce mara mara kyau kuma kowane kashi yana cikin kewayo.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Ƙofar 850,000 NOK ta kowace kamfani ce, ba ta kowane ma'aikaci ba. Shigar da adadin da kamfani ya riga ya yi amfani da shi a wannan shekarar kalanda.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Yankunan Norwegian suna bin wurin rajistar mai aiki. Yi amfani da binciken gundumar Skattetaten; shafin ba ya da wani yanki daga yaren ku.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Biyan biki da kuɗin fensho abubuwan shigar da tsare-tsaren ne za a iya gyara su. Yi amfani da ƙima da asusun fansho waɗanda suka shafi kwangilar ku da tsarin ku.","No account or server upload is used.":"Ba a yi amfani da asusu ko shigar da uwar garken ba.","Compare a second offer":"Kwatanta tayin na biyu","Offer B":"Bayar B","Offer comparison":"Bayar kwatanta","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Dukansu tayi suna amfani da yankin ma'aikata da ayyukan da aka zaɓa a sama. Kowane madadin yana amfani da ragowar yankin Ia izinin daban; al'amuran biyun zabi ne kuma ba dole ba ne a haɗa su tare.","Offer A":"tayin A","Difference (B − A)":"Bambanci (B - A)"},"hi":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"नॉर्वे नियोक्ता लागत कैलकुलेटर","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"नॉर्वे नियोक्ता लागत कैलकुलेटर 2026 - पेरोल, अवकाश वेतन और नियोक्ता योगदान","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 नियोक्ता योगदान क्षेत्र दरों का उपयोग करके वार्षिक नॉर्वेजियन पेरोल लागत का अनुमान लगाएं। स्पष्ट अनुमानों के साथ अवकाश वेतन, पेंशन, कर योग्य वेतन और अन्य लागतें जोड़ें।","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"नॉर्वे में पेरोल, अवकाश वेतन, पेंशन योगदान और नियोक्ता के राष्ट्रीय बीमा योगदान (arbeidsgiveravgift) से वार्षिक नियोक्ता लागत का अनुमान लगाएं।","What goes into the estimate?":"अनुमान में क्या शामिल है?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"कुल वार्षिक पेरोल दर्ज करें, नियोक्ता का पंजीकृत योगदान क्षेत्र और गतिविधि प्रकार चुनें, फिर अवकाश वेतन, पेंशन और अन्य मुआवजा जोड़ें। उदाहरण के लिए, ज़ोन I में योगदान के आधार पर 1,000,000 NOK, 14.1% पर नियोक्ता योगदान का 141,000 NOK देता है।","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कैसे काम करता है","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"कैलकुलेटर सामान्य गतिविधि या कृषि/मछली पकड़ने के लिए प्रकाशित 2026 ज़ोन दर का उपयोग करता है। यह योगदान के आधार पर दर्ज अवकाश वेतन, कर योग्य मुआवजा और किसी भी पेंशन योगदान को जोड़ता है। ज़ोन Ia में सामान्य गतिविधि के लिए, 850,000 NOK प्रति-उद्यम अंतर भत्ता इस वर्ष पहले से ही उपयोग की गई दर्ज की गई राशि पर लागू होता है। परिणाम वार्षिक योजना अनुमान हैं; नियोक्ता का पंजीकृत स्थान और गतिविधि लागू नियम निर्धारित करते हैं।","Frequently asked questions":"अक्सर पूछे जाने वाले प्रश्न","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"क्या यह किसी कर्मचारी के घर ले जाने वाले वेतन की गणना करता है?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"नहीं। यह केवल नियोक्ता लागत और नियोक्ता योगदान का अनुमान लगाता है। यह किसी कर्मचारी के वेतन से रोके गए कर या कटौती की गणना नहीं करता है।","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"मुझे कौन सा योगदान क्षेत्र चुनना चाहिए?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"वह क्षेत्र चुनें जो नियोक्ता के पंजीकृत व्यावसायिक स्थान पर लागू होता है, न कि कर्मचारी की भाषा या गृह देश पर। परिणाम पर भरोसा करने से पहले नगर पालिका को स्कैटीटेटेन से सत्यापित करें।","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"क्या प्रत्येक नियोक्ता के लिए 2% पेंशन योगदान अनिवार्य है?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"नहीं। व्यावसायिक पेंशन कर्तव्य इस बात पर निर्भर करते हैं कि नियोक्ता और कार्यबल कानूनी शर्तों को पूरा करते हैं या नहीं। पेंशन दर तभी दर्ज करें जब वह आपकी स्थिति पर लागू हो; वास्तविक योजना का प्रीमियम भिन्न हो सकता है।","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"क्या अवकाश वेतन और प्रत्येक नियुक्ति लागत स्वचालित रूप से शामिल है?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"नहीं। अवकाश वेतन दर और आधार, पेंशन योग्य पेरोल और अन्य लागतें संपादन योग्य धारणाएँ हैं। बीमा, पेरोल प्रशासन, विशेष लाभ, छूट और व्यक्तिगत कर्मचारी सीमाएँ पूरी तरह से तैयार नहीं की गई हैं।","Scope and data date":"स्कोप और डेटा दिनांक","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"नॉर्वेजियन नियोक्ता योगदान दरें वर्ष के अनुसार निर्धारित की जाती हैं और क्षेत्र और गतिविधि के अनुसार भिन्न होती हैं। इस कैलकुलेटर में कर वर्ष 2026, दिनांक 16 अक्टूबर 2026 के लिए प्रकाशित दरें शामिल हैं; यह कोई आधिकारिक फाइलिंग या कानूनी निर्णय नहीं है। स्कैटीटेटेन के साथ वर्तमान दरें, ज़ोन प्लेसमेंट, पात्रता और प्रति-उद्यम भत्ता सत्यापित करें। बाद के निर्माण में दिनांकित स्थिर दरों को ताज़ा करना होगा; यह पृष्ठ पृष्ठभूमि में स्वयं अद्यतन नहीं होता है.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"इस ब्राउज़र में चलता है। आपके पेरोल आंकड़े अपलोड नहीं किए गए हैं.","Estimate employer cost":"नियोक्ता लागत का अनुमान लगाएं","Related tools":"संबंधित उपकरण","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"मुफ़्त · आपके ब्राउज़र में चलता है","Language":"भाषा","UsefulVerse":"उपयोगी श्लोक","All tools":"सभी उपकरण","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"कुल वार्षिक सकल पेरोल, नं","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"अवकाश-भुगतान आधार, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"अवकाश-भुगतान दर, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"अन्य कर योग्य वेतन और लाभ, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"पेंशन योग्य पेरोल, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"नियोक्ता पेंशन अंशदान दर, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"नियोक्ता द्वारा भुगतान की गई अन्य लागतें, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"नियोक्ता योगदान क्षेत्र","Activity type":"गतिविधि प्रकार","Ordinary activity":"साधारण गतिविधि","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"कृषि और मछली पकड़ने (विशेष प्रकाशित दरें)","Zone I — 14.1%":"जोन I - 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"जोन Ia - 14.1% साधारण / 10.6% कृषि और मछली पकड़ना","Zone II — 10.6%":"जोन II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"जोन III - 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"जोन IV - 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"जोन IVa - 7.9% साधारण / 5.1% कृषि और मछली पकड़ना","Zone V — 0%":"जोन V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"जोन Ia अंतर भत्ता इस वर्ष पहले ही उपयोग किया जा चुका है, NOK","Calculate estimate":"अनुमान की गणना करें","Reset inputs":"इनपुट रीसेट करें","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"वार्षिक राशि दर्ज करें और नियोक्ता का क्षेत्र और गतिविधि चुनें।","Annual estimate":"वार्षिक अनुमान","Gross payroll":"सकल वेतन","Holiday pay estimate":"अवकाश वेतन अनुमान","Other taxable pay and benefits":"अन्य कर योग्य वेतन और लाभ","Employer pension contribution":"नियोक्ता पेंशन योगदान","Employer contribution basis":"नियोक्ता योगदान आधार","Employer national insurance contribution":"नियोक्ता राष्ट्रीय बीमा योगदान","Other employer-paid costs":"नियोक्ता द्वारा भुगतान की गई अन्य लागतें","Estimated annual employer cost":"अनुमानित वार्षिक नियोक्ता लागत","Average monthly cost":"औसत मासिक लागत","Effective contribution rate":"प्रभावी योगदान दर","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"इस परिदृश्य द्वारा उपयोग किया जाने वाला विभेदक भत्ता","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"इस अनुमान के लिए भत्ता शेष है","Tax year":"कर वर्ष","Rate source checked":"दर स्रोत की जाँच की गई","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"जांचें कि प्रत्येक राशि एक वैध गैर-नकारात्मक संख्या है और प्रत्येक प्रतिशत सीमा के भीतर है।","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK सीमा प्रति उद्यम है, प्रति कर्मचारी नहीं। इस कैलेंडर वर्ष में उद्यम द्वारा पहले ही उपयोग की गई राशि दर्ज करें।","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"नॉर्वेजियन क्षेत्र नियोक्ता के पंजीकृत स्थान का अनुसरण करते हैं। स्कैटीटेटेन के नगर पालिका लुकअप का उपयोग करें; पृष्ठ आपकी भाषा से किसी क्षेत्र का अनुमान नहीं लगाता.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"अवकाश वेतन और पेंशन दरें संपादन योग्य योजना इनपुट हैं। आपके अनुबंध और योजना पर लागू होने वाली दर और पेंशन योग्य आधार का उपयोग करें।","No account or server upload is used.":"किसी खाते या सर्वर अपलोड का उपयोग नहीं किया जाता है।","Compare a second offer":"दूसरे ऑफर की तुलना करें","Offer B":"ऑफर बी","Offer comparison":"तुलना की पेशकश करें","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"दोनों ऑफ़र ऊपर चयनित नियोक्ता क्षेत्र और गतिविधि का उपयोग करते हैं। प्रत्येक विकल्प शेष ज़ोन Ia भत्ते को अलग से लागू करता है; दोनों परिदृश्य वैकल्पिक हैं और इन्हें एक साथ नहीं जोड़ा जाना चाहिए।","Offer A":"ऑफर ए","Difference (B − A)":"अंतर (बी - ए)"},"id":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Kalkulator Biaya Perusahaan Norwegia","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Kalkulator Biaya Perusahaan Norwegia 2026 — Penggajian, Pembayaran Hari Libur, dan Kontribusi Perusahaan","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Perkirakan biaya gaji tahunan Norwegia menggunakan tarif zona kontribusi pemberi kerja 2026. Tambahkan gaji liburan, pensiun, gaji kena pajak dan biaya lainnya dengan asumsi yang jelas.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Perkirakan biaya tahunan pemberi kerja di Norwegia mulai dari gaji, pembayaran liburan, iuran pensiun, dan kontribusi asuransi nasional pemberi kerja (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Berapa perkiraannya?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Masukkan total gaji tahunan, pilih zona iuran terdaftar dan jenis aktivitas perusahaan, lalu tambahkan pembayaran liburan, pensiun, dan kompensasi lainnya. Misalnya, 1,000,000 NOK basis iuran di zona I memberikan 141,000 NOK kontribusi pemberi kerja sebesar 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Cara kerja perkiraan","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Kalkulator menggunakan tarif zona 2026 yang dipublikasikan untuk aktivitas biasa atau pertanian/perikanan. Ini menambahkan pembayaran liburan yang dimasukkan, kompensasi kena pajak dan kontribusi pensiun apa pun ke dasar kontribusi. Untuk aktivitas biasa di zona Ia, tunjangan diferensial per perusahaan 850,000 NOK diterapkan pada jumlah yang dimasukkan seperti yang telah digunakan tahun ini. Hasilnya adalah perkiraan perencanaan tahunan; lokasi dan aktivitas terdaftar pemberi kerja menentukan aturan yang berlaku.","Frequently asked questions":"Pertanyaan yang sering diajukan","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Apakah ini menghitung gaji yang dibawa pulang karyawan?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Tidak. Laporan ini memperkirakan biaya pemberi kerja dan kontribusi pemberi kerja saja. Ini tidak menghitung pemotongan pajak atau pemotongan gaji karyawan.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Zona kontribusi mana yang harus saya pilih?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Pilih zona yang berlaku untuk lokasi bisnis terdaftar perusahaan, bukan bahasa atau negara asal karyawan. Verifikasi kotamadya dengan Skatteetaten sebelum mengandalkan hasilnya.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Apakah iuran pensiun 2% wajib bagi setiap pemberi kerja?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Tidak. Kewajiban pensiun akibat kerja bergantung pada apakah pemberi kerja dan pekerja memenuhi persyaratan hukum. Masukkan tingkat pensiun hanya jika sesuai dengan situasi Anda; premi skema sebenarnya bisa berbeda.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Apakah pembayaran liburan dan setiap biaya perekrutan sudah termasuk secara otomatis?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Tidak. Tingkat dan dasar pembayaran hari libur, gaji pensiun dan biaya lainnya merupakan asumsi yang dapat diedit. Asuransi, administrasi penggajian, tunjangan khusus, pengecualian dan batasan individu karyawan tidak sepenuhnya dimodelkan.","Scope and data date":"Cakupan dan tanggal data","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Tingkat iuran pemberi kerja di Norwegia ditetapkan berdasarkan tahun dan bervariasi berdasarkan zona dan aktivitas. Kalkulator ini berisi tarif yang dipublikasikan untuk tahun pajak 2026, tanggal 16 Oktober 2026; ini bukan pengajuan resmi atau keputusan hukum. Verifikasi tarif saat ini, penempatan zona, kelayakan dan tunjangan per perusahaan dengan Skatteetaten. Versi selanjutnya harus menyegarkan tarif statis tertanggal; halaman ini tidak memperbarui dirinya sendiri di latar belakang.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Berjalan di browser ini. Angka penggajian Anda tidak diunggah.","Estimate employer cost":"Perkirakan biaya pemberi kerja","Related tools":"Alat terkait","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · BERJALAN DI BROWSER ANDA","Language":"Bahasa","UsefulVerse":"Ayat Berguna","All tools":"Semua alat","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Total gaji kotor tahunan, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Dasar pembayaran liburan, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Tarif pembayaran liburan, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Gaji dan tunjangan kena pajak lainnya, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Gaji pensiun, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Tingkat iuran pensiun pemberi kerja, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Biaya lain yang ditanggung pemberi kerja, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Zona kontribusi pemberi kerja","Activity type":"Jenis aktivitas","Ordinary activity":"Aktivitas biasa","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Pertanian dan perikanan (tarif khusus yang dipublikasikan)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zona I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zona Ia — 14.1% biasa / 10.6% pertanian dan perikanan","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zona II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zona III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zona IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zona IVa — 7.9% biasa / 5.1% pertanian dan perikanan","Zone V — 0%":"Zona V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Tunjangan diferensial Zona Ia sudah digunakan tahun ini, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Hitung perkiraan","Reset inputs":"Setel ulang input","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Masukkan jumlah tahunan dan pilih zona dan aktivitas perusahaan.","Annual estimate":"Estimasi tahunan","Gross payroll":"Gaji kotor","Holiday pay estimate":"Perkiraan gaji liburan","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Gaji dan tunjangan kena pajak lainnya","Employer pension contribution":"Iuran pensiun pemberi kerja","Employer contribution basis":"Dasar kontribusi pemberi kerja","Employer national insurance contribution":"Kontribusi asuransi nasional pemberi kerja","Other employer-paid costs":"Biaya lain yang ditanggung pemberi kerja","Estimated annual employer cost":"Perkiraan biaya pemberi kerja tahunan","Average monthly cost":"Biaya bulanan rata-rata","Effective contribution rate":"Tingkat iuran efektif","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Tunjangan diferensial yang digunakan dalam skenario ini","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Tunjangan tersisa untuk perkiraan ini","Tax year":"Tahun pajak","Rate source checked":"Sumber nilai diperiksa","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Periksa apakah setiap jumlah adalah angka non-negatif yang valid dan setiap persentase berada dalam kisaran.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Ambang 850,000 NOK adalah per perusahaan, bukan per karyawan. Masukkan jumlah yang telah digunakan oleh perusahaan pada tahun kalender ini.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Zona Norwegia mengikuti lokasi terdaftar pemberi kerja. Gunakan pencarian kotamadya Skatteetaten; halaman tidak menyimpulkan zona dari bahasa Anda.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Gaji liburan dan tarif pensiun adalah masukan perencanaan yang dapat diedit. Gunakan tarif dan dasar pensiun yang berlaku untuk kontrak dan skema Anda.","No account or server upload is used.":"Tidak ada unggahan akun atau server yang digunakan.","Compare a second offer":"Bandingkan penawaran kedua","Offer B":"Penawaran B","Offer comparison":"Tawarkan perbandingan","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Kedua penawaran menggunakan zona pemberi kerja dan aktivitas yang dipilih di atas. Setiap alternatif menerapkan sisa jatah zona Ia secara terpisah; kedua skenario tersebut merupakan alternatif dan tidak boleh dijumlahkan.","Offer A":"Tawaran A","Difference (B − A)":"Selisih (B − A)"},"it":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Calcolatore dei costi del datore di lavoro in Norvegia","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Calcolatore dei costi del datore di lavoro norvegese 2026 — Buste paga, ferie e contributi del datore di lavoro","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Stima del costo annuale del personale norvegese utilizzando le tariffe della zona contributiva del datore di lavoro 2026. Aggiungere ferie, pensione, imponibile e altri costi con presupposti chiari.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Stima del costo annuale del datore di lavoro in Norvegia derivante da buste paga, ferie, contributi pensionistici e contributo assicurativo nazionale del datore di lavoro (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Cosa c'entra il preventivo?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Inserisci il totale della busta paga annuale, scegli la zona contributiva registrata del datore di lavoro e il tipo di attività, quindi aggiungi il pagamento delle ferie, la pensione e altri compensi. Ad esempio, 1,000,000 NOK di base contributiva nella zona I dà 141,000 NOK di contributo del datore di lavoro a 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Come funziona il preventivo","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Il calcolatore utilizza la tariffa zonale 2026 pubblicata per l'attività ordinaria o l'agricoltura/pesca. Aggiunge alla base contributiva l'indennità per ferie contabilizzata, il compenso imponibile e l'eventuale contributo pensionistico. Per l'attività ordinaria nella zona Ia, l'indennità differenziale per impresa 850,000 NOK viene applicata all'importo inserito come già utilizzato quest'anno. I risultati sono stime di pianificazione annuale; la sede e l’attività registrata del datore di lavoro determinano le norme applicabili.","Frequently asked questions":"Domande frequenti","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Calcola la retribuzione da portare a casa di un dipendente?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"N. Stima solo i costi del datore di lavoro e il contributo del datore di lavoro. Non calcola le ritenute fiscali o le detrazioni dalla retribuzione di un dipendente.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Quale zona contributiva devo scegliere?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Scegli la zona che si applica alla sede aziendale registrata del datore di lavoro, non alla lingua o al paese di origine del dipendente. Verificare il comune con Skateetaten prima di fare affidamento sul risultato.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Il contributo pensionistico 2% è obbligatorio per ogni datore di lavoro?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"N. Gli obblighi pensionistici aziendali e professionali dipendono dal fatto che il datore di lavoro e i lavoratori soddisfino le condizioni legali. Inserisci un tasso di pensione solo quando si applica alla tua situazione; the actual scheme premium can differ.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Il pagamento delle ferie e tutti i costi di assunzione sono inclusi automaticamente?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"N. Tasso e base retributiva per le ferie, busta paga pensionabile e altri costi sono ipotesi modificabili. Assicurazioni, amministrazione delle buste paga, benefici speciali, esenzioni e limiti individuali dei dipendenti non sono completamente modellati.","Scope and data date":"Ambito e data dei dati","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Le aliquote contributive del datore di lavoro norvegese sono stabilite per anno e variano in base alla zona e all'attività. Questo calcolatore contiene le aliquote pubblicate per l'anno fiscale 2026, datato 16 ottobre 2026; non si tratta di un deposito ufficiale o di una decisione legale. Verifica le tariffe attuali, il posizionamento in zone, l'idoneità e l'indennità per azienda con Skateetaten. Una build successiva deve aggiornare le tariffe statiche datate; questa pagina non si aggiorna in background.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Viene eseguito in questo browser. I dati della tua busta paga non vengono caricati.","Estimate employer cost":"Stima del costo del datore di lavoro","Related tools":"Strumenti correlati","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUITO · FUNZIONA NEL TUO BROWSER","Language":"Lingua","UsefulVerse":"Versetto utile","All tools":"Tutti gli strumenti","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Totale retribuzioni annue lorde, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Basato ferie, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Tasso ferie, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Altri salari e benefici imponibili, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Libro paga pensionabile, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Aliquota contributo pensionistico del datore di lavoro, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Altri costi a carico del datore di lavoro, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Zona contributiva del datore di lavoro","Activity type":"Tipo di attività","Ordinary activity":"Attività ordinaria","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Agricoltura e pesca (tariffe speciali pubblicate)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zona I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zona Ia — 14.1% ordinario / 10.6% agricoltura e pesca","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zona II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zona III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zona IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zona IVa — 7.9% ordinario / 5.1% agricoltura e pesca","Zone V — 0%":"Zona V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Indennità differenziale della zona Ia già utilizzata quest'anno, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Calcola preventivo","Reset inputs":"Reimposta ingressi","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Inserisci gli importi annuali e scegli la zona e l'attività del datore di lavoro.","Annual estimate":"Stima annuale","Gross payroll":"Libro paga lordo","Holiday pay estimate":"Stima retribuzione ferie","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Altri salari e benefici imponibili","Employer pension contribution":"Contributo pensionistico del datore di lavoro","Employer contribution basis":"Base contributiva del datore di lavoro","Employer national insurance contribution":"Contributo previdenziale nazionale del datore di lavoro","Other employer-paid costs":"Altri costi a carico del datore di lavoro","Estimated annual employer cost":"Costo annuale stimato per il datore di lavoro","Average monthly cost":"Costo medio mensile","Effective contribution rate":"Aliquota di contribuzione effettiva","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Assegno differenziale utilizzato da questo scenario","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Indennità rimanente per questa stima","Tax year":"Anno fiscale","Rate source checked":"Sorgente tariffa controllata","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Verifica che ogni importo sia un numero valido non negativo e che ogni percentuale rientri nell'intervallo.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"La soglia NOK 850,000 è per azienda, non per dipendente. Inserisci l'importo già utilizzato dall'impresa quest'anno solare.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Le zone norvegesi seguono l'ubicazione registrata del datore di lavoro. Utilizza la ricerca del comune di Skateetaten; la pagina non deduce una zona dalla tua lingua.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Le tariffe relative alle ferie e alla pensione sono input di pianificazione modificabili. Utilizza il tasso e la base pensionabile applicabili al tuo contratto e al tuo programma.","No account or server upload is used.":"Non viene utilizzato alcun account o caricamento su server.","Compare a second offer":"Confronta una seconda offerta","Offer B":"Offerta B","Offer comparison":"Confronto offerte","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Entrambe le offerte utilizzano la zona del datore di lavoro e l'attività selezionate sopra. Ciascuna alternativa applica separatamente la rimanente franchigia della zona Ia; i due scenari sono alternativi e non devono essere sommati.","Offer A":"Offerta A","Difference (B − A)":"Differenza (B − A)"},"ja":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"ノルウェーの雇用主コスト計算ツール","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"ノルウェーの雇用主コスト計算ツール 2026 — 給与計算、休日手当および雇用主の拠出金","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 雇用主負担ゾーン率を使用して、ノルウェーの年間人件費を見積もります。明確な仮定に基づいて、休日手当、年金、課税対象の給与、その他のコストを追加します。","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"給与、休日手当、年金拠出金、雇用主の国民保険料からノルウェーの年間雇用主コストを見積もります (arbeidsgiveravgift)。","What goes into the estimate?":"見積もりには何が含まれますか?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"年間給与総額を入力し、雇用主が登録した拠出ゾーンと活動タイプを選択して、休日手当、年金、その他の報酬を追加します。たとえば、ゾーン I の拠出基準の 1,000,000 NOK は、14.1% での雇用主拠出の 141,000 NOK を与えます。","How the estimate works":"見積もりの仕組み","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"計算機は、通常の活動または農業/漁業に対して公開されている 2026 ゾーン レートを使用します。入力された休日手当、課税対象の報酬、および年金拠出金が拠出基準に加算されます。ゾーン Ia の通常の活動の場合、企業ごとの差額引当金 850,000 NOK が、今年既に使用された入力金額に適用されます。結果は年間計画の推定値です。雇用主の登録所在地と活動により、適用される規則が決まります。","Frequently asked questions":"よくある質問","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"これは従業員の手取り給与を計算しますか?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"いいえ。雇用主のコストと雇用主の拠出金のみを推定します。源泉徴収税や従業員の給与からの控除は計算されません。","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"どの貢献ゾーンを選択すればよいですか?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"従業員の言語や母国ではなく、雇用主の登録事業所に適用されるゾーンを選択してください。結果を信頼する前に、Skatteetaten で自治体を確認してください。","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"2% の年金拠出はすべての雇用主に義務付けられていますか?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"いいえ。職業年金義務は、雇用主と労働者が法的条件を満たしているかどうかによって決まります。年金率は、自分の状況に当てはまる場合にのみ入力してください。実際の制度保険料は異なる場合があります。","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"休日手当とすべての雇用コストは自動的に含まれますか?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"いいえ。休日の賃金率と基準、年金支給の給与、その他のコストは編集可能な前提条件です。保険、給与管理、特別福利厚生、免除、および個々の従業員の制限は完全にはモデル化されていません。","Scope and data date":"範囲とデータ日付","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"ノルウェーの雇用主の拠出率は年ごとに設定され、ゾーンや活動によって異なります。この計算ツールには、16 10 月 2026 の日付で課税年度 2026 に公表された税率が含まれています。これは正式な申請または法的決定ではありません。 Skatteetaten を使用して、現在の料金、ゾーンの配置、資格、および企業ごとの手当を確認します。以降のビルドでは、日付の静的レートを更新する必要があります。このページはバックグラウンドでは更新されません。","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"このブラウザで実行されます。給与統計はアップロードされません。","Estimate employer cost":"雇用主コストの見積もり","Related tools":"関連ツール","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"無料 · ブラウザで実行可能","Language":"言語","UsefulVerse":"便利な詩","All tools":"すべてのツール","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"年間総給与総額、NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"休日給与ベース、NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"休日手当率、%","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"その他の課税対象の給与および福利厚生、NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"年金対象給与、NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"厚生年金保険料率、%","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"その他の雇用主負担の費用、NOK","Employer contribution zone":"雇用主拠出ゾーン","Activity type":"アクティビティ タイプ","Ordinary activity":"通常の活動","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"農業および漁業 (特別公開料金)","Zone I — 14.1%":"ゾーン I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"ゾーン Ia — 14.1% 普通 / 10.6% 農業および漁業","Zone II — 10.6%":"ゾーン II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"ゾーン III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"ゾーン IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"ゾーン IVa — 7.9% 普通 / 5.1% 農業および漁業","Zone V — 0%":"ゾーン V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"ゾーン Ia の差動許容量は今年すでに使用されています、NOK","Calculate estimate":"見積もりを計算する","Reset inputs":"リセット入力","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"年間金額を入力し、雇用主のゾーンとアクティビティを選択します。","Annual estimate":"年間推定値","Gross payroll":"総給与","Holiday pay estimate":"休日給与の見積もり","Other taxable pay and benefits":"その他の課税対象の給与および福利厚生","Employer pension contribution":"雇用主年金拠出金","Employer contribution basis":"雇用主拠出ベース","Employer national insurance contribution":"雇用主の国民保険料","Other employer-paid costs":"その他の雇用主負担の費用","Estimated annual employer cost":"Estimated annual employer cost","Average monthly cost":"Average monthly cost","Effective contribution rate":"Effective contribution rate","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"このシナリオで使用される差額許容値","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Allowance remaining for this estimate","Tax year":"課税年度","Rate source checked":"Rate source checked","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"すべての金額が有効な非負の数値であり、すべてのパーセンテージが範囲内であることを確認してください。","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK しきい値は従業員ごとではなく企業ごとです。企業が今年暦年にすでに使用した金額を入力します。","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"ノルウェーのゾーンは雇用主の登録所在地に従います。 Skatteetaten の自治体検索を使用します。ページは言語からゾーンを推測しません。","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"休日給与と年金率は編集可能な計画入力です。契約と制度に適用される金利と年金受給基準を使用してください。","No account or server upload is used.":"アカウントまたはサーバーのアップロードは使用されません。","Compare a second offer":"2 番目のオファーを比較する","Offer B":"オファー B","Offer comparison":"オファーの比較","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"どちらのオファーも、上で選択した雇用主ゾーンとアクティビティを使用します。各選択肢は、残りのゾーン Ia の許容量を個別に適用します。 2 つのシナリオは代替であり、一緒に追加しないでください。","Offer A":"オファー A","Difference (B − A)":"差分 (B − A)"},"ko":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"노르웨이 고용주 비용 계산기","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"노르웨이 고용주 비용 계산기 2026 — 급여, 휴일 수당 및 고용주 분담금","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 고용주 기여 구역 요율을 사용하여 노르웨이의 연간 급여 비용을 추정합니다. 명확한 가정을 바탕으로 휴일 수당, 연금, 과세 급여 및 기타 비용을 추가하세요.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"급여, 휴가 수당, 연금 기여금 및 고용주의 국민 보험료(arbeidsgiveravgift)를 통해 노르웨이의 연간 고용주 비용을 추정합니다.","What goes into the estimate?":"추정에는 무엇이 포함됩니까?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"총 연간 급여를 입력하고 고용주의 등록된 기여 영역 및 활동 유형을 선택한 다음 휴일 수당, 연금 및 기타 보상을 추가하십시오. 예를 들어, 구역 I의 기여 기준 1,000,000 NOK는 14.1%의 고용주 기여금 141,000 NOK를 제공합니다.","How the estimate works":"추정 작동 방식","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"계산기는 일반 활동 또는 농업/어업에 대해 게시된 2026 구역 비율을 사용합니다. 입력된 휴일 수당, 과세 보상 및 연금 기여금을 기여금 기준에 추가합니다. 영역 Ia의 일반적인 활동의 경우 올해 이미 사용된 금액에 기업별 차등 수당 850,000 NOK가 적용됩니다. 결과는 연간 계획 추정치입니다. 고용주의 등록된 위치와 활동에 따라 적용 가능한 규칙이 결정됩니다.","Frequently asked questions":"자주 묻는 질문","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"이것은 직원의 실제 급여를 계산합니까?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"아니요. 고용주 비용과 고용주 기여금만 추정합니다. 직원 급여에서 원천징수세나 공제액을 계산하지 않습니다.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"어떤 기여 영역을 선택해야 합니까?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"직원의 언어나 본국이 아닌 고용주의 등록 사업장 위치에 적용되는 구역을 선택하십시오. 결과에 의존하기 전에 Skatteetaten에 지방자치단체를 확인하세요.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"2% 연금 기여는 모든 고용주에게 필수입니까?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"아니요. 기업연금 의무는 고용주와 근로자가 법적 조건을 충족하는지 여부에 따라 달라집니다. 귀하의 상황에 적용되는 경우에만 연금 요율을 입력하십시오. 실제 제도 보험료는 다를 수 있습니다.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"휴일 수당과 모든 채용 비용은 자동으로 포함됩니까?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"아니요. 휴일 급여율 및 기준, 연금 지급 급여 및 기타 비용은 편집 가능한 가정입니다. 보험, 급여 관리, 특별 혜택, 면제 및 개별 직원 한도는 완전히 모델링되지 않았습니다.","Scope and data date":"범위 및 데이터 날짜","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"노르웨이 고용주 기여율은 연도별로 설정되며 구역 및 활동에 따라 다릅니다. 이 계산기에는 16 10월 2026 날짜의 과세 연도 2026에 게시된 세율이 포함되어 있습니다. 이는 공식적인 서류 제출이나 법적 결정이 아닙니다. Skatteetaten을 통해 현재 요율, 구역 배치, 자격 및 기업별 수당을 확인하세요. 이후 빌드에서는 날짜가 지정된 고정 요율을 새로 고쳐야 합니다. 이 페이지는 백그라운드에서 자동으로 업데이트되지 않습니다.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"이 브라우저에서 실행됩니다. 귀하의 급여 수치가 업로드되지 않았습니다.","Estimate employer cost":"고용주 비용 추정","Related tools":"관련 도구","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"무료 · 브라우저에서 실행","Language":"언어","UsefulVerse":"유용한 구절","All tools":"모든 도구","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"총 연간 총 급여, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"휴일 급여 기준, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"휴일수당 요율, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"기타 과세 급여 및 혜택, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"연금 지급 급여, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"고용주 연금 기여율, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"기타 고용주 지불 비용, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"고용주 기여 구역","Activity type":"활동 유형","Ordinary activity":"일반 활동","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"농업 및 어업(특별 공시 요금)","Zone I — 14.1%":"영역 I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"구역 Ia — 14.1% 일반 / 10.6% 농업 및 어업","Zone II — 10.6%":"영역 II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"영역 III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"영역 IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"구역 IVa — 7.9% 일반 / 5.1% 농업 및 어업","Zone V — 0%":"영역 V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Zone Ia 차등 허용치는 올해 이미 사용되었습니다. NOK","Calculate estimate":"견적 계산","Reset inputs":"입력 재설정","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"연간 금액을 입력하고 고용주의 구역과 활동을 선택하세요.","Annual estimate":"연간 추정치","Gross payroll":"총 급여","Holiday pay estimate":"휴일 급여 추정","Other taxable pay and benefits":"기타 과세 대상 급여 및 혜택","Employer pension contribution":"고용주 연금 기여금","Employer contribution basis":"고용주 기여 기준","Employer national insurance contribution":"고용주 국민보험 기여금","Other employer-paid costs":"기타 고용주 지불 비용","Estimated annual employer cost":"예상 연간 고용주 비용","Average monthly cost":"평균 월 비용","Effective contribution rate":"유효 기여율","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"이 시나리오에서 사용되는 차등 허용","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"이 추정에 대해 남은 허용량","Tax year":"과세연도","Rate source checked":"비율 소스 확인됨","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"모든 금액이 음수가 아닌 유효한 숫자이고 모든 백분율이 범위 내에 있는지 확인하십시오.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK 임계값은 직원별이 아닌 기업별입니다. 올해 기업에서 이미 사용한 금액을 입력합니다.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"노르웨이 지역은 고용주의 등록 위치를 따릅니다. Skatteetaten의 지방자치단체 조회를 사용하세요. 페이지는 귀하의 언어에서 영역을 추론하지 않습니다.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"휴일 급여 및 연금 요율은 편집 가능한 계획 입력입니다. 귀하의 계약과 계획에 적용되는 요율과 연금 지급 기준을 사용하십시오.","No account or server upload is used.":"계정 또는 서버 업로드가 사용되지 않습니다.","Compare a second offer":"두 번째 제안 비교","Offer B":"제안 B","Offer comparison":"오퍼 비교","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"두 제안 모두 위에서 선택한 고용주 영역과 활동을 사용합니다. 각 대안은 나머지 구역 Ia 허용량을 별도로 적용합니다. 두 시나리오는 대안이므로 함께 추가하면 안 됩니다.","Offer A":"제안 A","Difference (B − A)":"차이(B − A)"},"mr":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"नॉर्वे नियोक्ता खर्च कॅल्क्युलेटर","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"नॉर्वे नियोक्ता खर्च कॅल्क्युलेटर 2026 — वेतन, सुट्टीचा पगार आणि नियोक्ता योगदान","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 नियोक्ता योगदान क्षेत्र दर वापरून वार्षिक नॉर्वेजियन वेतन खर्चाचा अंदाज लावा. सुट्टीचे वेतन, पेन्शन, करपात्र वेतन आणि इतर खर्च स्पष्ट गृहितकांसह जोडा.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"पगार, सुट्टीचे वेतन, पेन्शन योगदान आणि नियोक्त्याचे राष्ट्रीय विमा योगदान (arbeidsgiveravgift) यावरून नॉर्वेमधील वार्षिक नियोक्ता खर्चाचा अंदाज लावा.","What goes into the estimate?":"अंदाजात काय जाते?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"एकूण वार्षिक पगार प्रविष्ट करा, नियोक्त्याचे नोंदणीकृत योगदान क्षेत्र आणि क्रियाकलाप प्रकार निवडा, नंतर सुट्टीचे वेतन, पेन्शन आणि इतर भरपाई जोडा. उदाहरणार्थ, झोन I मध्ये योगदानाच्या आधारावर 1,000,000 NOK 14.1% वर नियोक्ता योगदानाचे 141,000 NOK देते.","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कसे कार्य करते","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"कॅल्क्युलेटर सामान्य क्रियाकलाप किंवा शेती/मासेमारीसाठी प्रकाशित 2026 झोन दर वापरतो. हे योगदानाच्या आधारावर प्रविष्ट केलेले सुट्टीचे वेतन, करपात्र भरपाई आणि कोणतेही पेन्शन योगदान जोडते. झोन Ia मधील सामान्य क्रियाकलापांसाठी, 850,000 NOK प्रति-एंटरप्राइझ भिन्नता भत्ता या वर्षी आधीच वापरल्याप्रमाणे प्रविष्ट केलेल्या रकमेवर लागू केला जातो. परिणाम वार्षिक नियोजन अंदाज आहेत; नियोक्त्याचे नोंदणीकृत स्थान आणि क्रियाकलाप लागू नियम निर्धारित करतात.","Frequently asked questions":"वारंवार विचारले जाणारे प्रश्न","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"हे कर्मचाऱ्याच्या घरी टेक-होम पगाराची गणना करते का?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"नं. हे केवळ नियोक्ता खर्च आणि नियोक्ता योगदानाचा अंदाज लावते. हे कर्मचाऱ्याच्या पगारातून कर किंवा कपातीची गणना करत नाही.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"मी कोणते योगदान क्षेत्र निवडावे?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"कर्मचाऱ्याची भाषा किंवा मूळ देश नव्हे तर नियोक्त्याच्या नोंदणीकृत व्यवसाय स्थानावर लागू होणारा झोन निवडा. निकालावर विसंबून राहण्याआधी Skatteetaten सह पालिकेची पडताळणी करा.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"प्रत्येक नियोक्त्यासाठी 2% पेन्शन योगदान अनिवार्य आहे का?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"नं. नियोक्ता आणि कर्मचारी कायदेशीर अटी पूर्ण करतात की नाही यावर व्यावसायिक पेन्शन कर्तव्ये अवलंबून असतात. पेन्शन दर तुमच्या परिस्थितीला लागू होतो तेव्हाच प्रविष्ट करा; वास्तविक योजनेचा प्रीमियम भिन्न असू शकतो.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"सुट्टीचा पगार आणि प्रत्येक कामाचा खर्च आपोआप समाविष्ट केला जातो का?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"नं. सुट्टीचे वेतन दर आणि आधार, पेन्शनपात्र वेतन आणि इतर खर्च हे संपादन करण्यायोग्य गृहीतके आहेत. विमा, पगार प्रशासन, विशेष लाभ, सूट आणि वैयक्तिक कर्मचारी मर्यादा पूर्णपणे मॉडेल केलेले नाहीत.","Scope and data date":"व्याप्ती आणि डेटा तारीख","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"नॉर्वेजियन नियोक्ता योगदान दर वर्षानुसार सेट केले जातात आणि झोन आणि क्रियाकलापानुसार बदलतात. या कॅल्क्युलेटरमध्ये कर वर्ष 2026, दिनांक 16 ऑक्टोबर 2026 साठी प्रकाशित दर समाविष्ट आहेत; तो अधिकृत फाइलिंग किंवा कायदेशीर निर्णय नाही. Skatteetaten सह वर्तमान दर, झोन प्लेसमेंट, पात्रता आणि प्रति-एंटरप्राइझ भत्ता सत्यापित करा. नंतरच्या बिल्डने दिनांकित स्थिर दर रीफ्रेश करणे आवश्यक आहे; हे पृष्ठ पार्श्वभूमीत स्वतःला अद्यतनित करत नाही.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालते. तुमचे वेतन आकडे अपलोड केलेले नाहीत.","Estimate employer cost":"नियोक्ता खर्चाचा अंदाज लावा","Related tools":"संबंधित साधने","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"विनामूल्य · तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालते","Language":"भाषा","UsefulVerse":"उपयोगी वचन","All tools":"सर्व साधने","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"एकूण वार्षिक सकल वेतन, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"सुट्टी-वेतन आधार, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"सुट्टी-पगार दर, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"इतर करपात्र वेतन आणि फायदे, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"पेन्शनपात्र वेतन, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"नियोक्ता पेन्शन योगदान दर, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"इतर नियोक्त्याने सशुल्क खर्च, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"नियोक्ता योगदान क्षेत्र","Activity type":"क्रियाकलाप प्रकार","Ordinary activity":"सामान्य क्रियाकलाप","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"शेती आणि मासेमारी (विशेष प्रकाशित दर)","Zone I — 14.1%":"झोन I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zone Ia — 14.1% सामान्य / 10.6% शेती आणि मासेमारी","Zone II — 10.6%":"झोन II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"झोन III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"झोन IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"झोन IVa — 7.9% सामान्य / 5.1% शेती आणि मासेमारी","Zone V — 0%":"झोन V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Zone Ia विभेदक भत्ता या वर्षी आधीच वापरला गेला आहे, NOK","Calculate estimate":"अंदाज मोजा","Reset inputs":"रीसेट इनपुट","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"वार्षिक रक्कम एंटर करा आणि नियोक्ताचा झोन आणि क्रियाकलाप निवडा.","Annual estimate":"वार्षिक अंदाज","Gross payroll":"एकूण वेतन","Holiday pay estimate":"सुट्टीच्या वेतनाचा अंदाज","Other taxable pay and benefits":"इतर करपात्र वेतन आणि फायदे","Employer pension contribution":"नियोक्ता पेन्शन योगदान","Employer contribution basis":"नियोक्ता योगदान आधार","Employer national insurance contribution":"नियोक्ता राष्ट्रीय विमा योगदान","Other employer-paid costs":"इतर नियोक्ता-पेड खर्च","Estimated annual employer cost":"अंदाजित वार्षिक नियोक्ता खर्च","Average monthly cost":"सरासरी मासिक खर्च","Effective contribution rate":"प्रभावी योगदान दर","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"या परिस्थितीद्वारे वापरलेला भिन्नता भत्ता","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"या अंदाजासाठी शिल्लक भत्ता","Tax year":"कर वर्ष","Rate source checked":"दर स्रोत तपासले","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"प्रत्येक रक्कम ही वैध नॉन-ऋणात्मक संख्या आहे आणि प्रत्येक टक्केवारी मर्यादेत आहे हे तपासा.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK थ्रेशोल्ड प्रति एंटरप्राइझ आहे, प्रति कर्मचारी नाही. या कॅलेंडर वर्षात एंटरप्राइझने आधीच वापरलेली रक्कम प्रविष्ट करा.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"नॉर्वेजियन झोन नियोक्ताच्या नोंदणीकृत स्थानाचे अनुसरण करतात. Skatteetaten च्या नगरपालिका लुकअप वापरा; पृष्ठ आपल्या भाषेतून क्षेत्राचा अंदाज लावत नाही.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"सुट्टीचे वेतन आणि पेन्शन दर हे संपादन करण्यायोग्य नियोजन इनपुट आहेत. तुमच्या करार आणि योजनेला लागू होणारे दर आणि पेन्शनपात्र आधार वापरा.","No account or server upload is used.":"कोणतेही खाते किंवा सर्व्हर अपलोड वापरलेले नाही.","Compare a second offer":"दुसऱ्या ऑफरची तुलना करा","Offer B":"ऑफर बी","Offer comparison":"ऑफर तुलना","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"दोन्ही ऑफर वर निवडलेल्या नियोक्ता क्षेत्र आणि क्रियाकलाप वापरतात. प्रत्येक पर्यायी उर्वरित झोन Ia भत्ता स्वतंत्रपणे लागू करतो; दोन परिस्थिती पर्यायी आहेत आणि एकत्र जोडल्या जाऊ नयेत.","Offer A":"ऑफर ए","Difference (B − A)":"फरक (B − A)"},"ms":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Kalkulator Kos Majikan Norway","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Kalkulator Kos Majikan Norway 2026 — Gaji, Gaji Percutian dan Caruman Majikan","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Anggaran kos gaji tahunan Norway menggunakan kadar zon caruman majikan 2026. Tambah gaji percutian, pencen, gaji bercukai dan kos lain dengan andaian yang jelas.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Anggaran kos tahunan majikan di Norway daripada gaji, gaji percutian, caruman pencen dan caruman insurans nasional majikan (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Apakah yang termasuk dalam anggaran?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Masukkan jumlah gaji tahunan, pilih zon caruman berdaftar majikan dan jenis aktiviti, kemudian tambah gaji percutian, pencen dan pampasan lain. Sebagai contoh, 1,000,000 NOK asas caruman dalam zon I memberikan 141,000 NOK caruman majikan pada 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Cara anggaran berfungsi","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Kalkulator menggunakan kadar zon 2026 yang diterbitkan untuk aktiviti biasa atau pertanian/memancing. Ia menambah gaji cuti yang dimasukkan, pampasan bercukai dan sebarang caruman pencen kepada asas caruman. Untuk aktiviti biasa di zon Ia, elaun pembezaan 850,000 NOK setiap perusahaan digunakan pada amaun yang dimasukkan seperti yang telah digunakan tahun ini. Keputusan adalah anggaran perancangan tahunan; lokasi dan aktiviti berdaftar majikan menentukan peraturan yang terpakai.","Frequently asked questions":"Soalan lazim","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Adakah ini mengira gaji bawa pulang pekerja?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"No. Ia menganggarkan kos majikan dan caruman majikan sahaja. Ia tidak mengira cukai pegangan atau potongan daripada gaji pekerja.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Zon sumbangan manakah yang harus saya pilih?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Pilih zon yang digunakan untuk lokasi perniagaan berdaftar majikan, bukan bahasa pekerja atau negara asal. Sahkan perbandaran dengan Skatteetaten sebelum bergantung pada keputusan.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Adakah caruman pencen 2% wajib bagi setiap majikan?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"No. Duti pencen pekerjaan bergantung kepada sama ada majikan dan tenaga kerja memenuhi syarat undang-undang. Masukkan kadar pencen hanya apabila ia terpakai kepada situasi anda; premium skim sebenar boleh berbeza.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Adakah gaji percutian dan setiap kos pengambilan pekerja disertakan secara automatik?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"No. Kadar dan asas gaji percutian, gaji berpencen dan kos lain ialah andaian yang boleh diedit. Insurans, pentadbiran gaji, faedah istimewa, pengecualian dan had pekerja individu tidak dimodelkan sepenuhnya.","Scope and data date":"Skop dan tarikh data","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Kadar caruman majikan Norway ditetapkan mengikut tahun dan berbeza mengikut zon dan aktiviti. Kalkulator ini mengandungi kadar yang diterbitkan untuk tahun cukai 2026, bertarikh 16 Oktober 2026; ia bukan pemfailan rasmi atau keputusan undang-undang. Sahkan kadar semasa, penempatan zon, kelayakan dan elaun setiap perusahaan dengan Skatteetaten. Binaan kemudian mesti memuat semula kadar statik bertarikh; halaman ini tidak mengemas kini sendiri di latar belakang.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Berjalan dalam penyemak imbas ini. Angka gaji anda tidak dimuat naik.","Estimate employer cost":"Anggaran kos majikan","Related tools":"Alat berkaitan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"PERCUMA · DIJALANKAN DALAM PENYIARI SEMAK ANDA","Language":"Bahasa","UsefulVerse":"Ayat Berguna","All tools":"Semua alatan","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Jumlah gaji kasar tahunan, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Asas gaji-cuti, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Kadar gaji-cuti, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Gaji dan faedah bercukai lain, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Gaji berpencen, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Kadar caruman pencen majikan, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Kos lain yang dibayar oleh majikan, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Zon caruman majikan","Activity type":"Jenis aktiviti","Ordinary activity":"Aktiviti biasa","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Pertanian dan perikanan (kadar diterbitkan khas)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zon I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zon Ia — 14.1% biasa / 10.6% pertanian dan perikanan","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zon II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zon III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zon IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zon IVa — 7.9% biasa / 5.1% pertanian dan perikanan","Zone V — 0%":"Zon V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Elaun pembezaan Zon Ia sudah digunakan tahun ini, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Kira anggaran","Reset inputs":"Tetapkan semula input","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Masukkan jumlah tahunan dan pilih zon dan aktiviti majikan.","Annual estimate":"Anggaran tahunan","Gross payroll":"Gaji kasar","Holiday pay estimate":"Anggaran gaji percutian","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Gaji dan faedah bercukai lain","Employer pension contribution":"Caruman pencen majikan","Employer contribution basis":"Asas caruman majikan","Employer national insurance contribution":"Caruman insurans nasional majikan","Other employer-paid costs":"Kos lain yang dibayar oleh majikan","Estimated annual employer cost":"Anggaran kos tahunan majikan","Average monthly cost":"Purata kos bulanan","Effective contribution rate":"Kadar sumbangan berkesan","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Elaun pembezaan yang digunakan oleh senario ini","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Elaun tinggal untuk anggaran ini","Tax year":"Tahun cukai","Rate source checked":"Sumber kadar disemak","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Semak bahawa setiap amaun ialah nombor bukan negatif yang sah dan setiap peratusan berada dalam julat.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Ambang NOK 850,000 ialah setiap perusahaan, bukan setiap pekerja. Masukkan amaun yang telah digunakan oleh perusahaan pada tahun kalendar ini.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Zon Norway mengikut lokasi berdaftar majikan. Gunakan carian perbandaran Skatteetaten; halaman tidak membuat kesimpulan zon daripada bahasa anda.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Kadar gaji dan pencen adalah input perancangan yang boleh diedit. Gunakan kadar dan asas berpencen yang digunakan untuk kontrak dan skim anda.","No account or server upload is used.":"Tiada muat naik akaun atau pelayan digunakan.","Compare a second offer":"Bandingkan tawaran kedua","Offer B":"Tawaran B","Offer comparison":"Perbandingan tawaran","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Kedua-dua tawaran menggunakan zon majikan dan aktiviti yang dipilih di atas. Setiap alternatif menggunakan baki elaun Ia zon secara berasingan; kedua-dua senario adalah alternatif dan tidak boleh ditambah bersama.","Offer A":"Tawaran A","Difference (B − A)":"Perbezaan (B − A)"},"nb":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Norge Arbeidsgiverkostnadskalkulator","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Norge Arbeidsgiverkostnadskalkulator 2026 — Lønn, feriepenger og arbeidsgiveravgift","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Beregn årlige norske lønnskostnader ved å bruke 2026 arbeidsgiveravgiftssonesatsene. Legg til feriepenger, pensjon, skattepliktig lønn og andre kostnader med klare forutsetninger.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Beregn årlig arbeidsgiverkostnad i Norge fra lønn, feriepenger, pensjonsinnskudd og arbeidsgiveravgift (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Hva går inn i estimatet?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Skriv inn total årslønn, velg arbeidsgivers registrerte avgiftssone og aktivitetstype, legg deretter til feriepenger, pensjon og annen kompensasjon. Eksempelvis gir 1,000,000 kr av bidragsgrunnlag i sone I 141,000 kr arbeidsgiveravgift ved 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Hvordan estimatet fungerer","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Kalkulatoren bruker den publiserte 2026 sonesatsen for ordinær aktivitet eller landbruk/fiske. Den legger inn ført feriepenger, skattepliktig godtgjørelse og eventuelt pensjonsinnskudd til innskuddsgrunnlaget. For ordinær virksomhet i sone Ia legges 850,000 kr per virksomhetsdifferansegodtgjørelse på beløpet som er ført som allerede benyttet i år. Resultatene er årlige planleggingsestimater; arbeidsgivers registrerte plassering og aktivitet bestemmer gjeldende regler.","Frequently asked questions":"Ofte stilte spørsmål","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Beregner dette en ansatts hjemtakslønn?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Nr. Den anslår kun arbeidsgiverkostnader og arbeidsgiveravgift. Den beregner ikke kildeskatt eller trekk fra en ansatts lønn.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Hvilken bidragssone bør jeg velge?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Velg sonen som gjelder for arbeidsgiverens registrerte virksomhetssted, ikke arbeidstakerens språk eller hjemland. Verifiser kommunen med Skatteetaten før du stoler på resultatet.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Er et 2 % pensjonsbidrag obligatorisk for hver arbeidsgiver?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Nr. Tjenestepensjonspliktene avhenger av om arbeidsgiver og arbeidsstyrke oppfyller lovkravene. Angi en pensjonssats kun når den gjelder din situasjon; den faktiske ordningspremien kan variere.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Inkluderes feriepenger og alle leiekostnader automatisk?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Nr. Feriepengersats og grunnlag, pensjonsgivende lønn og andre kostnader er redigerbare forutsetninger. Forsikring, lønnsadministrasjon, særgoder, fritak og individuelle ansattgrenser er ikke fullt ut modellert.","Scope and data date":"Omfang og datadato","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Norske arbeidsgiveravgiftssatser er fastsatt etter år og varierer etter sone og aktivitet. Denne kalkulatoren inneholder satsene publisert for skatteåret 2026, datert 16 oktober 2026; det er ikke en offisiell innlevering eller juridisk avgjørelse. Kontroller gjeldende satser, soneplassering, berettigelse og bedriftsgodtgjørelse med Skatteetaten. En senere build må oppdatere de daterte statiske frekvensene; denne siden oppdaterer seg ikke i bakgrunnen.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Kjøres i denne nettleseren. Lønnstallene dine lastes ikke opp.","Estimate employer cost":"Beregn arbeidsgiverkostnad","Related tools":"Relaterte verktøy","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KJØRER I NETTLESEREN DIN","Language":"Språk","UsefulVerse":"NyttigVerse","All tools":"Alle verktøy","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Total årlig bruttolønn, kr","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Ferielønnsgrunnlag, kr","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Ferielønnssats, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Annen skattepliktig lønn og ytelser, kr","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Pensjonsgivende lønn, kr","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Innskuddssats for arbeidsgiverpensjon, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Andre arbeidsgiverbetalte kostnader, kr","Employer contribution zone":"Arbeidsgiveravgiftssone","Activity type":"Aktivitetstype","Ordinary activity":"Vanlig aktivitet","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Landbruk og fiske (spesielle publiserte priser)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Sone I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Sone Ia — 14.1% vanlig / 10.6% landbruk og fiske","Zone II — 10.6%":"Sone II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Sone III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Sone IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Sone IVa — 7.9% ordinær / 5.1% landbruk og fiske","Zone V — 0%":"Sone V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Sone Ia differensialgodtgjørelse allerede benyttet i år, kr","Calculate estimate":"Beregn estimat","Reset inputs":"Tilbakestill innganger","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Skriv inn de årlige beløpene og velg arbeidsgivers sone og aktivitet.","Annual estimate":"Årlig estimat","Gross payroll":"Bruttolønn","Holiday pay estimate":"Estimat for ferielønn","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Annen skattepliktig lønn og goder","Employer pension contribution":"Arbeidsgiverpensjonsinnskudd","Employer contribution basis":"Arbeidsgiveravgiftsgrunnlag","Employer national insurance contribution":"Arbeidsgiveravgift","Other employer-paid costs":"Andre arbeidsgiverbetalte kostnader","Estimated annual employer cost":"Estimert årlig arbeidsgiverkostnad","Average monthly cost":"Gjennomsnittlig månedlig kostnad","Effective contribution rate":"Effektiv bidragssats","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Differensialgodtgjørelse brukt av dette scenariet","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Tillegg gjenstår for dette anslaget","Tax year":"Skatteår","Rate source checked":"Priskilde sjekket","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Sjekk at hvert beløp er et gyldig ikke-negativt tall og at hver prosent er innenfor rekkevidden.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK-terskelen er per bedrift, ikke per ansatt. Angi beløpet som allerede er brukt av bedriften dette kalenderåret.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Norske soner følger arbeidsgivers registrerte sted. Bruk Skatteetatens kommuneoppslag; siden utleder ikke en sone fra språket ditt.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Feriepenger og pensjonssatser er redigerbare planleggingsinndata. Bruk satsen og pensjonsgrunnlaget som gjelder for din kontrakt og ordning.","No account or server upload is used.":"Ingen konto- eller serveropplasting brukes.","Compare a second offer":"Sammenlign et annet tilbud","Offer B":"Tilbud B","Offer comparison":"Sammenligning av tilbud","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Begge tilbud bruker arbeidsgiversonen og aktiviteten valgt ovenfor. Hvert alternativ anvender den resterende sone Ia-godtgjørelsen separat; de to scenariene er alternativer og må ikke legges sammen.","Offer A":"Tilbud A","Difference (B − A)":"Differanse (B − A)"},"nl":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Rekenmachine voor werkgeverskosten in Noorwegen","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Noorwegen werkgeverskostencalculator 2026 — Salaris, vakantiegeld en werkgeversbijdrage","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Schat de jaarlijkse Noorse loonkosten met behulp van de 2026 werkgeversbijdragezonetarieven. Voeg vakantiegeld, pensioen, belastbaar loon en andere kosten toe met duidelijke aannames.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Schatting van de jaarlijkse werkgeverskosten in Noorwegen op basis van salaris, vakantiegeld, pensioenpremies en de werkgeversbijdrage voor de volksverzekeringen (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Wat zit er in de schatting?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Voer de totale jaarlijkse loonsom in, kies de door de werkgever geregistreerde bijdragezone en het activiteitstype en voeg vervolgens vakantiegeld, pensioen en andere compensatie toe. 1,000,000 NOK van de bijdragebasis in zone I geeft bijvoorbeeld 141,000 NOK van de werkgeversbijdrage tegen 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Hoe de schatting werkt","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"De rekenmachine gebruikt het gepubliceerde 2026 zonetarief voor gewone activiteiten of landbouw/visserij. Het telt het ingevoerde vakantiegeld, de belastbare vergoeding en de eventuele pensioenbijdrage op bij de premiegrondslag. Voor gewone activiteiten in zone Ia wordt de 850,000 differentiële aftrek per onderneming toegepast op het ingevoerde bedrag dat dit jaar al is gebruikt. De resultaten zijn jaarlijkse planningsschattingen; de geregistreerde locatie en activiteit van de werkgever bepalen de toepasselijke regels.","Frequently asked questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Berekent dit het nettoloon van een werknemer?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Nr. Er worden uitsluitend werkgeverskosten en werkgeversbijdragen geraamd. Er wordt geen bronbelasting of inhoudingen op het loon van een werknemer berekend.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Welke bijdragezone moet ik kiezen?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Kies de zone die van toepassing is op de geregistreerde bedrijfslocatie van de werkgever, niet op de taal of het thuisland van de werknemer. Verifieer de gemeente bij Skatteetaten voordat u op het resultaat vertrouwt.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Is een pensioenpremie 2% verplicht voor iedere werkgever?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Nr. De bedrijfspensioenplichten zijn afhankelijk van de vraag of de werkgever en het personeel aan de wettelijke voorwaarden voldoen. Vul alleen een pensioentarief in als dit op uw situatie van toepassing is; de daadwerkelijke regelingspremie kan verschillen.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Zijn vakantiegeld en alle aanwervingskosten automatisch inbegrepen?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Nr. Het vakantiegeldtarief en de basis ervan, de pensioengrondslag en andere kosten zijn bewerkbare veronderstellingen. Verzekeringen, loonadministratie, bijzondere voordelen, vrijstellingen en individuele werknemerslimieten zijn niet volledig gemodelleerd.","Scope and data date":"Reikwijdte en datadatum","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"De Noorse werkgeversbijdragen worden per jaar vastgesteld en variëren per zone en activiteit. Deze calculator bevat de tarieven die zijn gepubliceerd voor belastingjaar 2026, gedateerd 16 oktober 2026; het is geen officiële aanvraag of juridische beslissing. Controleer de huidige tarieven, zoneplaatsing, geschiktheid en de vergoeding per onderneming met Skatteetaten. Een latere build moet de gedateerde statische tarieven vernieuwen; deze pagina wordt niet op de achtergrond bijgewerkt.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Wordt uitgevoerd in deze browser. Uw looncijfers worden niet geüpload.","Estimate employer cost":"Schatting van de werkgeverskosten","Related tools":"Gerelateerde hulpmiddelen","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · DRAAIT IN UW BROWSER","Language":"Taal","UsefulVerse":"Handig vers","All tools":"Alle gereedschappen","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Totale jaarlijkse brutoloonsom, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Vakantiebasis, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Vakantiebetalingspercentage, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Overige belastbare lonen en voordelen, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Pensioengrondslag, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Pensioenbijdrage werkgever, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Overige door de werkgever betaalde kosten, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Werkgeversbijdragezone","Activity type":"Type activiteit","Ordinary activity":"Gewone bezigheid","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Landbouw en visserij (speciale gepubliceerde tarieven)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zone I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zone Ia — 14.1% gewoon / 10.6% landbouw en visserij","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zone II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zone III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zone IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zone IVa — 7.9% gewoon / 5.1% landbouw en visserij","Zone V — 0%":"Zone V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Zone Ia differentiële vergoeding wordt dit jaar al gebruikt, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Bereken schatting","Reset inputs":"Ingangen resetten","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Vul de jaarbedragen in en kies de zone en activiteit van de werkgever.","Annual estimate":"Jaarlijkse schatting","Gross payroll":"Bruto loonsom","Holiday pay estimate":"Schatting van vakantiegeld","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Andere belastbare lonen en voordelen","Employer pension contribution":"Pensioenbijdrage werkgever","Employer contribution basis":"Basis werkgeversbijdrage","Employer national insurance contribution":"Werkgeversbijdrage volksverzekeringen","Other employer-paid costs":"Overige door de werkgever betaalde kosten","Estimated annual employer cost":"Geschatte jaarlijkse werkgeverskosten","Average monthly cost":"Gemiddelde maandelijkse kosten","Effective contribution rate":"Effectief premiepercentage","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Differentiële toeslag gebruikt in dit scenario","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Resterende vergoeding voor deze schatting","Tax year":"Belastingjaar","Rate source checked":"Tariefbron gecontroleerd","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Controleer of elk bedrag een geldig, niet-negatief getal is en dat elk percentage binnen bereik ligt.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"De 850,000 NOK-drempel geldt per onderneming, niet per werknemer. Vul het bedrag in dat de onderneming dit kalenderjaar al heeft gebruikt.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Noorse zones volgen de geregistreerde locatie van de werkgever. Gebruik de gemeentezoekopdracht van Skatteetaten; de pagina leidt geen zone af uit uw taal.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Vakantiebetalingen en pensioentarieven zijn bewerkbare planningsinvoer. Gebruik het tarief en de pensioengrondslag die voor uw contract en regeling gelden.","No account or server upload is used.":"Er wordt geen account- of serverupload gebruikt.","Compare a second offer":"Vergelijk een tweede aanbieding","Offer B":"Aanbieding B","Offer comparison":"Aanbiedingsvergelijking","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Beide aanbiedingen maken gebruik van de hierboven geselecteerde werkgeverszone en activiteit. Bij elk alternatief wordt de resterende zone Ia-toeslag afzonderlijk toegepast; de twee scenario's zijn alternatieven en mogen niet bij elkaar worden opgeteld.","Offer A":"Aanbieding A","Difference (B − A)":"Verschil (B − A)"},"pl":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Kalkulator kosztów pracodawcy w Norwegii","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Norwegia Kalkulator kosztów pracodawcy 2026 — płace, wynagrodzenie urlopowe i składki pracodawcy","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Oszacuj roczny koszt wynagrodzeń w Norwegii, korzystając ze stawek strefy składek pracodawcy 2026. Dodaj wynagrodzenie urlopowe, emeryturę, wynagrodzenie podlegające opodatkowaniu i inne koszty, mając jasne założenia.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Oszacuj roczny koszt pracodawcy w Norwegii na podstawie wynagrodzeń, wynagrodzenia urlopowego, składek emerytalnych i składki pracodawcy na ubezpieczenie społeczne (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Co wchodzi w skład wyceny?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Wprowadź całkowite roczne wynagrodzenie, wybierz zarejestrowaną strefę składkową pracodawcy i rodzaj działalności, a następnie dodaj wynagrodzenie urlopowe, emeryturę i inne wynagrodzenie. Na przykład 1,000,000 NOK podstawy składki w strefie I daje 141,000 NOK składki pracodawcy w wysokości 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Jak działa oszacowanie","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Kalkulator wykorzystuje opublikowaną stawkę strefową 2026 dla zwykłej działalności lub rolnictwa/rybołówstwa. Do podstawy składki dolicza wpłacone wynagrodzenie urlopowe, podlegające opodatkowaniu rekompensaty i ewentualne składki emerytalne. W przypadku zwykłej działalności w strefie Ia dodatek różnicowy 850,000 NOK na przedsiębiorstwo stosuje się do kwoty wpisanej jako już wykorzystanej w tym roku. Wyniki to roczne szacunki planowania; Obowiązujące zasady określa lokalizacja i działalność pracodawcy.","Frequently asked questions":"Często zadawane pytania","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Czy to oblicza wynagrodzenie na rękę pracownika?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Nie. Szacuje jedynie koszty pracodawcy i składkę pracodawcy. Nie nalicza podatku u źródła ani potrąceń z wynagrodzenia pracownika.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Jaką strefę kontrybucyjną wybrać?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Wybierz strefę, która dotyczy zarejestrowanej lokalizacji pracodawcy, a nie języka czy kraju ojczystego pracownika. Zanim zaczniesz polegać na wynikach, sprawdź gminę w Skatteetaten.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Czy składka emerytalna 2% jest obowiązkowa dla każdego pracodawcy?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Nie. Obowiązki pracownicze związane z emeryturą zależą od tego, czy pracodawca i pracownik spełniają warunki prawne. Podaj stawkę emerytury tylko wtedy, gdy ma ona zastosowanie do Twojej sytuacji; rzeczywista składka programu może się różnić.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Czy wynagrodzenie urlopowe i każdy koszt zatrudnienia są uwzględniane automatycznie?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Nie. Stawka i podstawa wynagrodzenia urlopowego, wynagrodzenie uprawniające do emerytury i inne koszty są założeniami podlegającymi edycji. Ubezpieczenia, administracja płacowa, świadczenia specjalne, zwolnienia i indywidualne limity pracownicze nie są w pełni modelowane.","Scope and data date":"Zakres i data danych","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Stawki składek norweskiego pracodawcy ustalane są na każdy rok i różnią się w zależności od strefy i rodzaju działalności. Kalkulator ten zawiera stawki opublikowane dla roku podatkowego 2026 z datą 16 październik 2026; nie jest to oficjalne zgłoszenie ani decyzja prawna. Sprawdź aktualne stawki, umiejscowienie strefy, kwalifikowalność i dodatek na przedsiębiorstwo w Skatteetaten. Późniejsza kompilacja musi odświeżyć przestarzałe stawki statyczne; ta strona nie aktualizuje się sama w tle.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Działa w tej przeglądarce. Twoje dane dotyczące wynagrodzeń nie zostały przesłane.","Estimate employer cost":"Oszacuj koszty pracodawcy","Related tools":"Powiązane narzędzia","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BEZPŁATNY · DZIAŁA W TWOJEJ PRZEGLĄDARCE","Language":"Język","UsefulVerse":"Przydatny werset","All tools":"Wszystkie narzędzia","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Całkowite roczne wynagrodzenie brutto, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Podstawa wynagrodzenia urlopowego, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Stawka wynagrodzenia urlopowego, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Inne wynagrodzenia i świadczenia podlegające opodatkowaniu, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Płace emerytalne, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Stawka składki emerytalnej pracodawcy, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Inne koszty pokrywane przez pracodawcę, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Strefa składki pracodawcy","Activity type":"Typ działania","Ordinary activity":"Zwykła aktywność","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Rolnictwo i rybołówstwo (specjalne opublikowane stawki)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Strefa I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Strefa Ia — 14.1% zwykła / 10.6% rolnictwo i rybołówstwo","Zone II — 10.6%":"Strefa II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Strefa III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Strefa IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Strefa IVa — 7.9% zwykła / 5.1% rolnictwo i rybołówstwo","Zone V — 0%":"Strefa V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Dodatek różnicowy dla Strefy Ia wykorzystany już w tym roku, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Oblicz oszacowanie","Reset inputs":"Resetuj wejścia","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Wprowadź kwoty roczne oraz wybierz strefę i działalność pracodawcy.","Annual estimate":"Oszacowanie roczne","Gross payroll":"Płace brutto","Holiday pay estimate":"Oszacowanie wynagrodzenia urlopowego","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Inne wynagrodzenia i świadczenia podlegające opodatkowaniu","Employer pension contribution":"Składka emerytalna pracodawcy","Employer contribution basis":"Podstawa składki pracodawcy","Employer national insurance contribution":"Składka pracodawcy na ubezpieczenie społeczne","Other employer-paid costs":"Inne koszty pokrywane przez pracodawcę","Estimated annual employer cost":"Szacowany roczny koszt pracodawcy","Average monthly cost":"Średni koszt miesięczny","Effective contribution rate":"Efektywna stawka składki","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Zasiłek różnicowy stosowany w tym scenariuszu","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Pozostała nadwyżka na to oszacowanie","Tax year":"Rok podatkowy","Rate source checked":"Zaznaczono źródło stawki","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Sprawdź, czy każda kwota jest prawidłową liczbą nieujemną i każdy procent mieści się w dopuszczalnym zakresie.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Próg 850,000 NOK dotyczy przedsiębiorstwa, a nie pracownika. Należy wpisać kwotę wykorzystaną już przez przedsiębiorstwo w tym roku kalendarzowym.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Norweskie strefy podążają za zarejestrowaną lokalizacją pracodawcy. Użyj wyszukiwania gmin w Skatteetaten; strona nie określa strefy na podstawie Twojego języka.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Stawki wynagrodzenia urlopowego i emerytur są edytowalnymi danymi wejściowymi planowania. Skorzystaj ze stawki i podstawy wymiaru emerytury, które mają zastosowanie do Twojej umowy i programu.","No account or server upload is used.":"Nie jest używane żadne konto ani przesyłanie na serwer.","Compare a second offer":"Porównaj drugą ofertę","Offer B":"Oferta B","Offer comparison":"Porównanie ofert","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Obie oferty wykorzystują wybraną powyżej strefę pracodawcy i aktywność. Każda alternatywa stosuje osobno pozostały dodatek dla strefy Ia; oba scenariusze są alternatywne i nie należy ich sumować.","Offer A":"Oferta A","Difference (B − A)":"Różnica (B - A)"},"pt":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Calculadora de custos do empregador na Noruega","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Calculadora de custos do empregador na Noruega 2026 - Folha de pagamento, pagamento de férias e contribuição do empregador","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Estimativa do custo anual da folha de pagamento norueguesa usando as taxas da zona de contribuição do empregador 2026. Adicione férias, pensões, salários tributáveis ​​e outros custos com suposições claras.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Estimar o custo anual do empregador na Noruega a partir da folha de pagamento, subsídio de férias, contribuições para pensões e contribuição para o seguro nacional do empregador (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"O que entra na estimativa?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Insira o total da folha de pagamento anual, escolha a zona de contribuição cadastrada do empregador e o tipo de atividade e, em seguida, adicione férias, pensões e outras remunerações. Por exemplo, 1,000,000 NOK de base de contribuição na zona I dá 141,000 NOK de contribuição do empregador a 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Como funciona a estimativa","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"A calculadora usa a taxa de zona 2026 publicada para atividades comuns ou agricultura/pesca. Adiciona o subsídio de férias, a compensação tributável e qualquer contribuição para pensões à base de contribuição. Para a atividade normal na zona Ia, o abatimento diferencial por empresa 850,000 NOK é aplicado ao valor inscrito como já utilizado neste ano. Os resultados são estimativas de planejamento anual; a localização e a atividade registada do empregador determinam as regras aplicáveis.","Frequently asked questions":"Perguntas frequentes","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Isso calcula o salário líquido de um funcionário?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Não. Estima apenas os custos do empregador e a contribuição do empregador. Não calcula retenção na fonte ou deduções do salário de um funcionário.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Qual zona de contribuição devo escolher?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Escolha a zona que se aplica ao local comercial registrado do empregador, não ao idioma ou país de origem do funcionário. Verifique o município com Skatteetaten antes de confiar no resultado.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"A contribuição previdenciária 2% é obrigatória para todos os empregadores?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Não. Os deveres de pensões profissionais dependem de o empregador e a força de trabalho cumprirem as condições legais. Insira uma taxa de pensão somente quando for aplicável à sua situação; o prêmio real do esquema pode ser diferente.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"O pagamento de férias e todos os custos de contratação são incluídos automaticamente?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Não. Taxa e base de pagamento de férias, folha de pagamento pensionável e outros custos são premissas editáveis. Seguros, administração de folha de pagamento, benefícios especiais, isenções e limites individuais de funcionários não são totalmente modelados.","Scope and data date":"Escopo e data dos dados","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"As taxas de contribuição patronal norueguesas são definidas por ano e variam por zona e atividade. Esta calculadora contém as taxas publicadas para o ano fiscal 2026, datado de 16 outubro 2026; não é um pedido oficial ou decisão legal. Verifique as taxas atuais, a localização da zona, a elegibilidade e o subsídio por empresa com o Skatteetaten. Uma compilação posterior deverá atualizar as taxas estáticas datadas; esta página não é atualizada em segundo plano.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Executa neste navegador. Os valores da sua folha de pagamento não são carregados.","Estimate employer cost":"Estimar custo do empregador","Related tools":"Ferramentas relacionadas","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRÁTIS · FUNCIONA NO SEU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Versoútil","All tools":"Todas as ferramentas","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Folha de pagamento bruta anual total, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Base de pagamento de férias, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Taxa de pagamento de férias, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Outros salários e benefícios tributáveis, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Folha de pagamento pensionável, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Taxa de contribuição previdenciária do empregador, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Outros custos pagos pelo empregador, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Zona de contribuição do empregador","Activity type":"Tipo de atividade","Ordinary activity":"Atividade normal","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Agricultura e pesca (tarifas especiais publicadas)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zona I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zona Ia — 14.1% comum / 10.6% agricultura e pesca","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zona II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zona III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zona IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zona IVa — 7.9% ordinária / 5.1% agricultura e pesca","Zone V — 0%":"Zona V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Subsídio diferencial da Zona Ia já utilizado este ano, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Calcular estimativa","Reset inputs":"Redefinir entradas","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Insira os valores anuais e escolha a zona e atividade do empregador.","Annual estimate":"Estimativa anual","Gross payroll":"Folha de pagamento bruta","Holiday pay estimate":"Estimativa de pagamento de férias","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Outros salários e benefícios tributáveis","Employer pension contribution":"Contribuição previdenciária do empregador","Employer contribution basis":"Base de contribuição do empregador","Employer national insurance contribution":"Contribuição de seguro nacional do empregador","Other employer-paid costs":"Outros custos pagos pelo empregador","Estimated annual employer cost":"Custo anual estimado do empregador","Average monthly cost":"Custo médio mensal","Effective contribution rate":"Taxa de contribuição efetiva","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Contribuição diferencial usada por este cenário","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Provisão restante para esta estimativa","Tax year":"Ano fiscal","Rate source checked":"Fonte da taxa verificada","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Verifique se cada valor é um número válido não negativo e se cada porcentagem está dentro do intervalo.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"O limite de NOK 850,000 é por empresa, não por funcionário. Insira o valor já utilizado pela empresa neste ano civil.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"As zonas norueguesas seguem a localização registrada do empregador. Use a pesquisa de município de Skatteetaten; a página não infere uma zona do seu idioma.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Taxas de pagamento de férias e pensões são entradas de planejamento editáveis. Use a taxa e a base de pensão que se aplicam ao seu contrato e plano.","No account or server upload is used.":"Nenhum upload de conta ou servidor é usado.","Compare a second offer":"Compare uma segunda oferta","Offer B":"Oferta B","Offer comparison":"Comparação de ofertas","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Ambas as ofertas usam a zona empregadora e a atividade selecionada acima. Cada alternativa aplica separadamente o subsídio restante da zona Ia; os dois cenários são alternativos e não devem ser somados.","Offer A":"Oferta A","Difference (B − A)":"Diferença (B − A)"},"ru":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Калькулятор затрат работодателя в Норвегии","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Калькулятор затрат работодателя для Норвегии 2026 — расчет заработной платы, отпускных и взносов работодателя","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Оцените годовую стоимость заработной платы в Норвегии, используя ставки зоны взносов работодателя 2026. Добавьте отпускные, пенсии, налогооблагаемые выплаты и другие расходы с четкими предположениями.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Оцените ежегодные затраты работодателя в Норвегии, исходя из заработной платы, отпускных, пенсионных взносов и взносов национального страхования работодателя (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Что входит в смету?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Введите общий годовой фонд заработной платы, выберите зарегистрированную зону взносов работодателя и тип деятельности, затем добавьте отпускные, пенсию и другие компенсации. Например, 1,000,000 NOK основы взноса в зоне I дает 141,000 NOK взноса работодателя в размере 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Как работает оценка","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Калькулятор использует опубликованный тариф зоны 2026 для обычной деятельности, сельского хозяйства/рыбалки. Он добавляет к базису взносов введенные отпускные, налогооблагаемую компенсацию и любые пенсионные взносы. Для обычной деятельности в зоне Ia дифференцированная надбавка 850,000 NOK для каждого предприятия применяется к сумме, введенной как уже использованная в этом году. Результаты представляют собой годовые плановые оценки; Место регистрации и деятельность работодателя определяют применимые правила.","Frequently asked questions":"Часто задаваемые вопросы","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Рассчитывается ли здесь заработная плата сотрудника?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Нет. Он оценивает только затраты работодателя и вклад работодателя. Он не рассчитывает подоходный налог или вычеты из заработной платы работника.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Какую зону вклада мне выбрать?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Выберите зону, которая относится к зарегистрированному местонахождению предприятия работодателя, а не к языку или родной стране сотрудника. Прежде чем полагаться на результат, проверьте муниципалитет в Skatteetaten.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Обязателен ли пенсионный взнос 2% для каждого работодателя?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Нет. Обязанности по профессиональному пенсионному обеспечению зависят от того, соответствуют ли работодатель и работники правовым условиям. Введите размер пенсии только в том случае, если он применим к вашей ситуации; фактическая страховая премия может отличаться.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Включаются ли автоматически отпускные и все расходы по найму?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Нет. Ставка и основа оплаты отпуска, пенсионный фонд заработной платы и другие расходы являются редактируемыми предположениями. Страхование, управление заработной платой, специальные льготы, льготы и индивидуальные ограничения для сотрудников не полностью смоделированы.","Scope and data date":"Объем и дата данных","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Ставки взносов работодателя в Норвегии устанавливаются по годам и различаются в зависимости от зоны и вида деятельности. Этот калькулятор содержит ставки, опубликованные за налоговый год 2026 от 16 октября 2026; это не официальная заявка или юридическое решение. Проверьте текущие тарифы, размещение зон, право на участие и надбавку для каждого предприятия в Skatteetaten. Более поздняя сборка должна обновить устаревшие статические ставки; эта страница не обновляется в фоновом режиме.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Запускается в этом браузере. Данные о заработной плате не загружены.","Estimate employer cost":"Оценить затраты работодателя","Related tools":"Сопутствующие инструменты","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕСПЛАТНО · ЗАПУСКАЕТСЯ В ВАШЕМ БРАУЗЕРЕ","Language":"Язык","UsefulVerse":"Полезный стих","All tools":"Все инструменты","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Общая годовая заработная плата, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Оплата отпускных, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Ставка отпускных, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Прочие налогооблагаемые выплаты и льготы, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Пенсионный фонд заработной платы, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Ставка пенсионных взносов работодателя, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Прочие расходы, оплачиваемые работодателем, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Зона вклада работодателя","Activity type":"Тип деятельности","Ordinary activity":"Обычная деятельность","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Сельское хозяйство и рыболовство (специальные опубликованные тарифы)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Зона I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Зона Ia — 14.1% обычная / 10.6% сельское хозяйство и рыболовство","Zone II — 10.6%":"Зона II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Зона III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Зона IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Зона IVa — 7.9% обычная / 5.1% сельское хозяйство и рыболовство","Zone V — 0%":"Зона V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Дифференциальный допуск для зоны Ia уже используется в этом году, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Рассчитать смету","Reset inputs":"Сбросить входы","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Введите годовые суммы и выберите зону и вид деятельности работодателя.","Annual estimate":"Годовая оценка","Gross payroll":"Валовая заработная плата","Holiday pay estimate":"Оценка отпускных","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Прочие налогооблагаемые выплаты и льготы","Employer pension contribution":"Пенсионный взнос работодателя","Employer contribution basis":"Основа взносов работодателя","Employer national insurance contribution":"Внос национального страхования работодателя","Other employer-paid costs":"Прочие расходы, оплачиваемые работодателем","Estimated annual employer cost":"Оценочные ежегодные затраты работодателя","Average monthly cost":"Средняя ежемесячная стоимость","Effective contribution rate":"Эффективная ставка взноса","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Дифференциальный допуск, используемый в этом сценарии","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Остаток для этой оценки","Tax year":"Налоговый год","Rate source checked":"Источник цены проверен","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Проверьте, что каждая сумма является допустимым неотрицательным числом и все проценты находятся в пределах допустимого диапазона.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Порог 850,000 NOK указан для каждого предприятия, а не для каждого сотрудника. Введите сумму, уже использованную предприятием в этом календарном году.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Норвежские зоны соответствуют зарегистрированному местоположению работодателя. Воспользуйтесь поиском по муниципалитетам Skatteetaten; страница не определяет зону по вашему языку.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Отпускные и размер пенсии являются редактируемыми входными данными планирования. Используйте ставку и пенсионную базу, применимые к вашему контракту и схеме.","No account or server upload is used.":"Загрузка учетной записи или сервера не используется.","Compare a second offer":"Сравнить второе предложение","Offer B":"Предложение Б","Offer comparison":"Сравнение предложений","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Оба предложения используют выбранную выше зону работодателя и вид деятельности. В каждом альтернативном варианте оставшаяся надбавка для зоны Ia применяется отдельно; эти два сценария являются альтернативными и не должны суммироваться.","Offer A":"Предложение А","Difference (B − A)":"Разница (B − A)"},"sv":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Norge Arbetsgivarkostnadskalkylator","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Norge Arbetsgivarkostnadskalkylator 2026 — Lön, semesterersättning och arbetsgivaravgift","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Uppskatta den årliga norska lönekostnaden med 2026 arbetsgivaravgiftszonen. Lägg till semesterersättning, pension, skattepliktig lön och andra kostnader med tydliga antaganden.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Beräkna årlig arbetsgivarkostnad i Norge från löner, semesterersättningar, pensionsavgifter och arbetsgivarens folkförsäkringsavgift (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Vad ingår i uppskattningen?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Ange total årslönelista, välj arbetsgivarens registrerade avgiftszon och aktivitetstyp, lägg sedan till semesterersättning, pension och annan ersättning. Till exempel, 1,000,000 NOK av avgiftsunderlag i zon I ger 141,000 NOK av arbetsgivaravgift vid 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Hur uppskattningen fungerar","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Kalkylatorn använder den publicerade 2026 zonhastigheten för vanlig verksamhet eller jordbruk/fiske. Den lägger till inlagd semesterersättning, skattepliktig ersättning och eventuell pensionsavgift till avgiftsunderlaget. För ordinarie verksamhet i zon Ia tillämpas skillnadsersättningen 850,000 NOK per företag på det belopp som redan använts i år. Resultaten är årliga planeringsuppskattningar; arbetsgivarens registrerade plats och verksamhet avgör vilka regler som gäller.","Frequently asked questions":"Vanliga frågor","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Beräknar detta en anställds hemlön?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Nr. Den beräknar endast arbetsgivarkostnader och arbetsgivaravgifter. Den beräknar inte källskatt eller avdrag från en anställds lön.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Vilken bidragszon ska jag välja?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Välj den zon som gäller för arbetsgivarens registrerade verksamhetsort, inte arbetstagarens språk eller hemland. Verifiera kommunen med Skatteetaten innan du förlitar dig på resultatet.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Är en 2 % pensionsavgift obligatorisk för varje arbetsgivare?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Nr. Tjänstepensionens skyldigheter beror på om arbetsgivaren och arbetskraften uppfyller de lagstadgade villkoren. Ange en pensionssats endast när den gäller din situation; den faktiska premien kan skilja sig åt.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Inkluderas semesterlön och alla hyrkostnader automatiskt?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Nr. Semesterlönesats och underlag, pensionsgrundande löner och andra kostnader är redigerbara antaganden. Försäkringar, löneadministration, särskilda förmåner, undantag och individuella personalgränser är inte helt modellerade.","Scope and data date":"Omfattning och datadatum","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Norska arbetsgivaravgiftssatser bestäms per år och varierar efter zon och aktivitet. Den här kalkylatorn innehåller priserna publicerade för skatteåret 2026, daterad 16 oktober 2026; det är inte en officiell ansökan eller juridiskt beslut. Verifiera aktuella taxor, zonplacering, behörighet och ersättning per företag med Skatteetaten. En senare version måste uppdatera de daterade statiska hastigheterna; den här sidan uppdateras inte i bakgrunden.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Körs i den här webbläsaren. Dina lönesiffror laddas inte upp.","Estimate employer cost":"Uppskatta arbetsgivarkostnad","Related tools":"Relaterade verktyg","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KÖR I DIN BLÄDDARE","Language":"Språk","UsefulVerse":"Användbar vers","All tools":"Alla verktyg","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Total årlig bruttolön, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Semesterlön, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Semesterlönsats, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Andra skattepliktiga löner och förmåner, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Pensionsgrundande lön, kr","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Arbetsgivarpensionsavgift, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Övriga arbetsgivarbetalda kostnader, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Arbetsgivaravgiftszon","Activity type":"Aktivitetstyp","Ordinary activity":"Vanlig aktivitet","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Jordbruk och fiske (särskilda publicerade priser)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zon I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zon Ia — 14.1 % vanligt / 10.6 % jordbruk och fiske","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zon II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zon III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zon IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zon IVa — 7.9% vanligt / 5.1% jordbruk och fiske","Zone V — 0%":"Zon V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Differentialbidrag för zon Ia används redan i år, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Beräkna uppskattning","Reset inputs":"Återställ ingångar","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Ange de årliga beloppen och välj arbetsgivarens zon och aktivitet.","Annual estimate":"Årlig uppskattning","Gross payroll":"Bruttolön","Holiday pay estimate":"Uppskattning av semesterlön","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Andra skattepliktiga löner och förmåner","Employer pension contribution":"Arbetsgivarpensionsavgift","Employer contribution basis":"Arbetsgivaravgiftsgrund","Employer national insurance contribution":"Arbetsgivaravgift","Other employer-paid costs":"Övriga arbetsgivarbetalda kostnader","Estimated annual employer cost":"Uppskattad årlig arbetsgivarkostnad","Average monthly cost":"Genomsnittlig månadskostnad","Effective contribution rate":"Effektiv avgiftssats","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Differentialtillägg som används av detta scenario","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Återstående ersättning för denna uppskattning","Tax year":"Taxeringsår","Rate source checked":"Betygskälla kontrollerad","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Kontrollera att varje belopp är ett giltigt icke-negativt tal och att varje procent är inom intervallet.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK-gränsen är per företag, inte per anställd. Ange det belopp som redan använts av företaget detta kalenderår.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Norska zoner följer arbetsgivarens registrerade plats. Använd Skatteetatens kommunuppslag; sidan härleder inte en zon från ditt språk.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Semesterlön och pensionssatser är redigerbara planeringsindata. Använd den taxa och den pensionsgrundande basen som gäller för ditt avtal och system.","No account or server upload is used.":"Inget konto eller serveruppladdning används.","Compare a second offer":"Jämför ett andra erbjudande","Offer B":"Erbjudande B","Offer comparison":"Jämförelse av erbjudanden","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Båda erbjudandena använder arbetsgivarzonen och aktiviteten som valts ovan. Varje alternativ tillämpar den återstående zon Ia ersättningen separat; de två scenarierna är alternativ och får inte läggas ihop.","Offer A":"Erbjudande A","Difference (B − A)":"Skillnad (B − A)"},"sw":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Norwe Kikokotoo cha Gharama ya Mwajiri","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Norwe Kikokotoo cha Gharama za Mwajiri 2026 — Malipo, Malipo ya Likizo na Mchango wa Mwajiri","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Kadiria gharama ya malipo ya kila mwaka ya Norway kwa kutumia 2026 viwango vya eneo la mchango wa mwajiri. Ongeza malipo ya likizo, pensheni, malipo yanayotozwa ushuru na gharama zingine kwa mawazo wazi.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Kadiria gharama ya kila mwaka ya mwajiri nchini Norwe kutokana na malipo, malipo ya likizo, michango ya pensheni na mchango wa bima ya kitaifa ya mwajiri (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Ni nini kinachoingia kwenye makadirio?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Weka jumla ya malipo ya kila mwaka, chagua eneo la mchango lililosajiliwa la mwajiri na aina ya shughuli, kisha uongeze malipo ya likizo, pensheni na fidia nyinginezo. Kwa mfano, 1,000,000 NOK ya msingi wa mchango katika eneo la I inatoa 141,000 NOK ya mchango wa mwajiri kwa 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Jinsi makadirio yanavyofanya kazi","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Kikokotoo hutumia kiwango cha eneo cha 2026 kilichochapishwa kwa shughuli za kawaida au kilimo/uvuvi. Inaongeza malipo ya likizo, fidia inayotozwa ushuru na mchango wowote wa pensheni kwa msingi wa mchango. Kwa shughuli za kawaida katika eneo Ia, posho ya tofauti ya 850,000 NOK kwa kila biashara inatumika kwa kiasi kilichowekwa kama ambacho tayari kimetumika mwaka huu. Matokeo ni makadirio ya mipango ya kila mwaka; eneo lililosajiliwa la mwajiri na shughuli huamua sheria zinazotumika.","Frequently asked questions":"Maswali yanayoulizwa mara kwa mara","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Je, hii inakokotoa malipo ya kwenda nyumbani ya mfanyakazi?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Na. Inakadiria gharama za mwajiri na mchango wa mwajiri pekee. Haihesabu kodi ya zuio au makato kutoka kwa malipo ya mfanyakazi.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Je, nichague eneo gani la michango?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Chagua eneo ambalo linatumika kwa eneo la biashara lililosajiliwa la mwajiri, si lugha ya mfanyakazi au nchi yake. Thibitisha manispaa na Skatteetaten kabla ya kutegemea matokeo.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Je, mchango wa pensheni wa 2% ni lazima kwa kila mwajiri?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Na. Ushuru wa pensheni ya kazini hutegemea ikiwa mwajiri na wafanyikazi wanakidhi masharti ya kisheria. Ingiza kiwango cha pensheni tu wakati inatumika kwa hali yako; malipo halisi ya mpango yanaweza kutofautiana.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Je, malipo ya likizo na kila gharama ya kukodisha imejumuishwa kiotomatiki?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Na. Kiwango cha malipo ya likizo na msingi, malipo ya pensheni na gharama zingine ni mawazo yanayoweza kuhaririwa. Bima, usimamizi wa mishahara, marupurupu maalum, misamaha na vikomo vya mfanyakazi binafsi havijaigwa kikamilifu.","Scope and data date":"Upeo na tarehe ya data","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Viwango vya michango ya mwajiri wa Norwe huwekwa kulingana na mwaka na hutofautiana kulingana na eneo na shughuli. Kikokotoo hiki kina viwango vilivyochapishwa kwa mwaka wa ushuru 2026, wa tarehe 16 Oktoba 2026; sio uwasilishaji rasmi au uamuzi wa kisheria. Thibitisha viwango vya sasa, uwekaji wa eneo, ustahiki na posho ya kila biashara na Skatteetaten. Muundo wa baadaye lazima uonyesha upya viwango vya tuli vilivyowekwa; ukurasa huu haujisasishi chinichini.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Inaendeshwa katika kivinjari hiki. Takwimu zako za malipo hazijapakiwa.","Estimate employer cost":"Kadiria gharama ya mwajiri","Related tools":"Vyombo vinavyohusiana","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BILA MALIPO · INAENDELEA KATIKA KIvinjari CHAKO","Language":"Lugha","UsefulVerse":"MuhimuVerse","All tools":"Vyombo vyote","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Jumla ya mishahara ya kila mwaka, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Msingi wa malipo ya likizo, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Kiwango cha malipo ya likizo, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Malipo na manufaa mengine yanayotozwa ushuru, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Malipo ya pensheni, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Kiwango cha mchango wa pensheni ya mwajiri, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Gharama zingine zinazolipwa na mwajiri, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Eneo la mchango wa mwajiri","Activity type":"Aina ya shughuli","Ordinary activity":"Shughuli ya kawaida","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Kilimo na uvuvi (viwango maalum vilivyochapishwa)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zone I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zone Ia — 14.1% ya kawaida / 10.6% kilimo na uvuvi","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zone II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zone III - 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zone IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zone IVa — 7.9% ya kawaida / 5.1% kilimo na uvuvi","Zone V — 0%":"Zone V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Posho tofauti ya Zone Ia tayari imetumika mwaka huu, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Kokotoa makadirio","Reset inputs":"Weka upya pembejeo","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Weka kiasi cha mwaka na uchague eneo na shughuli ya mwajiri.","Annual estimate":"Makadirio ya kila mwaka","Gross payroll":"Malipo ya jumla","Holiday pay estimate":"Kadirio la malipo ya likizo","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Malipo na manufaa mengine yanayotozwa ushuru","Employer pension contribution":"Mchango wa pensheni ya mwajiri","Employer contribution basis":"Msingi wa mchango wa mwajiri","Employer national insurance contribution":"Mchango wa bima ya kitaifa ya mwajiri","Other employer-paid costs":"Gharama zingine zinazolipwa na mwajiri","Estimated annual employer cost":"Kadirio la gharama ya kila mwaka ya mwajiri","Average monthly cost":"Wastani wa gharama ya kila mwezi","Effective contribution rate":"Kiwango cha mchango kinachofaa","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Posho tofauti inayotumiwa na hali hii","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Posho iliyosalia kwa makadirio haya","Tax year":"Mwaka wa Kodi","Rate source checked":"Chanzo cha viwango kimeangaliwa","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Hakikisha kuwa kila kiasi ni nambari halali isiyo hasi na kila asilimia iko ndani ya masafa.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Kiwango cha juu cha 850,000 NOK ni kwa kila biashara, si kwa kila mfanyakazi. Weka kiasi ambacho tayari kimetumiwa na biashara mwaka huu wa kalenda.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Maeneo ya Norway yanafuata eneo lililosajiliwa la mwajiri. Tumia utafutaji wa manispaa ya Skateetaten; ukurasa hauonyeshi eneo kutoka kwa lugha yako.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Malipo ya likizo na viwango vya pensheni ni pembejeo za kupanga zinazoweza kuhaririwa. Tumia kiwango na msingi wa pensheni unaotumika kwa mkataba na mpango wako.","No account or server upload is used.":"Hakuna akaunti au upakiaji wa seva unatumika.","Compare a second offer":"Linganisha toleo la pili","Offer B":"Ofa ya B","Offer comparison":"Toa kulinganisha","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Ofa zote mbili hutumia eneo la mwajiri na shughuli iliyochaguliwa hapo juu. Kila mbadala inatumika posho iliyobaki ya eneo Ia kando; matukio hayo mawili ni mbadala na hayapaswi kuongezwa pamoja.","Offer A":"Ofa ya A","Difference (B − A)":"Tofauti (B - A)"},"ta":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"நார்வே முதலாளியின் செலவுக் கணிப்பான்","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"நார்வே முதலாளியின் செலவுக் கால்குலேட்டர் 2026 — சம்பளப்பட்டியல், விடுமுறை ஊதியம் மற்றும் முதலாளி பங்களிப்பு","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 முதலாளி பங்களிப்பு மண்டல விகிதங்களைப் பயன்படுத்தி வருடாந்திர நார்வேஜியன் ஊதியச் செலவைக் கணக்கிடுங்கள். தெளிவான அனுமானங்களுடன் விடுமுறை ஊதியம், ஓய்வூதியம், வரிவிதிப்பு ஊதியம் மற்றும் பிற செலவுகளைச் சேர்க்கவும்.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"ஊதியம், விடுமுறை ஊதியம், ஓய்வூதிய பங்களிப்புகள் மற்றும் முதலாளியின் தேசிய காப்பீட்டு பங்களிப்பு (arbeidsgiveravgift) ஆகியவற்றிலிருந்து நோர்வேயில் வருடாந்திர முதலாளியின் செலவை மதிப்பிடுங்கள்.","What goes into the estimate?":"மதிப்பீட்டில் என்ன செல்கிறது?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"மொத்த வருடாந்திர ஊதியத்தை உள்ளிடவும், முதலாளியின் பதிவு செய்யப்பட்ட பங்களிப்பு மண்டலம் மற்றும் செயல்பாட்டு வகையைத் தேர்வுசெய்து, விடுமுறை ஊதியம், ஓய்வூதியம் மற்றும் பிற இழப்பீடுகளைச் சேர்க்கவும். உதாரணமாக,1,000,000நான் கொடுக்கும் மண்டலத்தில் பங்களிப்பு அடிப்படையில் NOK141,000இல் முதலாளி பங்களிப்பின் NOK14.1%","How the estimate works":"மதிப்பீடு எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"கால்குலேட்டர் வெளியிடப்பட்ட 2026 மண்டல விகிதத்தை சாதாரண செயல்பாடு அல்லது விவசாயம்/மீன்பிடிப்புக்கு பயன்படுத்துகிறது. இது உள்ளிட்ட விடுமுறை ஊதியம், வரிவிதிப்பு இழப்பீடு மற்றும் பங்களிப்பு அடிப்படையில் எந்த ஓய்வூதிய பங்களிப்பையும் சேர்க்கிறது. 850,000 NOK மண்டலம் Ia இல் உள்ள சாதாரண செயல்பாட்டிற்கு, இந்த ஆண்டு ஏற்கனவே பயன்படுத்தப்பட்ட தொகைக்கு, ஒவ்வொரு நிறுவன வேறுபாட்டுக் கொடுப்பனவும் பயன்படுத்தப்படும். முடிவுகள் வருடாந்திர திட்டமிடல் மதிப்பீடுகள்; முதலாளியின் பதிவு செய்யப்பட்ட இடம் மற்றும் செயல்பாடு பொருந்தக்கூடிய விதிகளை தீர்மானிக்கிறது.","Frequently asked questions":"அடிக்கடி கேட்கப்படும் கேள்விகள்","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"இது ஒரு பணியாளரின் வீட்டிற்கு எடுத்துச் செல்லும் ஊதியத்தை கணக்கிடுமா?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"எண். இது முதலாளியின் செலவுகள் மற்றும் முதலாளியின் பங்களிப்பை மட்டுமே மதிப்பிடுகிறது. இது ஒரு பணியாளரின் ஊதியத்திலிருந்து பிடித்தம் செய்யும் வரி அல்லது விலக்குகளை கணக்கிடாது.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"நான் எந்த பங்களிப்பு மண்டலத்தை தேர்வு செய்ய வேண்டும்?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"முதலாளியின் பதிவுசெய்யப்பட்ட வணிக இருப்பிடத்திற்குப் பொருந்தும் மண்டலத்தைத் தேர்வுசெய்யவும், பணியாளரின் மொழி அல்லது சொந்த நாடு அல்ல. முடிவை நம்புவதற்கு முன், நகராட்சியை ஸ்கட்டீடடன் மூலம் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"ஒவ்வொரு முதலாளிக்கும் 2% ஓய்வூதிய பங்களிப்பு கட்டாயமா?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"எண். தொழில்சார் ஓய்வூதிய கடமைகள் முதலாளி மற்றும் பணியாளர்கள் சட்ட நிபந்தனைகளை சந்திக்கிறார்களா என்பதைப் பொறுத்தது. உங்கள் சூழ்நிலைக்கு பொருந்தும் போது மட்டுமே ஓய்வூதிய விகிதத்தை உள்ளிடவும்; உண்மையான திட்ட பிரீமியம் வேறுபடலாம்.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"விடுமுறை ஊதியம் மற்றும் ஒவ்வொரு பணியமர்த்தல் செலவும் தானாக சேர்க்கப்பட்டுள்ளதா?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"எண். விடுமுறை ஊதிய விகிதம் மற்றும் அடிப்படை, ஓய்வூதியம் பெறக்கூடிய ஊதியம் மற்றும் பிற செலவுகள் திருத்தக்கூடிய அனுமானங்கள். காப்பீடு, ஊதிய நிர்வாகம், சிறப்புப் பலன்கள், விலக்குகள் மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட பணியாளர் வரம்புகள் ஆகியவை முழுமையாக வடிவமைக்கப்படவில்லை.","Scope and data date":"நோக்கம் மற்றும் தரவு தேதி","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"நோர்வே முதலாளியின் பங்களிப்பு விகிதங்கள் ஆண்டு வாரியாக அமைக்கப்பட்டு மண்டலம் மற்றும் செயல்பாட்டின் அடிப்படையில் மாறுபடும். இந்தக் கால்குலேட்டரில் வரி ஆண்டு 2026, தேதியிட்ட 16 அக்டோபர் 2026 க்கான வெளியிடப்பட்ட விகிதங்கள் உள்ளன; இது உத்தியோகபூர்வ தாக்கல் அல்லது சட்ட முடிவு அல்ல. தற்போதைய விகிதங்கள், மண்டல வேலை வாய்ப்பு, தகுதி மற்றும் ஒரு நிறுவனத்திற்கான கொடுப்பனவை Skatteetaten உடன் சரிபார்க்கவும். ஒரு பிந்தைய உருவாக்கம் தேதியிட்ட நிலையான விகிதங்களைப் புதுப்பிக்க வேண்டும்; இந்தப் பக்கம் பின்னணியில் தன்னைப் புதுப்பிக்கவில்லை.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"இந்த உலாவியில் இயங்குகிறது. உங்கள் சம்பளப் பட்டியல் பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை.","Estimate employer cost":"முதலாளியின் செலவை மதிப்பிடவும்","Related tools":"தொடர்புடைய கருவிகள்","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"இலவசம் · உங்கள் உலாவியில் இயங்குகிறது","Language":"மொழி","UsefulVerse":"பயனுள்ள வசனம்","All tools":"அனைத்து கருவிகளும்","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"மொத்த வருடாந்திர மொத்த ஊதியம், NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"விடுமுறை-ஊதிய அடிப்படையில், NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"விடுமுறை ஊதிய விகிதம், %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"இதர வரிவிதிப்பு ஊதியம் மற்றும் பலன்கள், NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"ஓய்வூதியம் பெறக்கூடிய ஊதியம், NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"முதலாளி ஓய்வூதிய பங்களிப்பு விகிதம், %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"வேலை வழங்குபவர் செலுத்திய பிற செலவுகள், NOK","Employer contribution zone":"முதலாளி பங்களிப்பு மண்டலம்","Activity type":"செயல்பாட்டு வகை","Ordinary activity":"சாதாரண செயல்பாடு","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"விவசாயம் மற்றும் மீன்பிடித்தல் (சிறப்பு வெளியிடப்பட்ட விலைகள்)","Zone I — 14.1%":"மண்டலம் I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"மண்டலம் Ia — 14.1% சாதாரண / 10.6% விவசாயம் மற்றும் மீன்பிடித்தல்","Zone II — 10.6%":"மண்டலம் II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"மண்டலம் III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"மண்டலம் IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"மண்டலம் IVa — 7.9% சாதாரண / 5.1% விவசாயம் மற்றும் மீன்பிடித்தல்","Zone V — 0%":"மண்டலம் V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"மண்டலம் Ia வேறுபாடு கொடுப்பனவு இந்த ஆண்டு ஏற்கனவே பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது, NOK","Calculate estimate":"மதிப்பீட்டைக் கணக்கிடுங்கள்","Reset inputs":"உள்ளீடுகளை மீட்டமைக்கவும்","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"ஆண்டுத் தொகையை உள்ளிட்டு, பணியமர்த்துபவரின் மண்டலத்தையும் செயல்பாட்டையும் தேர்வு செய்யவும்.","Annual estimate":"ஆண்டு மதிப்பீடு","Gross payroll":"மொத்த ஊதியம்","Holiday pay estimate":"விடுமுறை ஊதிய மதிப்பீடு","Other taxable pay and benefits":"இதர வரிவிதிப்பு ஊதியம் மற்றும் பலன்கள்","Employer pension contribution":"முதலாளி ஓய்வூதிய பங்களிப்பு","Employer contribution basis":"முதலாளி பங்களிப்பு அடிப்படை","Employer national insurance contribution":"முதலாளியின் தேசிய காப்பீட்டு பங்களிப்பு","Other employer-paid costs":"வேலை வழங்குபவர் செலுத்தும் பிற செலவுகள்","Estimated annual employer cost":"கணிக்கப்பட்ட ஆண்டு முதலாளி செலவு","Average monthly cost":"சராசரி மாதாந்திர செலவு","Effective contribution rate":"பயனுள்ள பங்களிப்பு விகிதம்","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"இந்த சூழ்நிலையில் பயன்படுத்தப்படும் வேறுபட்ட கொடுப்பனவு","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"இந்த மதிப்பீட்டிற்கு மீதமுள்ள கொடுப்பனவு","Tax year":"வரி ஆண்டு","Rate source checked":"விகித ஆதாரம் சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"ஒவ்வொரு தொகையும் செல்லுபடியாகும் எதிர்மறை அல்லாத எண் மற்றும் ஒவ்வொரு சதவீதமும் வரம்பிற்குள் உள்ளதா என சரிபார்க்கவும்.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK வரம்பு ஒரு நிறுவனத்திற்கானது, ஒரு பணியாளருக்கு அல்ல. இந்த காலண்டர் ஆண்டில் நிறுவனம் ஏற்கனவே பயன்படுத்திய தொகையை உள்ளிடவும்.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"நோர்வே மண்டலங்கள் முதலாளியின் பதிவு செய்யப்பட்ட இடத்தைப் பின்பற்றுகின்றன. Skatteeten's நகராட்சி தேடலைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்; பக்கம் உங்கள் மொழியிலிருந்து ஒரு மண்டலத்தை ஊகிக்கவில்லை.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"விடுமுறை ஊதியம் மற்றும் ஓய்வூதிய விகிதங்கள் திருத்தக்கூடிய திட்டமிடல் உள்ளீடுகள். உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தம் மற்றும் திட்டத்திற்கு பொருந்தும் விகிதம் மற்றும் ஓய்வூதிய அடிப்படையைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","No account or server upload is used.":"கணக்கு அல்லது சர்வர் பதிவேற்றம் பயன்படுத்தப்படவில்லை.","Compare a second offer":"இரண்டாவது சலுகையை ஒப்பிடுக","Offer B":"ஆஃபர் பி","Offer comparison":"சலுகை ஒப்பீடு","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"இரண்டு சலுகைகளும் மேலே தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட முதலாளி மண்டலம் மற்றும் செயல்பாட்டைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றன. ஒவ்வொரு மாற்றீடும் மீதமுள்ள மண்டல Ia கொடுப்பனவை தனித்தனியாகப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது; இரண்டு காட்சிகளும் மாற்று மற்றும் ஒன்றாக சேர்க்கப்படக்கூடாது.","Offer A":"ஆஃபர் ஏ","Difference (B − A)":"வேறுபாடு (B - A)"},"te":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"నార్వే ఎంప్లాయర్ కాస్ట్ కాలిక్యులేటర్","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"నార్వే ఎంప్లాయర్ కాస్ట్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ 2026 — పేరోల్, హాలిడే పే మరియు ఎంప్లాయర్ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 యజమాని సహకారం జోన్ రేట్లను ఉపయోగించి వార్షిక నార్వేజియన్ పేరోల్ ధరను అంచనా వేయండి. స్పష్టమైన అంచనాలతో సెలవు చెల్లింపు, పెన్షన్, పన్ను చెల్లించదగిన చెల్లింపు మరియు ఇతర ఖర్చులను జోడించండి.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"పేరోల్, హాలిడే పే, పెన్షన్ కాంట్రిబ్యూషన్‌లు మరియు యజమాని జాతీయ బీమా సహకారం (arbeidsgiveravgift) నుండి నార్వేలో వార్షిక యజమాని ఖర్చును అంచనా వేయండి.","What goes into the estimate?":"అంచనాలో ఏమి ఉంటుంది?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"మొత్తం వార్షిక పేరోల్‌ను నమోదు చేయండి, యజమాని యొక్క రిజిస్టర్డ్ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్ జోన్ మరియు యాక్టివిటీ రకాన్ని ఎంచుకోండి, ఆపై సెలవు చెల్లింపు, పెన్షన్ మరియు ఇతర పరిహారాన్ని జోడించండి. ఉదాహరణకు, జోన్ Iలో సహకారం ఆధారంగా 1,000,000 NOK 14.1% వద్ద యజమాని సహకారం యొక్క 141,000 NOK ఇస్తుంది.","How the estimate works":"అంచనా ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"కాలిక్యులేటర్ సాధారణ కార్యకలాపం లేదా వ్యవసాయం/ఫిషింగ్ కోసం ప్రచురించబడిన 2026 జోన్ రేటును ఉపయోగిస్తుంది. ఇది ఎంటర్ చేసిన సెలవు చెల్లింపు, పన్ను చెల్లించదగిన పరిహారం మరియు ఏదైనా పెన్షన్ సహకారాన్ని కాంట్రిబ్యూషన్ ప్రాతిపదికన జోడిస్తుంది. జోన్ Iaలో సాధారణ కార్యకలాపం కోసం, 850,000 NOK పర్-ఎంటర్‌ప్రైజ్ అవకలన భత్యం ఈ సంవత్సరం ఇప్పటికే ఉపయోగించినట్లు నమోదు చేయబడిన మొత్తానికి వర్తించబడుతుంది. ఫలితాలు వార్షిక ప్రణాళిక అంచనాలు; యజమాని యొక్క నమోదిత స్థానం మరియు కార్యాచరణ వర్తించే నియమాలను నిర్ణయిస్తాయి.","Frequently asked questions":"తరచుగా అడిగే ప్రశ్నలు","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"ఇది ఉద్యోగి టేక్-హోమ్ పేని లెక్కిస్తుందా?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"నం. ఇది యజమాని ఖర్చులు మరియు యజమాని సహకారం మాత్రమే అంచనా వేస్తుంది. ఇది ఉద్యోగి వేతనం నుండి విత్‌హోల్డింగ్ పన్ను లేదా తగ్గింపులను లెక్కించదు.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"నేను ఏ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్ జోన్‌ను ఎంచుకోవాలి?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"ఉద్యోగి భాష లేదా స్వదేశానికి కాకుండా, యజమాని యొక్క నమోదిత వ్యాపార స్థానానికి వర్తించే జోన్‌ను ఎంచుకోండి. ఫలితంపై ఆధారపడే ముందు మున్సిపాలిటీని స్కటీటాటెన్‌తో ధృవీకరించండి.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"ప్రతి యజమానికి 2% పెన్షన్ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్ తప్పనిసరి కాదా?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"నం. వృత్తిపరమైన పెన్షన్ విధులు యజమాని మరియు శ్రామిక శక్తి చట్టపరమైన పరిస్థితులకు అనుగుణంగా ఉన్నాయా లేదా అనే దానిపై ఆధారపడి ఉంటుంది. మీ పరిస్థితికి వర్తించినప్పుడు మాత్రమే పెన్షన్ రేటును నమోదు చేయండి; అసలు పథకం ప్రీమియం మారవచ్చు.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"సెలవు చెల్లింపు మరియు ప్రతి నియామక ఖర్చు స్వయంచాలకంగా చేర్చబడుతుందా?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"నం. సెలవు చెల్లింపు రేటు మరియు ఆధారం, పెన్షన్ పొందదగిన పేరోల్ మరియు ఇతర ఖర్చులు సవరించదగిన అంచనాలు. బీమా, పేరోల్ అడ్మినిస్ట్రేషన్, ప్రత్యేక ప్రయోజనాలు, మినహాయింపులు మరియు వ్యక్తిగత ఉద్యోగుల పరిమితులు పూర్తిగా రూపొందించబడలేదు.","Scope and data date":"స్కోప్ మరియు డేటా తేదీ","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"నార్వేజియన్ ఎంప్లాయర్ కాంట్రిబ్యూషన్ రేట్లు సంవత్సరం వారీగా సెట్ చేయబడతాయి మరియు జోన్ మరియు యాక్టివిటీ ప్రకారం మారుతూ ఉంటాయి. ఈ కాలిక్యులేటర్ 2026, 16 అక్టోబర్ 2026 నాటి పన్ను సంవత్సరానికి ప్రచురించబడిన రేట్లను కలిగి ఉంది; ఇది అధికారిక దాఖలు లేదా చట్టపరమైన నిర్ణయం కాదు. స్కట్టీటాటెన్‌తో ప్రస్తుత రేట్లు, జోన్ ప్లేస్‌మెంట్, అర్హత మరియు ప్రతి సంస్థ భత్యాన్ని ధృవీకరించండి. తరువాతి బిల్డ్ తప్పనిసరిగా పాత స్టాటిక్ రేట్లను రిఫ్రెష్ చేయాలి; ఈ పేజీ నేపథ్యంలో స్వయంగా నవీకరించబడదు.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో రన్ అవుతుంది. మీ పేరోల్ గణాంకాలు అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు.","Estimate employer cost":"యజమాని ధరను అంచనా వేయండి","Related tools":"సంబంధిత సాధనాలు","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ఉచితం · మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో నడుస్తుంది","Language":"భాష","UsefulVerse":"ఉపయోగకరమైన పద్యం","All tools":"అన్ని సాధనాలు","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"మొత్తం వార్షిక స్థూల పేరోల్, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"హాలిడే-పే ప్రాతిపదిక, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"హాలిడే-పే రేటు, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"ఇతర పన్ను విధించదగిన చెల్లింపు మరియు ప్రయోజనాలు, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"పెన్షనబుల్ పేరోల్, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"యజమాని పెన్షన్ సహకారం రేటు, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"ఇతర యజమాని-చెల్లింపు ఖర్చులు, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"ఎంప్లాయర్ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్ జోన్","Activity type":"కార్యాచరణ రకం","Ordinary activity":"సాధారణ కార్యాచరణ","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"వ్యవసాయం మరియు చేపలు పట్టడం (ప్రత్యేకంగా ప్రచురించబడిన రేట్లు)","Zone I — 14.1%":"జోన్ I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"జోన్ Ia — 14.1% సాధారణ / 10.6% వ్యవసాయం మరియు చేపలు పట్టడం","Zone II — 10.6%":"జోన్ II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"జోన్ III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"జోన్ IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"జోన్ IVa — 7.9% సాధారణ / 5.1% వ్యవసాయం మరియు చేపలు పట్టడం","Zone V — 0%":"జోన్ V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"జోన్ Ia అవకలన భత్యం ఈ సంవత్సరం ఇప్పటికే ఉపయోగించబడింది, NOK","Calculate estimate":"అంచనా వేయండి","Reset inputs":"ఇన్‌పుట్‌లను రీసెట్ చేయండి","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"వార్షిక మొత్తాలను నమోదు చేయండి మరియు యజమాని యొక్క జోన్ మరియు కార్యాచరణను ఎంచుకోండి.","Annual estimate":"వార్షిక అంచనా","Gross payroll":"స్థూల పేరోల్","Holiday pay estimate":"హాలిడే చెల్లింపు అంచనా","Other taxable pay and benefits":"పన్ను విధించదగిన ఇతర చెల్లింపు మరియు ప్రయోజనాలు","Employer pension contribution":"యజమాని పెన్షన్ సహకారం","Employer contribution basis":"యజమాని సహకారం ఆధారంగా","Employer national insurance contribution":"యజమాని జాతీయ బీమా సహకారం","Other employer-paid costs":"ఇతర యజమాని-చెల్లించిన ఖర్చులు","Estimated annual employer cost":"అంచనా వేయబడిన వార్షిక యజమాని ఖర్చు","Average monthly cost":"సగటు నెలవారీ ఖర్చు","Effective contribution rate":"ప్రభావవంతమైన సహకారం రేటు","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"ఈ దృశ్యం ద్వారా ఉపయోగించబడిన అవకలన భత్యం","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"ఈ అంచనాకు మిగిలిన భత్యం","Tax year":"పన్ను సంవత్సరం","Rate source checked":"రేటు మూలం తనిఖీ చేయబడింది","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"ప్రతి మొత్తం చెల్లుబాటయ్యే నాన్-నెగటివ్ నంబర్ అని మరియు ప్రతి శాతం పరిధిలో ఉందో లేదో తనిఖీ చేయండి.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK థ్రెషోల్డ్ ఒక్కో సంస్థకు, ఉద్యోగికి కాదు. ఈ క్యాలెండర్ సంవత్సరంలో ఎంటర్‌ప్రైజ్ ఇప్పటికే ఉపయోగించిన మొత్తాన్ని నమోదు చేయండి.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"నార్వేజియన్ జోన్‌లు యజమాని నమోదు చేసిన స్థానాన్ని అనుసరిస్తాయి. స్కట్టీటాటెన్ యొక్క మునిసిపాలిటీ శోధనను ఉపయోగించండి; పేజీ మీ భాష నుండి జోన్‌ను ఊహించలేదు.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"హాలిడే పే మరియు పెన్షన్ రేట్లు సవరించదగిన ప్రణాళిక ఇన్‌పుట్‌లు. మీ ఒప్పందం మరియు స్కీమ్‌కు వర్తించే రేటు మరియు పెన్షన్ బేస్‌ని ఉపయోగించండి.","No account or server upload is used.":"ఖాతా లేదా సర్వర్ అప్‌లోడ్ ఉపయోగించబడలేదు.","Compare a second offer":"రెండవ ఆఫర్‌ను సరిపోల్చండి","Offer B":"ఆఫర్ B","Offer comparison":"ఆఫర్ పోలిక","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"రెండు ఆఫర్‌లు పైన ఎంచుకున్న ఎంప్లాయర్ జోన్ మరియు యాక్టివిటీని ఉపయోగిస్తాయి. ప్రతి ప్రత్యామ్నాయం మిగిలిన జోన్ Ia భత్యాన్ని విడిగా వర్తిస్తుంది; రెండు దృశ్యాలు ప్రత్యామ్నాయాలు మరియు వాటిని జోడించకూడదు.","Offer A":"ఆఫర్ ఎ","Difference (B − A)":"తేడా (B - A)"},"th":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณต้นทุนนายจ้างของนอร์เวย์","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"เครื่องคำนวณต้นทุนนายจ้างของนอร์เวย์ 2026 - บัญชีเงินเดือน ค่าทำงานในวันหยุด และเงินสมทบของนายจ้าง","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"ประมาณการต้นทุนเงินเดือนประจำปีของนอร์เวย์โดยใช้อัตราเขตเงินสมทบของนายจ้าง 2026 เพิ่มค่าจ้างวันหยุด เงินบำนาญ เงินภาษีที่ต้องเสีย และค่าใช้จ่ายอื่นๆ โดยมีสมมติฐานที่ชัดเจน","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"ประมาณการค่าใช้จ่ายรายปีของนายจ้างในนอร์เวย์จากเงินเดือน ค่าทำงานในวันหยุด เงินสมทบบำนาญ และเงินสมทบประกันสังคมของนายจ้าง (arbeidsgiveravgift)","What goes into the estimate?":"ค่าประมาณนี้ต้องใช้อะไรบ้าง","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"กรอกเงินเดือนประจำปีทั้งหมด เลือกโซนการสมทบทุนและประเภทกิจกรรมที่นายจ้างลงทะเบียนไว้ จากนั้นบวกค่าทำงานในวันหยุด เงินบำนาญ และค่าตอบแทนอื่นๆ ตัวอย่างเช่น 1,000,000 NOK ของเกณฑ์การบริจาคในโซน I จะให้ 141,000 NOK ของเงินสมทบนายจ้างที่ 14.1%","How the estimate works":"วิธีการทำงานของการประมาณการ","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"เครื่องคิดเลขใช้อัตราโซน 2026 ที่เผยแพร่สำหรับกิจกรรมทั่วไปหรือการเกษตร/ตกปลา โดยจะเพิ่มค่าจ้างวันหยุดที่ป้อน ค่าตอบแทนที่ต้องเสียภาษี และเงินสมทบบำนาญใดๆ เข้ากับเกณฑ์การบริจาค สำหรับกิจกรรมปกติในโซน Ia ค่าเผื่อส่วนต่าง 850,000 NOK ต่อองค์กรจะถูกนำไปใช้กับจำนวนเงินที่ป้อนตามที่ใช้ไปแล้วในปีนี้ ผลลัพธ์เป็นการประมาณการการวางแผนประจำปี สถานที่และกิจกรรมที่จดทะเบียนของนายจ้างจะกำหนดกฎเกณฑ์ที่เกี่ยวข้อง","Frequently asked questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"สิ่งนี้คำนวณเงินกลับบ้านของพนักงานหรือไม่","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"No. โดยจะประมาณการค่าใช้จ่ายของนายจ้างและเงินสมทบของนายจ้างเท่านั้น ไม่คำนวณภาษีหัก ณ ที่จ่ายหรือการหักเงินจากค่าจ้างพนักงาน","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"ฉันควรเลือกโซนการสนับสนุนใด","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"เลือกโซนที่ใช้กับที่ตั้งธุรกิจที่จดทะเบียนของนายจ้าง ไม่ใช่ภาษาของพนักงานหรือประเทศบ้านเกิด ตรวจสอบเทศบาลกับ Skatteetaten ก่อนอาศัยผล","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"นายจ้างทุกคนต้องจ่ายเงินสมทบบำนาญ 2% หรือไม่","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"No. หน้าที่บำเหน็จบำนาญขึ้นอยู่กับว่านายจ้างและแรงงานมีคุณสมบัติตรงตามเงื่อนไขทางกฎหมายหรือไม่ ป้อนอัตราเงินบำนาญเฉพาะเมื่อใช้กับสถานการณ์ของคุณเท่านั้น เบี้ยประกันภัยตามจริงอาจแตกต่างกันไป","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"รวมค่าวันหยุดและค่าจ้างทั้งหมดโดยอัตโนมัติหรือไม่","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"No. อัตราและพื้นฐานการจ่ายเงินในวันหยุด เงินเดือนบำนาญ และค่าใช้จ่ายอื่นๆ เป็นสมมติฐานที่แก้ไขได้ การประกันภัย การบริหารบัญชีเงินเดือน สิทธิประโยชน์พิเศษ การยกเว้น และขีดจำกัดของพนักงานแต่ละคนนั้นไม่ได้เป็นเพียงตัวอย่างที่สมบูรณ์เท่านั้น","Scope and data date":"ขอบเขตและวันที่ข้อมูล","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"อัตราการจ่ายเงินสมทบของนายจ้างชาวนอร์เวย์จะกำหนดตามปีและแตกต่างกันไปตามโซนและกิจกรรม เครื่องคิดเลขนี้ประกอบด้วยอัตราที่เผยแพร่สำหรับปีภาษี 2026 ลงวันที่ 16 ตุลาคม 2026; ไม่ใช่การยื่นคำร้องอย่างเป็นทางการหรือการตัดสินใจทางกฎหมาย ตรวจสอบอัตราปัจจุบัน ตำแหน่งโซน คุณสมบัติ และเบี้ยเลี้ยงต่อองค์กรกับ Skatteetaten รุ่นหลังต้องรีเฟรชอัตราคงที่ที่ลงวันที่ หน้านี้ไม่ได้อัปเดตตัวเองในเบื้องหลัง","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"ทำงานในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ ตัวเลขเงินเดือนของคุณไม่ได้ถูกอัพโหลด","Estimate employer cost":"ประมาณการต้นทุนนายจ้าง","Related tools":"เครื่องมือที่เกี่ยวข้อง","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ฟรี · รันในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Language":"ภาษา","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"เครื่องมือทั้งหมด","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"ยอดรวมเงินเดือนรวมประจำปี NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"พื้นฐานการจ่ายวันหยุด NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"อัตราการจ่ายวันหยุด, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"ค่าตอบแทนและผลประโยชน์ที่ต้องเสียภาษีอื่นๆ NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"บัญชีเงินเดือนบำนาญ NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"อัตราเงินสมทบบำนาญนายจ้าง, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"ค่าใช้จ่ายอื่นๆ ที่นายจ้างจ่ายให้ NOK","Employer contribution zone":"โซนเงินสมทบนายจ้าง","Activity type":"ประเภทกิจกรรม","Ordinary activity":"กิจกรรมธรรมดา","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"เกษตรและการประมง (มีประกาศราคาพิเศษ)","Zone I — 14.1%":"โซน 1 — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"โซน Ia — 14.1% ธรรมดา / 10.6% เกษตรกรรมและการประมง","Zone II — 10.6%":"โซน II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"โซน III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"โซน IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"โซน IVa — 7.9% ธรรมดา / 5.1% เกษตรกรรมและการประมง","Zone V — 0%":"โซน V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"ค่าเผื่อส่วนต่างของโซน Ia ใช้ไปแล้วในปีนี้ NOK","Calculate estimate":"คำนวณประมาณการ","Reset inputs":"รีเซ็ตอินพุต","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"กรอกจำนวนเงินต่อปี จากนั้นเลือกโซนและกิจกรรมของนายจ้าง","Annual estimate":"ประมาณการรายปี","Gross payroll":"เงินเดือนรวม","Holiday pay estimate":"ประมาณการค่าจ้างวันหยุด","Other taxable pay and benefits":"ค่าตอบแทนและสิทธิประโยชน์ที่ต้องเสียภาษีอื่นๆ","Employer pension contribution":"เงินสมทบบำนาญนายจ้าง","Employer contribution basis":"เกณฑ์เงินสมทบของนายจ้าง","Employer national insurance contribution":"เงินสมทบประกันสังคมของนายจ้าง","Other employer-paid costs":"ค่าใช้จ่ายอื่นๆ ที่นายจ้างจ่ายให้","Estimated annual employer cost":"ค่าใช้จ่ายประจำปีโดยประมาณของนายจ้าง","Average monthly cost":"ค่าใช้จ่ายรายเดือนเฉลี่ย","Effective contribution rate":"อัตราการมีส่วนร่วมที่มีประสิทธิผล","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"ค่าเผื่อส่วนต่างที่ใช้ในสถานการณ์นี้","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"ค่าเผื่อคงเหลือสำหรับการประมาณการนี้","Tax year":"ปีภาษี","Rate source checked":"ตรวจสอบแหล่งที่มาของอัตราแล้ว","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"ตรวจสอบว่าทุกจำนวนเป็นจำนวนที่ไม่เป็นลบที่ถูกต้อง และทุกเปอร์เซ็นต์อยู่ภายในช่วง","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"เกณฑ์ 850,000 NOK เป็นแบบต่อองค์กร ไม่ใช่ต่อพนักงาน ป้อนจำนวนเงินที่องค์กรใช้ไปแล้วในปีปฏิทินนี้","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"โซนนอร์เวย์เป็นไปตามสถานที่ตั้งที่จดทะเบียนของนายจ้าง ใช้การค้นหาเขตเทศบาลของ Skatteetaten หน้านี้ไม่ได้อนุมานโซนจากภาษาของคุณ","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"อัตราค่าจ้างวันหยุดและเงินบำนาญเป็นข้อมูลการวางแผนที่แก้ไขได้ ใช้อัตราและฐานบำนาญที่ใช้กับสัญญาและโครงการของคุณ","No account or server upload is used.":"ไม่มีการใช้การอัพโหลดบัญชีหรือเซิร์ฟเวอร์","Compare a second offer":"เปรียบเทียบข้อเสนอที่สอง","Offer B":"Offer B","Offer comparison":"การเปรียบเทียบข้อเสนอ","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"ข้อเสนอทั้งสองใช้โซนนายจ้างและกิจกรรมที่เลือกด้านบน แต่ละทางเลือกจะใช้ค่าเผื่อโซน Ia ที่เหลือแยกกัน ทั้งสองสถานการณ์เป็นทางเลือกและต้องไม่รวมเข้าด้วยกัน","Offer A":"ข้อเสนอ A","Difference (B − A)":"ผลต่าง (B − A)"},"tl":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Norway Employer Cost Calculator","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay at Kontribusyon ng Employer","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Tantyahin ang taunang halaga ng suweldo sa Norwegian gamit ang 2026 na mga rate ng kontribusyon sa employer. Magdagdag ng holiday pay, pension, taxable pay at iba pang mga gastos na may malinaw na pagpapalagay.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Tantyahin ang taunang gastos ng employer sa Norway mula sa payroll, holiday pay, mga kontribusyon sa pensiyon at kontribusyon sa pambansang insurance ng employer (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Ano ang pumapasok sa pagtatantya?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Ipasok ang kabuuang taunang payroll, piliin ang rehistradong sona ng kontribusyon at uri ng aktibidad ng employer, pagkatapos ay magdagdag ng holiday pay, pension at iba pang kabayaran. Halimbawa, ang 1,000,000 NOK ng kontribusyon na batayan sa zone I ay nagbibigay ng 141,000 NOK ng kontribusyon ng employer sa 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Paano gumagana ang pagtatantya","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Ginagamit ng calculator ang na-publish na 2026 zone rate para sa ordinaryong aktibidad o agrikultura/pangingisda. Ito ay nagdaragdag ng ipinasok na holiday pay, nabubuwisang kabayaran at anumang kontribusyon sa pensiyon sa batayan ng kontribusyon. Para sa ordinaryong aktibidad sa zone Ia, ang 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance ay inilalapat sa halagang ipinasok bilang nagamit na sa taong ito. Ang mga resulta ay taunang pagtatantya sa pagpaplano; tinutukoy ng rehistradong lokasyon at aktibidad ng employer ang mga naaangkop na panuntunan.","Frequently asked questions":"Mga madalas itanong","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Kinakalkula ba nito ang take-home pay ng isang empleyado?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Hindi. Tinatantya nito ang mga gastos ng employer at kontribusyon ng employer lamang. Hindi nito kinakalkula ang withholding tax o mga bawas mula sa suweldo ng isang empleyado.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Aling sona ng kontribusyon ang dapat kong piliin?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Piliin ang zone na naaangkop sa rehistradong lokasyon ng negosyo ng employer, hindi sa wika o sariling bansa ng empleyado. I-verify ang munisipyo sa Skatteetaten bago umasa sa resulta.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Sapilitan ba ang 2% na kontribusyon sa pensiyon para sa bawat employer?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Hindi. Ang mga tungkulin sa pensiyon sa trabaho ay nakasalalay sa kung ang employer at manggagawa ay nakakatugon sa mga legal na kondisyon. Maglagay lamang ng halaga ng pensiyon kapag nalalapat ito sa iyong sitwasyon; maaaring mag-iba ang aktwal na scheme premium.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Awtomatikong kasama ba ang holiday pay at bawat gastos sa pag-hire?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Hindi. Ang rate at batayan ng holiday pay, pensionable payroll at iba pang mga gastos ay mga nae-edit na pagpapalagay. Ang insurance, payroll administration, mga espesyal na benepisyo, mga exemption at mga limitasyon ng indibidwal na empleyado ay hindi ganap na namodelo.","Scope and data date":"Saklaw at petsa ng data","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Ang mga rate ng kontribusyon ng employer sa Norway ay itinakda ayon sa taon at nag-iiba ayon sa sona at aktibidad. Ang calculator na ito ay naglalaman ng mga rate na inilathala para sa taon ng buwis na 2026, na may petsang 16 Oktubre 2026; ito ay hindi isang opisyal na paghaharap o legal na desisyon. I-verify ang mga kasalukuyang rate, placement ng zone, pagiging karapat-dapat at ang allowance sa bawat negosyo sa Skatteetaten. Dapat na i-refresh ng isang susunod na build ang napetsahan na mga static na rate; hindi ina-update ng page na ito ang sarili nito sa background.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Gumagana sa browser na ito. Ang iyong mga numero ng payroll ay hindi na-upload.","Estimate employer cost":"Tantyahin ang gastos ng employer","Related tools":"Mga kaugnay na tool","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"LIBRE · TATAKBO SA IYONG BROWSER","Language":"Wika","UsefulVerse":"Kapaki-pakinabang na Verse","All tools":"Lahat ng tool","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Kabuuang taunang kabuuang suweldo, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Base sa holiday-pay, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Rate ng holiday-pay, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Iba pang nabubuwisang bayad at mga benepisyo, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Pensionable payroll, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Rate ng kontribusyon sa pensiyon ng employer, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Iba pang mga gastos na binayaran ng employer, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Sona ng kontribusyon ng employer","Activity type":"Uri ng aktibidad","Ordinary activity":"Ordinaryong aktibidad","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Agrikultura at pangingisda (mga espesyal na nai-publish na rate)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Zone I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agrikultura at pangingisda","Zone II — 10.6%":"Zone II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Zone III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Zone IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agrikultura at pangingisda","Zone V — 0%":"Zone V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Zone Ia differential allowance nagamit na ngayong taon, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Kalkulahin ang pagtatantya","Reset inputs":"I-reset ang mga input","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Ilagay ang mga taunang halaga at piliin ang zone at aktibidad ng employer.","Annual estimate":"Taunang pagtatantya","Gross payroll":"Gross payroll","Holiday pay estimate":"Tantya ng suweldo sa holiday","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Iba pang nabubuwisang bayad at mga benepisyo","Employer pension contribution":"Kontribusyon ng pensiyon ng employer","Employer contribution basis":"Batayan ng kontribusyon ng employer","Employer national insurance contribution":"Pambansang kontribusyon sa insurance ng employer","Other employer-paid costs":"Iba pang mga gastos na binayaran ng employer","Estimated annual employer cost":"Tinantyang taunang gastos ng employer","Average monthly cost":"Average na buwanang gastos","Effective contribution rate":"Epektibong rate ng kontribusyon","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Differential allowance na ginamit ng sitwasyong ito","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Allowance na natitira para sa pagtatantyang ito","Tax year":"Taon ng buwis","Rate source checked":"Nasuri ang source ng rate","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Tingnan kung ang bawat halaga ay isang wastong hindi negatibong numero at ang bawat porsyento ay nasa saklaw.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Ang 850,000 NOK threshold ay bawat enterprise, hindi bawat empleyado. Ilagay ang halagang nagamit na ng enterprise ngayong taon ng kalendaryo.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Sumusunod ang mga Norwegian zone sa rehistradong lokasyon ng employer. Gamitin ang paghahanap sa munisipyo ng Skatteetaten; ang pahina ay hindi naghihinuha ng isang sona mula sa iyong wika.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Ang bayad sa holiday at mga rate ng pensiyon ay mga nae-edit na input ng pagpaplano. Gamitin ang rate at pensionable base na naaangkop sa iyong kontrata at scheme.","No account or server upload is used.":"Walang ginagamit na pag-upload ng account o server.","Compare a second offer":"Ihambing ang pangalawang alok","Offer B":"Alok B","Offer comparison":"Paghahambing ng alok","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Ang parehong mga alok ay gumagamit ng employer zone at aktibidad na pinili sa itaas. Ang bawat alternatibo ay inilalapat ang natitirang zone Ia allowance nang hiwalay; ang dalawang senaryo ay mga alternatibo at hindi dapat pagsamahin.","Offer A":"Alok A","Difference (B − A)":"Pagkakaiba (B − A)"},"tr":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Norveç İşveren Maliyet Hesaplayıcı","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Norveç İşveren Maliyet Hesaplayıcı 2026 — Bordro, Tatil Ücreti ve İşveren Katkısı","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 işveren katkı bölgesi oranlarını kullanarak Norveç'in yıllık maaş bordrosu maliyetini tahmin edin. Açık varsayımlarla tatil ücretini, emekli maaşını, vergiye tabi ücreti ve diğer maliyetleri ekleyin.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Norveç'teki maaş bordrosu, tatil ücreti, emeklilik katkıları ve işverenin ulusal sigorta katkısından (arbeidsgiveravgift) yıllık işveren maliyetini tahmin edin.","What goes into the estimate?":"Tahmini neler içeriyor?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Toplam yıllık maaş bordrosunu girin, işverenin kayıtlı katkı bölgesini ve faaliyet türünü seçin, ardından tatil ücretini, emekli aylığını ve diğer tazminatları ekleyin. Örneğin, bölge I'deki 1,000,000 NOK katkı payı, %14.1 oranında 141,000 NOK işveren katkısını verir.","How the estimate works":"Tahmin nasıl çalışır?","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Hesap makinesi, sıradan faaliyetler veya tarım/balıkçılık için yayınlanan 2026 bölge oranını kullanır. Girilen tatil ücretini, vergiye tabi tazminatı ve her türlü emeklilik katkısını katkı matrahına ekler. Bölge Ia'daki olağan faaliyetler için, işletme başına 850,000 NOK diferansiyel ödeneği, bu yıl halihazırda kullanıldığı şekliyle girilen tutara uygulanır. Sonuçlar yıllık planlama tahminleridir; işverenin kayıtlı yeri ve faaliyeti geçerli kuralları belirler.","Frequently asked questions":"Sıkça sorulan sorular","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Bu, bir çalışanın eve dönüş ücretini hesaplıyor mu?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Hayır. Yalnızca işveren maliyetlerini ve işveren katkısını tahmin eder. Çalışanın maaşından stopaj vergisi veya kesinti hesaplamaz.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Hangi katkı bölgesini seçmeliyim?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Çalışanın dili veya memleketi için değil, işverenin kayıtlı iş yeri için geçerli olan bölgeyi seçin. Sonuca güvenmeden önce belediyeyi Skatteetaten ile doğrulayın.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"%2 emeklilik katkısı her işveren için zorunlu mu?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Hayır. Mesleki emeklilik görevleri, işverenin ve işgücünün yasal koşulları karşılayıp karşılamamasına bağlıdır. Emeklilik oranını yalnızca sizin durumunuza uygun olduğunda girin; gerçek plan primi farklı olabilir.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Tatil ücreti ve her işe alım maliyeti otomatik olarak dahil ediliyor mu?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Hayır. Tatil ücreti oranı ve esası, emekliliğe tabi maaş bordrosu ve diğer maliyetler düzenlenebilir varsayımlardır. Sigorta, bordro yönetimi, özel avantajlar, muafiyetler ve bireysel çalışan limitleri tam olarak modellenmemiştir.","Scope and data date":"Kapsam ve veri tarihi","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Norveç işveren katkı payı oranları yıllara göre belirlenir ve bölgeye ve faaliyete göre değişiklik gösterir. Bu hesaplayıcı, 16 Ekim 2026 tarihli 2026 vergi yılı için yayınlanan oranları içerir; resmi bir başvuru veya yasal bir karar değildir. Mevcut oranları, bölge yerleşimini, uygunluğu ve işletme başına ödeneği Skatteetaten ile doğrulayın. Daha sonraki bir derlemenin tarihli statik oranları yenilemesi gerekir; bu sayfa arka planda kendini güncellemez.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Bu tarayıcıda çalışır. Maaş bordrosu bilgileriniz yüklenmedi.","Estimate employer cost":"İşveren maliyetini tahmin edin","Related tools":"İlgili araçlar","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ÜCRETSİZ · TARAYICINIZDA ÇALIŞIR","Language":"Dil","UsefulVerse":"Kullanışlı Ayet","All tools":"Tüm araçlar","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Toplam yıllık brüt maaş bordrosu, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Tatil ödeme esası, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Tatil ücreti oranı, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Diğer vergiye tabi ücret ve avantajlar, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Emekli maaş bordrosu, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"İşveren emekliliği katkı payı oranı, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"İşveren tarafından ödenen diğer maliyetler, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"İşveren katkı bölgesi","Activity type":"Etkinlik türü","Ordinary activity":"Olağan aktivite","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Tarım ve balıkçılık (yayınlanan özel fiyatlar)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Bölge I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Bölge Ia — %14.1 sıradan / %10.6 tarım ve balıkçılık","Zone II — 10.6%":"Bölge II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Bölge III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Bölge IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Bölge IVa — %7.9 sıradan / %5.1 tarım ve balıkçılık","Zone V — 0%":"Bölge V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Bölge Ia diferansiyel ödeneği bu yıl zaten kullanıldı, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Tahmini hesapla","Reset inputs":"Girişleri sıfırla","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Yıllık tutarları girin ve işverenin bölgesini ve faaliyetini seçin.","Annual estimate":"Yıllık tahmin","Gross payroll":"Brüt maaş bordrosu","Holiday pay estimate":"Tatil ücreti tahmini","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Diğer vergiye tabi ücret ve avantajlar","Employer pension contribution":"İşveren emekli maaşı katkısı","Employer contribution basis":"İşveren katkı esası","Employer national insurance contribution":"İşveren ulusal sigorta katkısı","Other employer-paid costs":"İşveren tarafından ödenen diğer maliyetler","Estimated annual employer cost":"Tahmini yıllık işveren maliyeti","Average monthly cost":"Ortalama aylık maliyet","Effective contribution rate":"Etkin katkı oranı","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Bu senaryoda kullanılan fark payı","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Bu tahmin için kalan ödenek","Tax year":"Vergi yılı","Rate source checked":"Oran kaynağı kontrol edildi","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Her miktarın negatif olmayan geçerli bir sayı olduğunu ve her yüzdenin aralık dahilinde olup olmadığını kontrol edin.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK eşiği çalışan başına değil, kuruluş başınadır. Kuruluşun bu takvim yılında halihazırda kullandığı tutarı girin.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Norveç bölgeleri işverenin kayıtlı konumunu takip eder. Skatteetaten'in belediye aramasını kullanın; sayfa dilinizden bir bölge çıkarmaz.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Tatil ücreti ve emeklilik oranları düzenlenebilir planlama girdileridir. Sözleşmeniz ve planınız için geçerli olan oranı ve emeklilik matrahını kullanın.","No account or server upload is used.":"Hiçbir hesap veya sunucu yüklemesi kullanılmıyor.","Compare a second offer":"İkinci teklifi karşılaştırın","Offer B":"Teklif B","Offer comparison":"Teklif karşılaştırması","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Her iki teklif de yukarıda seçilen işveren bölgesini ve faaliyeti kullanıyor. Her alternatif, kalan Ia bölgesi ödeneğini ayrı ayrı uygular; iki senaryo alternatiftir ve birbirine eklenmemelidir.","Offer A":"Teklif A","Difference (B − A)":"Fark (B − A)"},"uk":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Norway Employer Cost Calculator","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Норвезький калькулятор витрат роботодавця 2026 — Заробітна плата, відпустка та внесок роботодавця","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Оцінка річних норвезьких витрат на заробітну плату за допомогою 2026 зони внесків роботодавця. Додайте відпустку, пенсію, оподатковувану зарплату та інші витрати з чіткими припущеннями.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Оцінка річних витрат роботодавця в Норвегії із заробітної плати, відпустки, пенсійних внесків і внесків роботодавця на національне страхування (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"What goes into the estimate?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Введіть загальну суму заробітної плати за рік, виберіть зареєстровану зону внесків роботодавця та тип діяльності, а потім додайте відпустку, пенсію та іншу компенсацію. Наприклад, 1,000,000 NOK бази внесків у зоні I дає 141,000 NOK внесків роботодавця на рівні 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Як працює кошторис","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Калькулятор використовує опубліковану ставку зони 2026 для звичайної діяльності або сільського господарства/рибальства. Він додає введену відпустку, оподатковувану компенсацію та будь-які пенсійні внески до бази внесків. Для звичайної діяльності в зоні Ia до суми, введеної як уже використаної цього року, застосовується диференціальна надбавка 850,000 NOK на підприємство. Results are annual planning estimates; зареєстроване місцезнаходження та діяльність роботодавця визначають застосовні правила.","Frequently asked questions":"Часті запитання","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Чи розраховується заробітна плата працівника за собою?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"№ Він оцінює лише витрати роботодавця та внесок роботодавця. Він не розраховує утриманий податок або відрахування із заробітної плати працівника.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Яку зону внесків вибрати?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Виберіть зону, яка стосується зареєстрованого місця розташування підприємства роботодавця, а не мови чи країни проживання працівника. Перевірте муніципалітет у Skatteetaten, перш ніж покладатися на результат.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Чи є обов’язковим для кожного роботодавця пенсійний внесок 2%?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"№ Обов’язки щодо професійної пенсії залежать від того, чи відповідають роботодавець і працівники вимогам законодавства. Вводьте ставку пенсії лише тоді, коли це стосується вашої ситуації; фактична премія схеми може відрізнятися.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Чи включаються відпускні та всі витрати на найм автоматично?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"№ Ставка та основа оплати відпустки, заробітна плата для пенсійного забезпечення та інші витрати є припущеннями, які можна редагувати. Страхування, адміністрування заробітної плати, спеціальні пільги, звільнення та індивідуальні обмеження для працівників моделюються не повністю.","Scope and data date":"Обсяг і дата даних","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Ставки внесків норвезького роботодавця встановлюються за роками та відрізняються залежно від зони та діяльності. Цей калькулятор містить ставки, опубліковані за податковий рік 2026, датований 16 жовтнем 2026; це не офіційна заявка чи юридичне рішення. Перевірте поточні тарифи, розміщення в зоні, відповідність вимогам і надбавку на підприємство в Skatteetaten. Пізніша збірка повинна оновити датовані статичні показники; ця сторінка не оновлюється у фоновому режимі.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Запускається в цьому браузері. Дані вашої зарплати не завантажуються.","Estimate employer cost":"Оціночна вартість роботодавця","Related tools":"Пов’язані інструменти","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗКОШТОВНО · ЗАПУСКАЄТЬСЯ У ВАШОМУ БРАУЗЕРІ","Language":"Мова","UsefulVerse":"Корисний вірш","All tools":"Всі інструменти","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Загальний річний фонд валової заробітної плати, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Оплата відпустки, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Ставка відпускних, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Інші оподатковувані виплати та пільги, норвезькі крон","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Нарахування заробітної плати, норвезькі крон","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Ставка пенсійних внесків роботодавця, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Інші витрати, оплачені роботодавцем, норвезькі крон","Employer contribution zone":"Зона внеску роботодавця","Activity type":"Вид діяльності","Ordinary activity":"Звичайна діяльність","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Сільське господарство та рибальство (спеціально опубліковані тарифи)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Зона I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Зона Ia — 14.1% звичайний / 10.6% сільське господарство та рибальство","Zone II — 10.6%":"Зона II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Зона III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Зона IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Зона IVa — 7.9% звичайний / 5.1% сільське господарство та рибальство","Zone V — 0%":"Зона V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Диференціальна надбавка для зони Ia, яка вже використовувалася цього року, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Розрахувати кошторис","Reset inputs":"Скидання входів","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Введіть річні суми та виберіть зону та вид діяльності роботодавця.","Annual estimate":"Річний кошторис","Gross payroll":"Валовий фонд оплати праці","Holiday pay estimate":"Кошторис відпускних","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Інші оподатковувані виплати та пільги","Employer pension contribution":"Пенсійний внесок роботодавця","Employer contribution basis":"Основа внесків роботодавця","Employer national insurance contribution":"Внесок роботодавця на національне страхування","Other employer-paid costs":"Інші витрати за рахунок роботодавця","Estimated annual employer cost":"Орієнтовні річні витрати роботодавця","Average monthly cost":"Середньомісячна вартість","Effective contribution rate":"Ефективна ставка внеску","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Диференційна надбавка, яка використовується в цьому сценарії","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Залишок резерву для цієї оцінки","Tax year":"Податковий р","Rate source checked":"Джерело ставки перевірено","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Переконайтеся, що кожна сума є дійсним невід’ємним числом і кожен відсоток знаходиться в діапазоні.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Порогова сума 850,000 NOK для підприємства, а не для працівника. Введіть суму, яку вже використало підприємство в цьому календарному році.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Норвезькі зони відповідають зареєстрованому місцезнаходженню роботодавця. Використовуйте пошук муніципалітету Skatteetaten; сторінка не визначає зону з вашої мови.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Ставки відпускних і пенсій є редагованими вхідними даними для планування. Використовуйте ставку та пенсійну базу, які застосовуються до вашого контракту та схеми.","No account or server upload is used.":"Не використовується обліковий запис або завантаження на сервер.","Compare a second offer":"Порівняти другу пропозицію","Offer B":"Пропозиція B","Offer comparison":"Порівняння пропозиції","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Обидві пропозиції використовують зону роботодавця та діяльність, вибрану вище. Кожна альтернатива застосовує решту допуску зони Ia окремо; ці два сценарії є альтернативними і їх не можна складати разом.","Offer A":"Пропозиція A","Difference (B − A)":"Різниця (B − A)"},"ur":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"ناروے ایمپلائر لاگت کیلکولیٹر","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"ناروے ایمپلائر لاگت کیلکولیٹر 2026 - پے رول، چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ اور آجر کا تعاون","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"2026 آجر کنٹریبیوشن زون ریٹس کا استعمال کرتے ہوئے سالانہ نارویجن پے رول لاگت کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ واضح مفروضوں کے ساتھ چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ، پنشن، قابل ٹیکس تنخواہ اور دیگر اخراجات شامل کریں۔","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"ناروے میں آجر کی سالانہ لاگت کا اندازہ پے رول، چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ، پنشن کی شراکت اور آجر کی قومی بیمہ کی شراکت (arbeidsgiveravgift) سے لگائیں۔","What goes into the estimate?":"تخمینہ میں کیا جاتا ہے؟","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"کل سالانہ پے رول درج کریں، آجر کے رجسٹرڈ کنٹریبیوشن زون اور سرگرمی کی قسم کا انتخاب کریں، پھر چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ، پنشن اور دیگر معاوضہ شامل کریں۔ مثال کے طور پر، زون I میں شراکت کی بنیاد کا 1,000,000 NOK 14.1% پر آجر کی شراکت کا 141,000 NOK دیتا ہے۔","How the estimate works":"تخمینہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"کیلکولیٹر عام سرگرمی یا زراعت/ماہی گیری کے لیے شائع شدہ 2026 زون کی شرح کا استعمال کرتا ہے۔ اس میں تعطیل کی داخل کی گئی تنخواہ، قابل ٹیکس معاوضہ اور کسی بھی پنشن کی شراکت کو شراکت کی بنیاد پر شامل کیا جاتا ہے۔ زون Ia میں عام سرگرمی کے لیے، 850,000 NOK فی انٹرپرائز تفریق الاؤنس اس سال پہلے سے استعمال شدہ رقم پر لاگو ہوتا ہے۔ نتائج سالانہ منصوبہ بندی کے تخمینے ہیں۔ آجر کا رجسٹرڈ مقام اور سرگرمی قابل اطلاق قوانین کا تعین کرتی ہے۔","Frequently asked questions":"اکثر پوچھے گئے سوالات","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"کیا یہ ملازم کی گھر لے جانے والی تنخواہ کا حساب کرتا ہے؟","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"نہیں، یہ صرف آجر کے اخراجات اور آجر کی شراکت کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے۔ یہ ودہولڈنگ ٹیکس یا ملازم کی تنخواہ سے کٹوتیوں کا حساب نہیں لگاتا ہے۔","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"مجھے کنٹریبیوشن زون کا انتخاب کرنا چاہیے؟","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"وہ زون منتخب کریں جو آجر کے رجسٹرڈ کاروباری مقام پر لاگو ہوتا ہے، نہ کہ ملازم کی زبان یا آبائی ملک پر۔ نتیجہ پر بھروسہ کرنے سے پہلے سکیٹیٹیٹن کے ساتھ میونسپلٹی کی تصدیق کریں۔","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"کیا 2% پنشن کا حصہ ہر آجر کے لیے لازمی ہے؟","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"نہیں۔ پیشہ ورانہ پنشن کے فرائض اس بات پر منحصر ہیں کہ آیا آجر اور افرادی قوت قانونی شرائط کو پورا کرتے ہیں۔ پنشن کی شرح صرف اس وقت درج کریں جب یہ آپ کی صورتحال پر لاگو ہو۔ اصل اسکیم پریمیم مختلف ہو سکتا ہے۔","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"کیا چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ اور ہر ملازمت کی قیمت خود بخود شامل ہو جاتی ہے؟","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"No چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ کی شرح اور بنیاد، پنشن کے قابل پے رول اور دیگر اخراجات قابل تدوین مفروضے ہیں۔ انشورنس، پے رول ایڈمنسٹریشن، خصوصی فوائد، چھوٹ اور انفرادی ملازم کی حدیں مکمل طور پر ماڈل نہیں ہیں۔","Scope and data date":"دائرہ کار اور ڈیٹا کی تاریخ","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"نارویجین آجر کی شراکت کی شرحیں سال کے لحاظ سے مقرر کی جاتی ہیں اور زون اور سرگرمی کے لحاظ سے مختلف ہوتی ہیں۔ اس کیلکولیٹر میں ٹیکس سال 2026، مورخہ 16 اکتوبر 2026 کے لیے شائع شدہ شرحیں شامل ہیں۔ یہ کوئی سرکاری فائلنگ یا قانونی فیصلہ نہیں ہے۔ Skatteetaten کے ساتھ موجودہ نرخوں، زون کی جگہ کا تعین، اہلیت اور فی انٹرپرائز الاؤنس کی تصدیق کریں۔ بعد کی تعمیر میں تاریخ کے مستحکم نرخوں کو تازہ کرنا ضروری ہے۔ یہ صفحہ پس منظر میں خود کو اپ ڈیٹ نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"اس براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔ آپ کے پے رول کے اعداد و شمار اپ لوڈ نہیں کیے گئے ہیں۔","Estimate employer cost":"آجر کی لاگت کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Related tools":"متعلقہ ٹولز","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مفت · آپ کے براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔","Language":"زبان","UsefulVerse":"مفید آیت","All tools":"تمام ٹولز","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"کل سالانہ مجموعی تنخواہ، NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ کی بنیاد، NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ کی شرح، %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"دیگر قابل ٹیکس تنخواہ اور فوائد، NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"پنشن کے قابل پے رول، NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"آجر پنشن کی شراکت کی شرح، %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"دیگر آجر کے ادا کردہ اخراجات، NOK","Employer contribution zone":"آجر کنٹریبیوشن زون","Activity type":"سرگرمی کی قسم","Ordinary activity":"عام سرگرمی","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"زراعت اور ماہی گیری (خصوصی شائع شدہ نرخ)","Zone I — 14.1%":"زون I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Zone Ia — 14.1% عام / 10.6% زراعت اور ماہی گیری","Zone II — 10.6%":"زون II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"زون III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"زون IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"زون IVa — 7.9% عام / 5.1% زراعت اور ماہی گیری","Zone V — 0%":"زون V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"زون Ia تفریق الاؤنس اس سال پہلے ہی استعمال ہوا ہے، NOK","Calculate estimate":"تخمینہ کا حساب لگائیں۔","Reset inputs":"ری سیٹ ان پٹس","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"سالانہ رقم درج کریں اور آجر کے زون اور سرگرمی کا انتخاب کریں۔","Annual estimate":"سالانہ تخمینہ","Gross payroll":"مجموعی تنخواہ","Holiday pay estimate":"چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ کا تخمینہ","Other taxable pay and benefits":"دیگر قابل ٹیکس تنخواہ اور فوائد","Employer pension contribution":"آجر کی پنشن کی شراکت","Employer contribution basis":"آجر کی شراکت کی بنیاد","Employer national insurance contribution":"آجر کی قومی بیمہ شراکت","Other employer-paid costs":"دیگر آجر کے ادا کردہ اخراجات","Estimated annual employer cost":"تخمینی سالانہ آجر کی لاگت","Average monthly cost":"اوسط ماہانہ لاگت","Effective contribution rate":"مؤثر شراکت کی شرح","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"اس منظر نامے کے ذریعے استعمال شدہ تفریق الاؤنس","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"اس تخمینہ کے لیے باقی الاؤنس","Tax year":"ٹیکس سال","Rate source checked":"ریٹ سورس چیک کیا گیا۔","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"چیک کریں کہ ہر رقم ایک درست غیر منفی نمبر ہے اور ہر فیصد حد کے اندر ہے۔","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK تھریشولڈ فی انٹرپرائز ہے، فی ملازم نہیں۔ اس کیلنڈر سال انٹرپرائز کے ذریعہ پہلے سے استعمال شدہ رقم درج کریں۔","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"نارویجین زونز آجر کے رجسٹرڈ مقام کی پیروی کرتے ہیں۔ Skatteetateten’s Municipality lookup کا استعمال کریں۔ صفحہ آپ کی زبان سے کسی زون کا اندازہ نہیں لگاتا۔","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ اور پنشن کی شرح قابل تدوین منصوبہ بندی کی معلومات ہیں۔ وہ شرح اور پنشن کی بنیاد استعمال کریں جو آپ کے معاہدے اور اسکیم پر لاگو ہوتے ہیں۔","No account or server upload is used.":"کوئی اکاؤنٹ یا سرور اپ لوڈ استعمال نہیں کیا گیا ہے۔","Compare a second offer":"دوسری پیشکش کا موازنہ کریں۔","Offer B":"Offer B","Offer comparison":"مقابلہ کی پیشکش","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"دونوں پیشکشیں آجر کے زون اور اوپر منتخب کردہ سرگرمی کا استعمال کرتی ہیں۔ ہر متبادل بقیہ زون Ia الاؤنس کو الگ سے لاگو کرتا ہے۔ دونوں منظرنامے متبادل ہیں اور انہیں ایک ساتھ شامل نہیں کیا جانا چاہیے۔","Offer A":"Offer A","Difference (B − A)":"فرق (B − A)"},"vi":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"Máy tính chi phí sử dụng lao động của Na Uy","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"Công cụ tính chi phí sử dụng lao động của Na Uy 2026 — Tiền lương, tiền nghỉ lễ và đóng góp của nhà tuyển dụng","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"Ước tính chi phí tiền lương hàng năm của Na Uy bằng cách sử dụng tỷ lệ khu vực đóng góp của nhà tuyển dụng 2026. Thêm tiền nghỉ lễ, lương hưu, tiền chịu thuế và các chi phí khác với các giả định rõ ràng.","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"Ước tính chi phí hàng năm của người sử dụng lao động ở Na Uy từ tiền lương, tiền nghỉ lễ, đóng góp lương hưu và đóng góp bảo hiểm quốc gia của người sử dụng lao động (arbeidsgiveravgift).","What goes into the estimate?":"Điều gì có trong ước tính?","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"Nhập tổng số tiền lương hàng năm, chọn khu vực đóng góp đã đăng ký và loại hoạt động của người sử dụng lao động, sau đó thêm lương nghỉ lễ, lương hưu và các khoản thù lao khác. Ví dụ: 1,000,000 NOK trên cơ sở đóng góp ở khu vực I mang lại 141,000 NOK cho khoản đóng góp của chủ lao động ở mức 14.1%.","How the estimate works":"Cách hoạt động của ước tính","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"Máy tính sử dụng tỷ lệ vùng 2026 được công bố cho hoạt động thông thường hoặc nông nghiệp/đánh cá. Nó bổ sung thêm tiền lương nghỉ lễ đã nhập, tiền bồi thường chịu thuế và bất kỳ khoản đóng góp lương hưu nào vào cơ sở đóng góp. Đối với hoạt động thông thường ở khu vực Ia, trợ cấp chênh lệch 850,000 NOK cho mỗi doanh nghiệp được áp dụng cho số tiền đã nhập như đã sử dụng trong năm nay. Kết quả là dự toán kế hoạch hàng năm; địa điểm và hoạt động đã đăng ký của người sử dụng lao động xác định các quy tắc áp dụng.","Frequently asked questions":"Câu hỏi thường gặp","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"Điều này có tính toán tiền lương mang về nhà của nhân viên không?","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"Không. Nó chỉ ước tính chi phí của người sử dụng lao động và sự đóng góp của người sử dụng lao động. Nó không tính thuế khấu trừ hoặc các khoản khấu trừ từ lương của nhân viên.","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"Tôi nên chọn vùng đóng góp nào?","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"Chọn khu vực áp dụng cho địa điểm kinh doanh đã đăng ký của người sử dụng lao động, không phải ngôn ngữ hoặc quốc gia sở tại của nhân viên. Xác minh đô thị với Skatteetaten trước khi dựa vào kết quả.","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"Đóng lương hưu 2% có bắt buộc đối với mọi người sử dụng lao động không?","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"Không. Nghĩa vụ hưu trí nghề nghiệp phụ thuộc vào việc người sử dụng lao động và lực lượng lao động có đáp ứng các điều kiện pháp lý hay không. Chỉ nhập mức lương hưu khi áp dụng cho trường hợp của bạn; phí bảo hiểm chương trình thực tế có thể khác nhau.","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"Tiền nghỉ lễ và mọi chi phí tuyển dụng có được tự động bao gồm không?","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"Không. Tỷ lệ và cơ sở trả lương trong kỳ nghỉ, bảng lương được hưởng lương hưu và các chi phí khác là những giả định có thể chỉnh sửa được. Bảo hiểm, quản lý tiền lương, phúc lợi đặc biệt, miễn trừ và giới hạn cá nhân nhân viên không được mô hình hóa đầy đủ.","Scope and data date":"Phạm vi và ngày dữ liệu","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"Tỷ lệ đóng góp của người sử dụng lao động ở Na Uy được ấn định theo năm và khác nhau tùy theo khu vực và hoạt động. Máy tính này chứa các mức được công bố cho năm tính thuế 2026, ngày 16 tháng 10 2026; nó không phải là một quyết định nộp đơn chính thức hoặc pháp lý. Xác minh mức giá hiện tại, vị trí khu vực, tính đủ điều kiện và trợ cấp cho mỗi doanh nghiệp với Skatteetaten. Bản dựng sau này phải làm mới tốc độ tĩnh ngày tháng; trang này không tự cập nhật ở chế độ nền.","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"Chạy trên trình duyệt này. Số liệu bảng lương của bạn không được tải lên.","Estimate employer cost":"Ước tính chi phí của nhà tuyển dụng","Related tools":"Các công cụ liên quan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"MIỄN PHÍ · CHẠY TRÊN TRÌNH DUYỆT CỦA BẠN","Language":"Ngôn ngữ","UsefulVerse":"Verse hữu ích","All tools":"Tất cả công cụ","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"Tổng tiền lương gộp hàng năm, NOK","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"Cơ sở trả lương ngày lễ, NOK","Holiday-pay rate, %":"Tỷ lệ trả lương ngày lễ, %","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"Các khoản lương và phúc lợi chịu thuế khác, NOK","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"Bảng lương hưu trí, NOK","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"Tỷ lệ đóng góp lương hưu của người sử dụng lao động, %","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"Các chi phí khác do chủ lao động trả, NOK","Employer contribution zone":"Khu vực đóng góp của nhà tuyển dụng","Activity type":"Loại hoạt động","Ordinary activity":"Hoạt động thông thường","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"Nông nghiệp và đánh cá (giá công bố đặc biệt)","Zone I — 14.1%":"Vùng I — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Vùng Ia — 14.1% thông thường / 10.6% nông nghiệp và đánh bắt cá","Zone II — 10.6%":"Vùng II — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"Vùng III — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"Vùng IV — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"Vùng IVa — 7.9% thông thường / 5.1% nông nghiệp và đánh bắt cá","Zone V — 0%":"Vùng V — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"Phụ cấp chênh lệch Vùng Ia đã được sử dụng trong năm nay, NOK","Calculate estimate":"Tính toán ước tính","Reset inputs":"Đặt lại đầu vào","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"Nhập số tiền hàng năm và chọn khu vực và hoạt động của nhà tuyển dụng.","Annual estimate":"Ước tính hàng năm","Gross payroll":"Tổng bảng lương","Holiday pay estimate":"Ước tính lương ngày lễ","Other taxable pay and benefits":"Các khoản lương và phúc lợi chịu thuế khác","Employer pension contribution":"Đóng góp lương hưu của người sử dụng lao động","Employer contribution basis":"Cơ sở đóng góp của chủ lao động","Employer national insurance contribution":"Đóng góp bảo hiểm quốc gia của người sử dụng lao động","Other employer-paid costs":"Các chi phí khác do chủ lao động chi trả","Estimated annual employer cost":"Chi phí ước tính hàng năm của nhà tuyển dụng","Average monthly cost":"Chi phí trung bình hàng tháng","Effective contribution rate":"Tỷ lệ đóng góp hiệu quả","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"Phụ cấp chênh lệch được sử dụng trong kịch bản này","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"Phụ cấp còn lại cho ước tính này","Tax year":"Năm tính thuế","Rate source checked":"Đã kiểm tra nguồn giá","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"Kiểm tra xem mọi số tiền có phải là số không âm hợp lệ và mọi phần trăm đều nằm trong phạm vi hay không.","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"Ngưỡng 850,000 NOK dành cho mỗi doanh nghiệp, không phải cho mỗi nhân viên. Nhập số tiền doanh nghiệp đã sử dụng trong năm dương lịch này.","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"Các khu vực của Na Uy tuân theo địa điểm đã đăng ký của nhà tuyển dụng. Sử dụng tra cứu đô thị của Skatteetaten; trang không suy ra vùng từ ngôn ngữ của bạn.","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"Lương nghỉ lễ và tỷ lệ lương hưu là những thông tin đầu vào lập kế hoạch có thể chỉnh sửa. Sử dụng tỷ lệ và cơ sở có thể hưởng lương hưu áp dụng cho hợp đồng và chương trình của bạn.","No account or server upload is used.":"Không sử dụng tài khoản hoặc tải lên máy chủ.","Compare a second offer":"So sánh ưu đãi thứ hai","Offer B":"Ưu đãi B","Offer comparison":"So sánh ưu đãi","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"Cả hai ưu đãi đều sử dụng khu vực nhà tuyển dụng và hoạt động đã chọn ở trên. Mỗi phương án áp dụng riêng phụ cấp vùng Ia còn lại; hai kịch bản là những lựa chọn thay thế và không được thêm vào cùng nhau.","Offer A":"Ưu đãi A","Difference (B − A)":"Sự khác biệt (B − A)"},"zh":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"挪威雇主成本计算器","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"挪威雇主成本计算器 2026 — 工资、假期工资和雇主缴款","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"使用 2026 雇主缴款区费率估算挪威年度工资成本。在明确的假设下添加假期工资、养老金、应税工资和其他成本。","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"根据工资、假期工资、养老金缴款和雇主的国民保险缴款 (arbeidsgiveravgift) 估算挪威雇主的年度成本。","What goes into the estimate?":"估算包含哪些内容？","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"输入年度工资总额，选择雇主的注册缴费区和活动类型，然后添加假期工资、养老金和其他补偿。例如，I 区的缴款基础为 1,000,000 NOK，雇主缴款为 141,000 NOK，按 14.1% 计算。","How the estimate works":"估算如何进行","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"计算器使用已发布的 2026 区域费率进行普通活动或农业/渔业。它将输入的假期工资、应税补偿和任何养老金缴款添加到缴款基础上。对于 Ia 区的普通活动，每家企业的 850,000 挪威克朗差别津贴适用于今年已使用的输入金额。结果是年度规划估计；雇主的注册地点和活动决定了适用的规则。","Frequently asked questions":"常见问题解答","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"这是否计算员工的实得工资？","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"编号它仅估算雇主成本和雇主缴款。它不计算预扣税或员工工资的扣除额。","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"我应该选择哪个贡献区？","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"选择适用于雇主注册营业地点的区域，而不是雇员的语言或祖国。在依赖结果之前，请先与 Skatteetaten 核实该市政府的情况。","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"是否每个雇主都必须缴纳 2% 的养老金？","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"编号职业年金义务取决于用人单位和劳动者是否符合法定条件。仅输入适用于您的情况的养老金利率；实际的计划保费可能有所不同。","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"假期工资和所有招聘费用是否自动包含在内？","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"编号假期工资率和基础、应计养老金工资和其他成本是可编辑的假设。保险、工资管理、特殊福利、豁免和个人员工限额尚未完全建模。","Scope and data date":"范围和数据日期","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"挪威雇主缴费率按年份确定，并根据区域和活动而变化。该计算器包含纳税年度 2026 公布的税率，日期为 16 10 月 2026；这不是正式备案或法律决定。通过 Skatteetaten 验证当前费率、区域布局、资格和每个企业的津贴。以后的版本必须刷新过时的静态费率；该页面不会在后台自行更新。","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"在此浏览器中运行。您的工资数据未上传。","Estimate employer cost":"估算雇主成本","Related tools":"相关工具","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免费 · 在您的浏览器中运行","Language":"语言","UsefulVerse":"有用的诗句","All tools":"所有工具","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"年度工资总额，挪威克朗","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"节假日工资，挪威克朗","Holiday-pay rate, %":"假期工资率，%","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"其他应税工资和福利，挪威克朗","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"养老金工资，挪威克朗","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"雇主养老金缴款率，%","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"雇主支付的其他费用，挪威克朗","Employer contribution zone":"雇主贡献区","Activity type":"活动型","Ordinary activity":"普通活动","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"农业和渔业（特别公布费率）","Zone I — 14.1%":"I 区 — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Ia 区 — 14.1% 普通 / 10.6% 农业和渔业","Zone II — 10.6%":"II 区 — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"III 区 — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"IV 区 — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"IVa 区 — 7.9% 普通 / 5.1% 农业和渔业","Zone V — 0%":"V 区 — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"今年已使用 Ia 区差别津贴，NOK","Calculate estimate":"计算估算","Reset inputs":"重置输入","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"输入年度金额并选择雇主的区域和活动。","Annual estimate":"年度预估","Gross payroll":"工资总额","Holiday pay estimate":"假期工资估算","Other taxable pay and benefits":"其他应税工资和福利","Employer pension contribution":"雇主养老金缴款","Employer contribution basis":"雇主缴费基础","Employer national insurance contribution":"雇主国民保险缴款","Other employer-paid costs":"其他雇主支付的费用","Estimated annual employer cost":"估计的年度雇主成本","Average monthly cost":"平均每月费用","Effective contribution rate":"有效贡献率","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"此场景使用的差异津贴","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"此估算剩余的津贴","Tax year":"纳税年度","Rate source checked":"已检查费率来源","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"检查每个金额是否都是有效的非负数，并且每个百分比都在范围内。","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK 阈值是按企业计算的，而不是按员工计算的。输入企业本日历年已使用的金额。","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"挪威区域遵循雇主的注册位置。使用 Skatteetaten 的市政查询；该页面不会根据您的语言推断区域。","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"假期工资和养老金率是可编辑的规划输入。使用适用于您的合同和计划的费率和养老金基数。","No account or server upload is used.":"未使用帐户或服务器上传。","Compare a second offer":"比较第二个报价","Offer B":"报价B","Offer comparison":"报价比较","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"两个优惠均使用上面选择的雇主区和活动。每个替代方案分别适用剩余的 Ia 区津贴；这两种方案是可选的，不能叠加在一起。","Offer A":"报价A","Difference (B − A)":"差值 (B − A)"},"zh_tw":{"Norway Employer Cost Calculator":"挪威雇主成本計算器","Norway Employer Cost Calculator 2026 — Payroll, Holiday Pay and Employer Contribution":"挪威雇主成本計算器 2026 — 薪資、假期薪資和雇主繳款","Estimate annual Norwegian payroll cost using the 2026 employer contribution zone rates. Add holiday pay, pension, taxable pay and other costs with clear assumptions.":"使用 2026 雇主繳款區費率估算挪威年度薪資成本。在明確的假設下增加假期工資、退休金、應稅工資和其他成本。","Estimate annual employer cost in Norway from payroll, holiday pay, pension contributions and the employer’s national insurance contribution (arbeidsgiveravgift).":"根據工資、假期工資、退休金繳款和雇主的國民保險繳款 (arbeidsgiveravgift) 估算挪威雇主的年度成本。","What goes into the estimate?":"估算包含哪些內容？","Enter total annual payroll, choose the employer’s registered contribution zone and activity type, then add holiday pay, pension and other compensation. For example, 1,000,000 NOK of contribution basis in zone I gives 141,000 NOK of employer contribution at 14.1%.":"輸入年度薪資總額，選擇雇主的註冊繳費區域和活動類型，然後新增假期薪資、退休金和其他補償。例如，I 區的繳款基礎為 1,000,000 NOK，雇主繳款為 141,000 NOK，以 14.1% 計算。","How the estimate works":"估算如何進行","The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.":"計算器使用已發布的 2026 區域費率進行普通活動或農業/漁業。它將輸入的假期工資、應稅補償和任何退休金繳款添加到繳款基礎上。對於 Ia 區的普通活動，每家企業的 850,000 挪威克朗差別津貼適用於今年已使用的輸入金額。結果是年度規劃估計；雇主的註冊地點和活動決定了適用的規則。","Frequently asked questions":"常見問題解答","Does this calculate an employee’s take-home pay?":"這是否計算員工的實質薪資？","No. It estimates employer costs and employer contribution only. It does not calculate withholding tax or deductions from an employee’s pay.":"編號它只估算雇主成本和雇主繳款。它不計算預扣稅或員工工資的扣除額。","Which contribution zone should I choose?":"我該選擇哪個貢獻區？","Choose the zone that applies to the employer’s registered business location, not the employee’s language or home country. Verify the municipality with Skatteetaten before relying on the result.":"選擇適用於雇主註冊營業地點的區域，而不是員工的語言或祖國。在依賴結果之前，請先與 Skatteetaten 核實該市政府的情況。","Is a 2% pension contribution mandatory for every employer?":"每位雇主是否必須繳納 2% 的退休金？","No. Occupational pension duties depend on whether the employer and workforce meet the legal conditions. Enter a pension rate only when it applies to your situation; the actual scheme premium can differ.":"編號職業年金義務取決於雇主和勞工是否符合法定條件。僅輸入適用於您的情況的退休金利率；實際的計劃保費可能有所不同。","Are holiday pay and every hiring cost included automatically?":"假期薪資和所有招募費用是否自動包含在內？","No. Holiday pay rate and basis, pensionable payroll and other costs are editable assumptions. Insurance, payroll administration, special benefits, exemptions and individual employee limits are not fully modeled.":"編號假期工資率和基礎、應計退休金工資和其他成本是可編輯的假設。保險、薪資管理、特殊福利、豁免和個人員工限額尚未完全建模。","Scope and data date":"範圍與資料日期","Norwegian employer contribution rates are set by year and vary by zone and activity. This calculator contains the rates published for tax year 2026, dated 16 October 2026; it is not an official filing or legal decision. Verify current rates, zone placement, eligibility and the per-enterprise allowance with Skatteetaten. A later build must refresh the dated static rates; this page does not update itself in the background.":"挪威雇主繳費率按年份決定，並根據區域和活動而變化。計算器包含納稅年度 2026 公佈的稅率，日期為 16 10 月 2026；這不是正式備案或法律決定。透過 Skatteetaten 驗證當前費率、區域佈局、資格和每個企業的津貼。以後的版本必須刷新過時的靜態費率；該頁面不會在後台自行更新。","Runs in this browser. Your payroll figures are not uploaded.":"在此瀏覽器中運作。您的薪資資料未上傳。","Estimate employer cost":"估算雇主成本","Related tools":"相關工具","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免費 · 在您的瀏覽器中執行","Language":"語言","UsefulVerse":"有用的詩句","All tools":"所有工具","Total annual gross payroll, NOK":"年度薪資總額，挪威克朗","Holiday-pay basis, NOK":"假日薪資，挪威克朗","Holiday-pay rate, %":"假期工資率，%","Other taxable pay and benefits, NOK":"其他應稅薪資及福利，挪威克朗","Pensionable payroll, NOK":"退休金薪資，挪威克朗","Employer pension contribution rate, %":"雇主退休金繳款率，%","Other employer-paid costs, NOK":"雇主支付的其他費用，挪威克朗","Employer contribution zone":"雇主貢獻區","Activity type":"活動型","Ordinary activity":"普通活動","Agriculture and fishing (special published rates)":"農業和漁業（特別公佈費率）","Zone I — 14.1%":"I 區 — 14.1%","Zone Ia — 14.1% ordinary / 10.6% agriculture and fishing":"Ia 區 — 14.1% 普通 / 10.6% 農業與漁業","Zone II — 10.6%":"II 區 — 10.6%","Zone III — 6.4%":"III 區 — 6.4%","Zone IV — 5.1%":"IV 區 — 5.1%","Zone IVa — 7.9% ordinary / 5.1% agriculture and fishing":"IVa 區 — 7.9% 普通 / 5.1% 農業與漁業","Zone V — 0%":"V 區 — 0%","Zone Ia differential allowance already used this year, NOK":"今年已使用 Ia 區差異津貼，NOK","Calculate estimate":"計算估算","Reset inputs":"重設輸入","Enter the annual amounts and choose the employer’s zone and activity.":"輸入年度金額並選擇雇主的區域和活動。","Annual estimate":"年度預估","Gross payroll":"總薪資","Holiday pay estimate":"假期工資估算","Other taxable pay and benefits":"其他應稅薪資及福利","Employer pension contribution":"雇主退休金繳款","Employer contribution basis":"雇主繳費基礎","Employer national insurance contribution":"雇主國民保險繳款","Other employer-paid costs":"其他雇主支付的費用","Estimated annual employer cost":"估計的年度雇主成本","Average monthly cost":"平均每月費用","Effective contribution rate":"有效貢獻率","Differential allowance used by this scenario":"此場景使用的差額津貼","Allowance remaining for this estimate":"此估算剩餘的津貼","Tax year":"課稅年度","Rate source checked":"已檢查費率來源","Check that every amount is a valid non-negative number and every percentage is within range.":"檢查每個金額是否都是有效的非負數，每個百分比都在範圍內。","The 850,000 NOK threshold is per enterprise, not per employee. Enter the amount already used by the enterprise this calendar year.":"850,000 NOK 門檻是按企業計算的，而不是按員工計算的。輸入企業本日曆年已使用的金額。","Norwegian zones follow the employer’s registered location. Use Skatteetaten’s municipality lookup; the page does not infer a zone from your language.":"挪威區域遵循雇主的註冊位置。使用 Skatteetaten 的市政查詢；該頁面不會根據您的語言推斷區域。","Holiday pay and pension rates are editable planning inputs. Use the rate and pensionable base that apply to your contract and scheme.":"假期工資和退休金率是可編輯的規劃輸入。使用適用於您的合約和計劃的費率和退休金基數。","No account or server upload is used.":"未使用帳戶或伺服器上傳。","Compare a second offer":"比較第二個報價","Offer B":"報價B","Offer comparison":"報價比較","Both offers use the employer zone and activity selected above. Each alternative applies the remaining zone Ia allowance separately; the two scenarios are alternatives and must not be added together.":"兩個優惠皆使用上述所選的雇主區和活動。每個替代方案分別適用剩餘的 Ia 區津貼；這兩種方案是可選的，不能疊加在一起。","Offer A":"報價A","Difference (B − A)":"差值 (B − A)"}});
